Bharatiya sangit itihas ki sabai bhanda charchita ra bahumukhi gayika madhyeka Asha Bhosle Nepali sangit kshetr ka lagi pani uttikai mahatwapurna chhin. Matribhasha arkai bhayetapani unle dherai Nepali git haruma swar diyeki chhin. Jun euta bharsatail gayika ko saglo praman pani ho.

San 1943 ma Marathi film 'Majha Bal' bata suru bhayeko unko sangitik career le ek samayma Nepali sangitlaai thulo yogdan puryayeko chha. Ek kalma Nepali chalchitra kshetrma unko dabdaba jasto thiyo. Narayan Gopal, Ranjit Gazmer, Shambhujit Baskota, Kusum Gazmer, Tulsi Ghimire, Kiran Kharel, Yadav Kharel aadi sanga unle sahakary gareki chhin.

Yaha unle gayaka kehi Nepali git haru suchi raheka chan.

Saune Jharima... Ranjit Gazmer ko sangit ra Kusum Gazmer ko shabd raheko yo gitmama Bhosle le swar diyeki chhin.

Basant nai basna khojchha yaha... Aaj bhanda 6 dashak pahila baneko Maitighar film ko Maitighar... Maitighar... bolko git ahile pani uttikai lokapriya chha. Skul, kaleg ka karyakram tatha bibhinna samarohma yo git ghankinchha. Gitma Jaydev le sangit bhareka chan bhane shabd Kiran Kharel ko raheko chha.

Mohani lagla hai... Film Chino ma sanglagna yo gitma Asha Bhosle le swar samrat Narayan Gopal sanga aawaj share gareki chhin. Yo git pani uttikai matrama Nepali bich prakhyata chha. Gitma Ranjit Gazmer ko sangit ra Kusum Gazmer ko shabd raheko chha.

Pahadako mathi mathi... Film Lahure ko yo gitma pani Bhosle ra Narayan Gopal ko swar sunna sakinchha. Yasama Kusum Gazmer ra Tulsi Ghimire ko shabd chha. Sangit bhane Ranjit Gazmer ko raheko chha.

Ko hola mero mayalu... Film Mayalu ma sanglagna yo gitma pani Asha Bhosle le swar diyeki chhin. Yo gitma Ranjit Gazmer ko sangit ra Kusum Gazmer ko shabd raheko chha.

Aaj hamro bhet bhayeko din... Yo gitma Asha Bhosle ra Udit Narayan Jha ko swar raheko chha. Pachhilo samayma film Breakup ma samet featured yo gitma Shila Bahadur Moktan le sangit bhareka chan bhane Chetan Karki le shabd lekheka chan.

Maya ta maya ho... Yo gitma pani hamile Bhosle ra Narayan Gopal ko swar sunna sakchhau. Gitma Ranjit Gazmer ko sangit ra Kusum Gazmer ko shabd raheko chha.

Gairi khetko shirai hanyo... Yo git pani uttikai matrama sunincha. Bishesh gari yo git bidyalay haruma nachna ka lagi sunincha. Gitma Shambhujit Baskota le sangit bhareka chan bhane shabd Yadav Kharel le lekheka chan.

Yati dherai maya diyau... Yo gitma Asha Bhosle ra Prakash Shrestha ko duwal swar sunna sakinchha. Chetan Karki le shabd lekheko yo gitma Mohan Hari Singh le sangit bhareka chan.

Tada bhai nadeu feri... Film Mayalu ma sanglagna raheko yo gitma hamile Asha Bhosle ra Premdhwaj Pradhan ko duwal swar sunna sakchhau. Yo gitma Ranjit Gazmer ko composer raheko chha.

Asha Bhosle ko vyaktigat jeevan ra sangharsha

Kishori awasthaimai biwah, hridayabidakar mod ra punaragaman jasta anek utarachadhawale bhariyeko thiyo Asha Bhosle ko byaktigat jeevan. Sarsarti herda unko kaljayi aawaj ka pachhadi prem, bidroha, pida ra shaktile bhariyeko euta filmi katha nai painchha.

Aaj unai Bhosle 92 barsa ko umerma yas dharti bata sadaka lagi bida bhayin. Kehi mahinadekhi aswastha raheki unlaai Shanibar mutu ra swaspraswas sambandhi samasya dekhiepachhi Mumbai sthit Breach Candy aspatalma bharna gariyeko thiyo. Tara, uni aspatal bata pharkana sakinan.

Bhalai unle sansar chhadetapani unle sangit kshetrlaai diyeko yogdan sada atulaniya rahirahane chha. Hami Nepali harule unlaai samjhinuma pani bishesh karan chha. Hamile patak-patak sundai aayeka dherai kaljayi gitma unle swar bhereki chhin.

16 barsa kai umerma biwah

Asha Bhosle kahilyai pani niyam haruma badhina chahane byakti thin. Kishori awasthadekhi nai uni aaphnai nirnay lina ruchauthin. Aaphno yahi swabhawkai karan huna sakchha, 16 barsa kai umerma unle Ganpat Rao Bhosle sanga biwah garin, jo uni bhanda dherai jetha thie. Tyas samayma Ganpat Rao 31 barsa ka thie. Ra, uni Asha ki didi Lata Mangeshkar ko sachiv ko rupma kaam garthye.

Lata ko gharama bhairahane aawat jawat le Asha ra Ganpat Rao laai najik lyayo. Tyaso hunaale uniharu bich prem bhayo ra tyo sambandha chadai nai biwahma parinat bhayo. Tara, uniharu ko ukt nirnayma paribarle saath diyena.

Paribarik kalaha

Ganpat Rao sanga ko biwahlaai didi Lata Mangeshkar le nai swikar garnaai sakinan. Dherai pachhi Asha le yo kura khulasta pareki thin. Unka anusar biwah pachhi dui didibahini bich sambandhama thulo darar aayo. Yati samma ki uniharu bich lamai samaya bolchal samet bhayena. Yasari biwah kai paribar ma kalaha nimtiyo. Asha le aaphno paribar chhodayera eklaai naya jeevan suru garnuparyo.

Biwahle diyeko pida

Asha ra Ganpat Rao ka tin santan bhaye. Tara, uniharu sada sambandhama rahirahana sakenan. Samay sangai uniharu ko sambandhma tittata aayo. Antatah uniharu alag huna puge. Tyasle Asha laai bikshipta banayo. Tara kehi naya suruwat garne awasar pani banyo yo.

R.D. Burman sanga prem

Ganpat Rao sanga sambandha-bichchhed pachhi Asha le feri prem pain. Yas patak sangitkar R.D. Burman sanga unko prem basyo. Uniharu ko sambandha sangit ko madhyam bata pragadha baneko thiyo. Tara yas patak pani sambandhama chunauti haru thie. R.D. Burman biahi ta thie. Bibhinna awarodh ka bich uniharu le san 1980 ma biwah gare. R.D. Burman bhanda Asha 6 barsa jethi thin.

Uniharu ko baibahik jeevanma pani pachhi matbhed haru aaye. Yadyapi Asha ra R.D. Burman bhabnatmak rupma tada bhayenan. Sangitik sajhedari gardai garirhe. Tyasata sirjana gareka katipay git haru aja pani uttikai lokapriya chan.

14 bhanda badhi bhashama git

Asham achanmako kshamata thiyo. Unle Marathi film ka lagi git gayera career suru garin. Jeevan kal bhar 14 bhanda badhi bhashama git haru gain. Unle Nepali sahit Hindi, Urdu, Telugu, Bangali, Gujarati, Punjabi, Tamil, Russian, Malay, English lagayatka bhashama git gayeki chhin.

'Abhi na jao chhodkar, ye dil abhi bhara nahi...'

Aaj pratyek sangitpremi yahi bhawana byakt gariraheka chan, tara dukha ko kura yo chahana aba pura huna sakdaina.

Bharatiya sangit jagatma thulo dukha ko khabar aayeko chha, diggaj gayika Asha Bhosle aba yas sansarma rahinan. 92 barsa ko umerma unle antim saas lin. Uni hamibich nabhayepani unka sadabahar git harule unlaai sadhai jiwit rakhne chan.

Sangitik paribar ma janma

8 September 1933 ma Asha Bhosle ko janma sangit sanga jodiyeko paribar ma bhayeko thiyo. Unka buwa Pandit Dinanath Mangeshkar abhineta tatha shastriya gayak thie.

Uni swar kokila Lata Mangeshkar ki sani bahin i thin. Asha nau barsa ki huda unka buwako nidhan bhayo. Tyasapachhi parivar Pune bata Kolhapur ra pachhi Mumbai sareko thiyo.

Thulo didi ko paaila pachyaudai unle pani sangit kshetrma prabesh garin. Parivar chalauna duwai didi bahinile filmma git gauna thale. Asha le pahilo git Marathi film 'Majha Bal' (1943) ma gain.

Hindi filmma unko pahilo git 'Chunariya' (1948) ko 'Sawan aaya' thiyo. Yahi bata suru bhayeko yatra panch dashak bhanda badhi samaya samma chalyo.

Kathin pratispardha bich pahichan

1940 ko dashak ko antya ra 1950 ko suruwatma Geeta Dutt, Shamshad Begum ra Lata Mangeshkar jasta sthapit gayika haru bich unle aaphno sthan bana in. Suraka dinma unle dherai kam baje t ka film haruma git gain.

Sajjad Hussain ko sangitma baneko film 'Sangdil' (1952) le unlaai chinayo. Tyahi barsa unle 'Chham chhama chham' ma abhinay pani garin ra 11 madhye 10 git gain.

Tyasapachhi Bimal Roy le unlaai 'Parineeta' (1953) ma awasar diye. Raj Kapoor le 'Boot Polish' (1954) ka sabai git gauna lagayeka thie, jasle unlaai lokapriyata dilayo.

16 barsaima biwah, paribar sanga duri

Career suru hudai garda 16 barsa ko umermai unle bahini Lata Mangeshkar ka secretary Ganpat Rao Bhosle sanga biwah garin, jo uni bhanda karib 20 barsa jetha thie. Yo biwah paribar le swikarena, jas ka karan duwai bahin i bich duri aayo.

Pachhi unle ek antarwartama bhanin— pati paksh ko paribar rudhiwadi thiyo ra gayikalaai swikarna sakena. Garbhabati huda unlaai mait pharkina bhanio. Yo biwah lamai samaya tikena ra 11 barsa pachhi uniharu chhuttiye. Yas biwah bata unka tin santan bhaye.

R.D. Burman sanga dosro biwah

Pahilo biwah pachhi unko jeevanma feri prem aayo. Unle sangitkar R.D. Burman sanga biwah garin, jo uni bhanda 6 barsa kanchha thie. Suruma R.D. Burman ki aamale yo sambandha aswikar garin. Tara antatah 1980 ma uniharu ko biwah bhayo.

Yo jodi le sangitma dherai yadgar git haru diye. 1994 ma R.D. Burman ko nidhan samma uniharu sangai rahe.

20 bhashama 12 hajar git

Asha Bhosle ko career panch dashak bhanda lamai rahyo. Unle bibhinna yug ka diggaj sangitkar haru sanga kaam garin, jastai— Shankar-Jaikishan, Khayyam, Ravi, Sachin Dev Burman, R.D. Burman, O.P. Nayyar, Ilaiyaraaja, Bappi Lahiri ra A.R. Rahman.

Unle film matra hoina, album ra ekal git haru pani gain.

Sabai bhanda ullekhaniya kura — unle 20 bhanda badhi bharatiya ra bideshi bhashama git gain. San 2006 ma unle aaphai karib 12 hajar git gayeko batayeki thin. Uni 'Grammy Award' ka lagi namankan paune pahilo bharatiya gayika pani thin.

Tulsi Ghimire ko naya film 'Pahad' ko pradarshan miti ra visheshata

Kathmandu. Tulsi Ghimire ko naya film 'Pahad' ko marmasparshi trailer sarbajanik bhayeko chha. YouTube marta phat sarbajanik gariyeko trailer le gramin jeevan, sambandha ko bhabnatmak utarachadhaw ra pahad sanga jodiyeko manawiya sanwedanalaai kendrama raakheko sanket garchha. Kehi minet ko trailermai darshak laai bhabuk banaune drishya ra samwad prastut gariyeko chha, jasle film prati utsukata badhayeko chha.

Film aagami naya barsa 1 Baisakh 2083 (14 April, 2026) dekhi deshbyapi pradarshanma aaune tayarima chha. Nirmatale naya barsa ko awasar parera darshak laai pharak swadko kathabastu dine lakshya raakheko dekhincha.

Film ko kathanak prishthabhumi Nepali gramin samaj ra tyaha ko jeevanshaili sanga jodiyeko chha. Bishesh gari pahadi bheg ka manish ko sangharsha, basai sarai, parivar bhitrako sambandha ra samay sangai badlidai gayeko samajik yatharthalaai filmle sametne prayas gareko trailer bata jhalkinchha.

Nirdeshak Ghimire Nepali film udyog ka anubhavi ra sthapit naam hun. 'Darpanchhaya', 'Balidan', 'Chino' jasta saphal ra samjhanalayak film nirdeshan gareka unle sadhai manawiya katha ra samajik bishaylaai aaphno sirjana ko kendrama raakhtai aayeka chan. Unko film nirmad shaili bhabnatmak gahirai ra saral kathan ka lagi chinincha.

Yo filmma Madan Krishna Shrestha, Sunil Thapa, Shiv Shrestha, Bipin Karki, Rabindra Singh Baniya, Bharati Ghimire, Priyanka Karki, Arun Kshetri, Panchami Ghimire, Renunath Yogi, Uma Giri, Asha Poudel, Ankit Khadka, Hiuwala Gautam, Arun Regmi, Rehana K.C. ko abhinay chha.

Patkatha lekhan pani nirdeshak Ghimire kai chha. Rimpoche Thing, Surendra Thing, Ojaswi K.C., Uma Giri nirmata hun. Bollywood nirdeshak Pramod Pradhan le yasko chayankan gareka hun. Ranjit Gazmer le sangit bhareka chan. Venkates Entertainment ra Seven Seas International le yasko bitran gardaichan. Bhagyaratna Films Production ko banner ma film nirmad bhayeko ho.

Film 'Pahad' ko pahilo git 'Mohani Lagaune' sarbajanik

Kathmandu. Tulsi Ghimire nirdeshit film 'Pahad' ko pahilo git 'Mohani Lagaune' YouTube ma sarbajanik bhayeko chha. Git sarbajanik garna Somabar patrakar sammelan pani aayojana gariyeko thiyo.

'Mohani Lagaune' bolko gitma Ranjit Gazmer ko sangit chha. Nirdeshak Ghimire kai shabd samawesh gitma Bharati Ghimire, Sakar Aapte, Asmita Adhikari, Madan Krishna Shrestha, Bipin Karki ko swar samawesh chha.

Gramin parybeshama chayankan gariyeko yo git nrityapradhan ra mithasapurna lagchha. Gramin saundarya, dhan kamauna yuwale gaun chhadnuparne badhyata, sahar bhanda gaun upayukta raheko lagayatka sandesh gitma chha.

Gitma Bipin le rap gayan diyeka chan. Yo git sundaa hamilaai san 1990 ma release bhayeko Narayan Gopal ra Asha Bhosle ko git 'Mohani Lagla Hai' ko pani yad auchha. Sangitkar Gazmer le ukt charchita git ko bhaw jhalkaune gari yo git tayar pareka chan.

Gitle film ko kathabastu bare sankshipt prakash parchha. Filmma Madan Krishna Shrestha, Sunil Thapa, Shiv Shrestha, Bipin Karki, Rabindra Singh Baniya, Bharati Ghimire, Priyanka Karki, Arun Kshetri, Panchami Ghimire, Renunath Yogi, Uma Giri, Asha Poudel, Ankit Khadka, Hiuwala Gautam, Arun Regmi, Rehan K.C. ko abhinay chha.

Bhagyaratna Films Pvt. Ltd. ko banner ma nirmad bhayeko yo film 1 Baisakh, 2083 dekhi pradarshan tayarima chha. Dhan kamauna yuwa bideshida tyasle Nepal ka pahad kasari rittieka chan ra yasle lyaune samajik-sanskritik-arthik asarko katha filmma sametieko chha.

Sansadiya samachar: Upasabhamukh nirbachan, Hark Sampang ko anurodh, swakiya suwidako barta

27 Chait, Kathmandu. Pratinidhi sabha baithak suru bhayeko chha. Baithakma upasabhamukh pad ka lagi nirbachan ko tayari bhayeko chha.

Upasabhamukh ma Shram Sanskriti Party ki Rubi Kumari Thakur ra Raprpa ki Saraswati Lama ummedwar chan. Shram Sanskriti ki 25 barsiya Thakur le Bihibar Raswapa ko samarthanma ummedwari darta garayeki thin.

Pratinidhi sabhama Raswapa jhandai dui tihai bahumatma raheko Raswapa ko saath pauda Thakur upasabhamukh nirbachit hune pakka chha.

Nepali Congress le pani Thakur kai pakshma matdan garne janayeko chha.

27 Chait, Kathmandu. Shram Sanskriti Party ka adhyaksha Hark Sampang le sansadma samarthan janauda tebul nathokera tali bajaune naya abhyas ko suruwat garna aagrah gareka chan.

Shukrabar pratinidhi sabha baithakma upasabhamukh ma Rubi Thakur laai matdan garna aahwan garne kramma unle yasto batayeka hun.

"Alik anautho khaal ko bolincha. Ekachoti ma feri arko anurodh ke garna chahanchhu bhane aaudo dinma hamile tali thokda kasto hunchha hola?" Sampang ko anurodh thiyo.

Saathai, unle tebul kursi thokera samarthan garne shaili tyati ramro nadekhieko jikar gare.

"Khali hamile tebul kursi thokera, tubul kursimaathi chadhera yo pani alikati ramro dekhieko chhaina. Hamro dui hat chha, man lagda tali thokyo bhane kati ramro hola," Sampang le bhaneka chan.

Tyasapachhi kehi sansad le tali bajaayai unko prastawlaai samarthan gareka chan.

27 Chait, Kathmandu. Nepal Dairy Association le sarkari tatha sarbajanik karyakram haruma bideshi tatha kritrim 'soft drinks' ko satta mahi wa lassilaai 'swagat peya' ko rupma aniwarya garna sarkar sanga mag gareko chha.

Bholi Shanibardekhi manauna lagieko 'dosro rashtriya mahi dibas' ko purwasandhyama association le bigyapti jari gardai yasto mag gareko ho.

Yas barsa 'Mahiko bishwas, swasthyako bikas: gharghar ma phailaau abhiyan ko prayas' bhanne nara saith mahi dibas manaindai chha.

Association ka mahasachiv Hem Chandra Khanal le chiya wa kaphiko bikalpma shikshan sanstha, corporate karyalay ra aspatal haruma 'mahi-break' ko awadharana bikas garnuparne batayeka chan.

Yasle balbalika ra karmachari ko swasthyama sakaratmak sudhar lyaune association ko bishwas chha.

Association le sarkar ka tinai tahlaai aaphna sarbajanik karyakram, baithak ra bhoj haruma aayatit peya padarth prayog rokne niti banauna aagrah gareko chha.

Chitwan ko Ichchhakamana ra Kavre ko Mandandeupur jasta palika harule mahi prabardhanma gareko prayas ko prashansa gardai desh bharika 7 sai 53 watai sthaniya tahlaai yasko siko garna anurodh gariyeko chha.

Saathai, bidyalay ka cantin haru bata kritrim peya padarth bisthapit gari calcium ra probiotics ko mukh srot mahilaai sthan dinuparne ma jod diyeko chha.

Mahima calcium, protein ra lactic acid prashasta hune bhayekale yasle pachan pranali sudharne ra rog pratirodhatmak kshamata badhaune bigyaptima ullekh chha.

Haal bajarma jhandai dui darjan udyog marta phat dainik 25 hajar liter packaging mahi khabat bhairaheko ra aagami barsa bhitra yaslaai dobber banaune lakshya raakhiyeko association le janayeko chha.

Bideshi peya padarth ko ayat rokda barseni bahirine arbai rupaiya swadesh mai rahane ra gramin kisan le dudh ko uchit mulya paune bhayekale mahiko byabasayikata badhauna sarkar sanga sahuliyat ko samet mag gariyeko chha.

Theki ra Madani ko paramparagat sanskriti jiwant rakhna pani mahi abhiyan aawashyak raheko bataiyeko chha.

