Dosro rashtriya mahi dibas ka awasarma 28 Chait bihan 10:45 baje mahangariya traffic prahari karyalay Satdobato (Lalitpur) hudai upatyaka ka bibhinna sthanma nishulk mahi bitran garne karyakram chha.

Tyastai diuso 2:30 baje association ko Shankhamul sthit karyalayma patrakar sammelan tatha karyakram ko samapan garine janakari diyeko chha.

Association le 'swadeshi utpadan ko upabhog garau, atmanirbhar arthatantrama Tewa puryaau' bhanne mool marma aatmasaat gardai yo abhiyanma sahayog garna sampurna nagarik samaj ra sarokarwala laai apil gareko chha.

