Asha Bhosle: Euta yug ko antya

Bharatiya sangit ki adwitiy gayika Asha Bhosle hamibich rahinan. Unko nidhanle bharatiya upamahadwip matra hoina, bishwa sangit le euta yug gumaeko chha. 7 dashak bhanda lamai sangit yatrama hajau git marta phat unle jun wirasat chhodin, tyasko aabha hajarau barsa samma dipta bhairahanechha.

Unko prabhaw Nepalma pani gahiro chha. Unle Nepali film ra gitma swar diyeki chhan, jasle Nepali sangitlaai antrarashtriya swad sanga jodna madat garyo. Bishesh gari san 70/80 ko dashakma Nepali sangitma bharatiya sangitkar ra gayak sanga ko sahakary badhdai jada Bhosle ko swarle pani yaha sthan payo.

Unle gaeka kehi Nepali git aja pani bajirahanchan. Nepali film ka lagi unle diyeko swar le parshwagayanlaai uchaima puryayo. Tyasbela Nepali sangit udyog bikas kai kramma thiyo, tyasto awasthama Bhosle jasto antrarashtriya star ko gayika ko sahabhagita le Nepali parshwagayanlaai atmabishwas diyeko thiyo.

Unko yogdan git gaunuma simit thiyena, unle Nepali sangitlaai byapak darshak majh chinauna sahayog garin. Bharatiya radio ra cassette sanskritima unka git sangai Nepali git pani sunne watawaran baneko thiyo.

Sangharsha shil yatra ko katha

San 1933 ma Maharashtra ma janmieki Bhosle ko jeevan balyekal dekhi nai sahaj thiyena. Prasidha gayak tatha natakkar Pandit Dinanath Mangeshkar ki chori bhayekale sangit unko ragatmai thiyo. Tara balyekal mai pita ko nidhan bhayepachhi paribar ko jimmedari unko kandhma aayo. Tyahibata suru bhayo sangharsha ra atmanirbhar yatra ko katha.

Didi Lata Mangeshkar ko chhayama aaphno chhuttai pahichan banaunu tyati sajilo thiyena. Suraka dinma B-grade film ka awasar ra aswikar ko pida bata gujridai unle aaphulaai pramanit garin. Tara kahilyai haar manin. Samay sangai unle aaphno swarlai yati pharakilo banain ki shastriya, ghazal, pop, cabaret dekhi lokshaili samma sahjai gauna sakne bahuayamik gayika banin.

Unko yogdan bharatiya sangitma sankhyama hoina, gunastar ra bibidhatama pani atulaniya chha. Unle R.D. Burman, O.P. Nayyar jasta diggaj sangitkar sanga kaam gardai naya dhwani ra shailiko prayog garin. 'Piya tu ab to aaja', 'Dam maro dam', 'Chura liya hai tumne', 'In aankhon ki masti' jasta git le unlaai pustau pusta samjhanne banayo.

Unko aawajma ekaipatak pida, prem ra bidroha sabai abhibyakta hunthyo. Yahi karanle uni gayika matra hoina, euta bhabnatmak anubhab banin. Unle Hindi matra hoina, Bangali, Marathi, Gujarati, Punjabi, English lagayat 20 bhanda badhi bhashama git gayeki chhan.

Nepali sangit ra sanskriti bhane pachhi hurukkai

Bhosle le Nepali film ra gitma diyeko swar aja pani sangitpremi le samjhi rahanchan. Unle gaeka git hit matra bhayenan, Nepali shrota ko bhawana sanga gahiro rupma jodiye.

'Ma pyar bechidinchhu', 'Yati dherai maya diyau', 'Euta manche manparchha', 'Baiguni mayale', 'Gairi khetko shirai hanyo', 'Aja hamro bhet bhayeko din', 'Kin badhdai chha dhukadhuki', 'Diyo bali sanjhko', 'Saune jharima', 'Basant nai basna khojchha yaha', 'Pahadako mathi mathi', 'Mohani lagla hai', 'Timro manma lukeko kura' lagayatka Nepali git hit chan.

Yi gitma Bhosle le prem, birah, prakriti ra jeevan ka saral bhawalaai aaphno bishishta shailima prastut gareki chhan. Unko aawajle yi gitlai jiwit banayeko chha. Dherai git aja pani radio, sangitik karyakram ra dijital platformma sunna painchha.

Bhosle le Nepali sangitka thuprai pratishthit srashta sanga sahakary garin. Narayan Gopal, Prakash Shrestha, Shambhujit Baskota, Jaydev, Kiran Kharel, Ranjit Gazmer, Kusum Gazmer sahit sanga kaam gareki chhan. Yi sahakary le Nepali sangitma naya swad thape. Bharatiya gayan shaili ra Nepali shabd tatha dhun ko sanyojan le euta pharak pahichan banayo. Bishesh gari Ranjit ra Shambhujit jasta sangitkar sanga ko kamle aadhunik Nepali film sangitlaai uchaima puryauna madat garyo.

Bhosle le Nepallai sadhain sanskritik rupma najik ko desh ko rupma hereki thin. Unka lagi Nepal chhimiki desh hoina, sangit bujhne ra aatmasaat garne darshak bhayeko samaj thiyo. Unle Nepali shrota ko sangit prem, sanwedanshilata ra git prati ko lagaw ko prashansa garne garthin. 'Parde me rahne do, parda na uthao' gitko chayankan ra Kathmandu ma bhayeko pachhilo karyakramma auda unle yaha ko watawaran, manche ko urja ra aatithya bata aaphu prabhabit bhayeko batayeki thin.

Nepali sangit prati unko drishtikon sakaratmak thiyo. Nepali gitma maulikata, lokdhun ko gahirai ra shabd ko mithas raheko bataune garthin. Unko bujhaima Nepali sangit prakriti sanga jodiyeko chha - pahad, nadi, barsha ra gaunghar ka anubhuti gitma jhalkinchan. Yahi bisheshata le Nepali sangitlaai pharak banauchha. Unle samay sangai gunastar kayam rakhna, ramro shabd prayog garnu ra abhyas laai nirantarata dinuparne kurama pani jod deki thin.

Bhosle bharatiya gayika matra hoinan, bishwa sangit ko ek mahatwapurna naam hun. Unle bibhinna deshma concert garin, antrarashtriya kalakar sanga sahakary garin ra bharatiya sangitlaai bishwa manchma puryain. Unka git dakshin asia bata bahira pani uttikai lokapriya chan. Yahi karanle unlaai global icon ko rupma pani chinincha.

Narayan Gopal thie 'favourite singer'

Bhosle sanga Nepali film nirdeshak Tulsi Ghimire ka rochak kissa chan. Debut film 'Bansuri' ko gitma aawaj dina aagrah gardai Tulsi ra Ranjit Gazmer Mumbai pugeka thie. Asha Ranjit laai kancha bhanera bolauthin ra uniharu ko mitrata ramro thiyo. Ranjit ko chinjani batai Tulsi le Mumbai ko Western Outdoor Studio ma Asha sanga bhete ani filmma git gauna aagrah gare.

Studio bata bahira niskidai garda Asha laai Tulsi le bhete. Ranjit le chinaparachi garai diyepachhi Tulsi le git gauna approach gare. 'Kati paisa dinchhau' bhanera surumai Asha le aaphulaai bhaneko kshan Tulsi samjhinchan. Tyatibela Bharati pani sangai thin. Bharati ra Tulsi ko biwah bhai sakeko thiyena.

'Didi sano film banaaudai chhu' bhanera Tulsi le bhanepachhi 'Paisa kitna dega' bhanera Asha le thatta garin. Tyasapachhi Ranjit tartha herdai 'Kancha gana ready karo' bhanera bhanin. Tyasapachhi studio ko booking pani gare. 'Ani hami khushi bhayau. Uhako awaj Nepali filmma samawesh garnu euta milestone thiyo' Tulsi samjhinchan.

Asha le 'Bansuri' ka dui git gain - 'Mirmire sanjhama simasime pani' ra 'Jhajhal ko liyera ayechha sawan, feri aankhama'. Yi duwai gitma Asha le swar diin bhane Ranjit le sangit bhare. Tyasapachhi Tulsi ka aanya film haru 'Chino', 'Koseli', 'Lahure' ma pani Asha le swar diin.

'Uhaha Nepali laai saahrai maya garne legendary singer. Nepal ra Nepali laai saahrai maya garne' Tulsi samjhinchan, 'Uhaha laai manparne gayak Narayan Gopal hununthyo. Uhaharu le pahadako mathi mathi gitma pani sahakary garnubhayo.' Tulsi ka anusar Asha le Narayan Gopal ko swar, gayaki ra unko swabhaw ko khubai prashansa gareki thin. 'Ashaji Nepal ra Nepali laai khubai maya garne manche ho' Tulsi le samjhe, 'Nepali git bhane pachhi hurukkai. Uhaha aanya bhashaka git pani gaunubhayo tara, Nepal ko bhanepachhi uhaile nainasti garnubhayena.'

Bhosle ko nidhanle euta yug ko antya bhayeko anubhuti hunchha. Tara unka git haru kahilyai haraine chhaina. Unko swar ajhai radio ma bajirahanechha, naya pustale sunnechha ra purano pustale samjhinechha. Unle dekhaeko bato - sangharsha, mehanat ra samarpan - sadhain prerana ko srot rahanechha. Unko anupasthiti mahasus hunechha, tara unko aawaj sadhain hamro saathma rahanechha.

Bhosle ko jeevan naya pustaka lagi euta spashta sandesh ho - saphalta chhoto bato bata aaudaina. Unle nirantar abhyas, anushasan ra mehanat laai prathamikata diin. Samay sangai aaphulaai badaldai lagai pani aaphno pahichan gumaain. Aajka gayak gayikale unibata sikna sakne sabai bhando thulo kura yahi ho - bahuayamik hunu, tara maulikata jogaaunu.

Yash Kumar ko naya git 'Halka Halka' sarbajanik

Kathmandu. Gayak tatha abhineta Yash Kumar le naya git 'Halka Halka' ko music bhidiyo sarbajanik gareka chan.

Aayojit samarohma 'musical film' screening gariyo. Karyakramma film nirdeshak Tulsi Ghimire pramukh atithi ko rupma sahabhagi thie.

Nirdeshak Ghimire le Yash ko kaam garne tarika bata prabhabit bhayeko bataye. "Ma pani dherai samay pachhi Nepali sinema ko nirdesanma comeback gardai chhu. Tyas ka lagi pani maile aajako karyakramma sahabhagi bhayera dherai kura sikne awasar paye," unle bhanne.

Ghimire le gayika Smita Pradhan ko prashansa gardai bhanne, "Gayika Smita Darjeeling ko Kalimpong bata Kathmandu aayera gayanma jameko dekhda khushi lagyo. Uhako bhawishya ujwal dekhchhu."

Yash Kumar ko shabd rachana tatha sangit raheko git ko arrangement ra mixing Dewes Rai le gareka hun. Bhidiyoma pani Yash ra Smita le nai mukh bhumikama abhinay gareka chan.

Uniharu sangai Rajesh Ghatani, Dipendra Sonam, Sugat Karanjit, Tulasa Limbu ra Sudip Sonam ko abhinay chha. Nirdeshan Yash le gareka hun.

Hari Humagai ko chayankan raheko bhidiyoma Bikas Dhamala ko sampadan tatha color, makeup Tulasa Limbu ko chha.

Film 'Khushma' YouTube ma release

