Filmma Mao Tse Gurung, Raj Thapa Kaucha, Bijay Subba, Sujata Rai, Astitwa Bhattachan, Arun Magar, Raju Regmi Magar, Sangita Thapa lagayat kalakar ko abhinay chha.

Halma release ko ek barsa pachhi YouTube ma film aayeko ho. 'Khushma' byabasayik saphal banepachhi yasaka nirmatale naya film 'Jalaki' nirmad ko tayari thaleka chan.

Ravi-Balen bhet: Jenji utsahit

8 Poush, Kathmandu. Rashtriya Swatantra Party (Raswapa) ka sabhapati Ravi Lamichhane ra Kathmandu mahangarpalika ka mayor Balen Shah bichko bhetle Gen Z laai utsahit banayeko chha. Baikalpik shakti milnuparne dabab banaudai aayeka Gen Z Ravi-Balen ko Somabar ko wartapachhi utsahit dekhieka hun.

Raswapa kendriya sadashya Asim Shah ko music company ko karyalay raheko bhabanma Balen ra Ravi bich gayerat i karib 7 ghanta wartaa bhayeko thiyo.

Wartapachchi uniharu eutai gadima bahiriye ka thie. Karib panch ghanta Ravi ra Balen bich 'wan on wan' wartaa bhayeko pani srot le onlain khabar laai batayeko chha.

Rajnitik ekata ko grihakaryama bhayeko so wartaa laai liyera Gen Z haru utsahit dekhinchan. Tyasmaathi Ravi ra Balen bich pradhanmantri samma kai bandaphant ko kura mileko samachar le uniharu ekata najik raheko sanket dekhincha.

Ravi-Balen wartale aaphu haru utsahit ra aashabadi raheko bhanda da Council of Gen Z ka aguwa Sudan Gurung le aba Kulman Ghising laai pani jodna paye gajjab hune bataye.

"Aba ma aaphai le pani Ravi Lamichhane, Balen jyu laai bhetnuparchha, milnuparchha bhanera dabab diyeko hu. Maile matra pahal garera bhetayeko bhanda pani sahajikaran gareko hu," Gurung le onlain khabar sanga bhanne, "Aba yasma Kulman Ghising laai pani sangai ly aunuparchha. Tyati garepachhi man ali shanta hunchha."

Yadi Ravi, Balen ra Kulman haru ek thau ma aaye bhane aaphu haru pani sohi party ma jodine sambhawana prawal raheko sanket Gurung le gare.

"Yasari ek hunuparchha bhanera hamile nai yo kadam chalayeka hau. Pradhanmantri ma Balen hunuparchha bhanera hamile pani jodabal gariraheka chhau, kinabhane Ravi Lamichhane ko ta bibhinna 'case' chan ni ta! Tyasaile aba uniharu mile bhane tyahi party ma hami jodine sambhawana dherai chha."

Yinai Sudan le yasaghi Balen ra urjamantri Kulman Ghising bhetayeko dabi gareka thie. Kulman Ghising le 'desh banaune hakma hami sangai chhau' bhanera Balen sanga ko photo sarbajanik garepachhi unle yasto dabi gareka thie. Tyasapachhi Nakhkhu karagarmai pugera Ravi Lamichhane laai bhete ra baikalpik shakti ek hunuparne bishayama chhalphal gare.

Tyasabela nai Ravi bata sakaratmak pratikriya payeka Gurung le uni jel mukta bhayepachhi pani bhetera baikalpik shakti ek banaune bishayama sabai paksh sanga chhalphal garna dabab diye. "Maile mero matra pahal bhanne mildaina. Hami dherai ko sahajikaran, pahal ra dabab le pani yo course ma mahol bandai gayeko ho," Gurung le onlain khabar sanga bhanne.

Somabar ko bhetpachhi Ravi le pani baikalpik shakti ek hune bishayama chhalphal prarambh bhayeko bataudai yo samwadma urjamantri Kulman Ghising ra da Council of Gen Z ka aguwa Sudan Gurung sanga pani chhalphal garne batayeka chan. Yasari tibr gatima chhalphal haru agadi badhda aaphu haru utsahit raheko Gurung le batayeka chan.

Yasaghi bata Gen Z ka kehi samuhle baikalpik shakti ek garauna patak patak prayas gariraheka chan.

Gen Z andolan pachhi nai Kulman, Balen ra Ravi Lamichhane lagayatka shaktilaai milauna yiniharu le prayatna gareka thie. Tyasma Raswapa ki purwa neta Sumana Shrestha, Sagar Dhakal lagayatka yuwa pani samel thie.

Kulman Ghising le Ujyalo Nepal Party gathan garnupurwa pani yi samuhle sabailaai milaune prayatna gareka thie. Ukt party ko naam nai Ujyalo Nepal bhanda pani 'Nepal Jansewa Party' raakhera agadi badhne samma ko sahamati bhai sakeko thiyo.

Tara, antim ghadima aayera ukt naam ma sahamati najutepachhi Sumana Shrestha haru yas bata bahiri eka thie. Yi shaktilaai milauna surubatai prayatnarat Sudan Gurung samuha bhane antim samaya samma Kulman sangai thie.

Sohi party ma Balen le aaphno tarfa bata kehi naam kendriya sadashya ka lagi pathaune samma ka bishaya charchama thie.

Tara, antimma Balen pakshadhar pani yasma jodiyenan. Sumana Shrestha lagayatka yuwa pani Ujyalo Nepal ma rahana sahamat bhayenan. Tyasapachhi Sudan Gurung netritwako da Council of Gen Z ka pradesh sanyojak harule pani kendriya sadashyama tipaisakeko naam nikalna lagayeka thie.

Koshi pradesh sanyojak Uparjun Chamaling le bhane asahamati janayera suruwabatai kendriya sadashyama naam tipayeka thienan. Yas bahaek aanya sabai pradesh sanyojak le naam tipayepani antim ghadima Sudan Gurung kai sahamatima Ujyalo Nepal Party ko prastawit kendriya sadashya ko suchi bata naam jhikeka thie.

Yasapachhi Gen Z haru Balen Shah sanga samwad garna thale. Sudan najik Gen Z aguwaka anusar Balen laai kendrama raakhera party lyaunuparne bhanda aaphu haru sakriy bhaye. Baikalpik shakti ka lagi patak patak samwad gare. Yo samuhle Gen Z movement alliance, Gen Z front sanga samwad gareko thiyo.

Yata Gen Z front pani Raksha Bamlaai netritwa manera wa Ranju Darshana sahit laai liyera naya party banaune bhanne samma ko chhalphalma thiyo. Yo samuhle pani baikalpik shakti ka lagi sangharshat sabai paksh sanga chhalphal garna bhayayo. Anya Gen Z samuha pani sabai paksh sanga chhalphalma thie.

Tara, pani nichod niskieko thiyena. Sabailaai milaune Gen Z prayas le kunai nikas dinasakeko thiyena. Yahi bichma ekaiek Kulman ra Balen ko photo sarbajanik bhayo. Yo bhetghatlaai liyera Sudan Gurung le aaphno sahajikaranle balla sarthakata payeko aashayko tippani gare.

Tyasapachhi aba aaphule Ravi Lamichhane laai pani ek thau ma lyauna bhumika khelne bataye. Nabhandai Nakhkhu karagarmai pugera Lamichhane sanga unle bhet gare. Lamichhane bata sakaratmak lakshan payeka unle aba kunai halatma baikalpik shakti milauna lagi parne wacha gare.

Gen Z front ka aguwa Yujan Rajbhandari le baikalpik shakti ek hune bishayama bhayeko chhalphal ko prarambhlaai sakaratmak rupma hernuparne bataye. Euta baliyo baikalpik shakti ko aawashyakta deshma rahekale tyas tartha yas ka pramukh neta haru chhalphalma basnule aasha ko sanchar gareko unle bataye.

Tara, yasari ek hudai garda kewal ek arka bich talmel garne bhanda pani deerkhaalalaai herera bichar-siddhantma spashta bhayera agadi badhnu Yujan ko sujhaw chha.

"Yasari ek hudai garda process anusar agadi badhera deerkhaalena rupma shakti sthapit hune gari lagnuparchha. Bichar-siddhantma spashta bhayera agadi badhnuparchha," Yujan le bhanne, "Yadyapi, je bhayepani ahile yasari chhalphal prarambh hunu nai euta sukhada kura ho. Hamro samajlaai euta aasha chahiyeko chha. Nayaa haru ekthau aauda aasha ko sanchar bhayeko chha."

Yasari baneko naya dal ra samuha haruko gathabandhanle Gen Z ka mudda sthapit garna ra sarkar sanga ko samjhautalaai aatmasaat garera karyanwayanma jod dina pahal garnuparne unle bataye.

Yadyapi, yo chhalphal ko prarambh aaphaima nikai sakaratmak kura rahekale thapa tathya khuldai jada aaphu harule pani aawashyak nirnay line Yujan le bataye.

"Yasari baneko shaktima hami jodine-najodine bishayama pahila ta uhaharu ko mudda, agenda, bichar lagayatka kura herchhau. Tyasapachhi samuhma chhalphal garera yojana banauchhau. Yadyapi, rajnitik rupma agadi badhna baikalpik shakti sanga chhalphal garna hami sadhai sakaratmak chhau. Yo shaktile yuwa laai ramrai space dinchha bhanne apeksha pani chha," unle bhanne.

Gen Z aguwa Sanken Rai bhane ahile nai aashabadi bhayera nichodma pugihalne awastha naraheko batauchhin. Aam jantale Ravi ra Balen duwai laai aashabadi drishtile herepani aaphu harule bhane uniharu ko bhawishi rananiti, karyayojana, shaili ra aacharanlaai herera matra tippani garnasakne unle batanin.

"Tatkal ko lagi kehi nahunu bhanda yati hunulaai aashabadi bhayera herna sakiyela. Tara ahile nai yasbare tippani garna hatar hunchha. Uhaharu ko aacharan, karyashaili ra bichar lagayatka kura herepachhi thapa bolna sakinchha," Sanken le onlain khabar sanga bhanin, "Ma byaktigat rupma uhaharu duwai ko fan haina. Ke uhaharu sachchai best option ho? Jun tarikako karyashaili Balen ji ko chha, tyo shaili hamro jasto loktantrik deshma ramro ho? Yasari pani sochnuparla."

Yadyapi, pahila kai purana dal ka purana nai sattama pharkane kura bhanda yo baikalpik gathabandhan kehi ramro bhayeko swikardai unle thapa bhanin, "Aba uhaharu ko shaili herau. Ramro garda hamro saath sadhai hunchha. Nabhaye arulaai jastai aalochana nai garchhau."

Gen Z aguwa Khemraj Saud aam jantale aasha gareka baikalpik patra haru ek thau ma aauna samwad agadi badhayeko bishayle nikai utsahit banayeko batauchhan. Tyasmaathi yi shaktile Gen Z andolan ka mag ra bhaawanalaai sametne ra aaphno mandate karyanwayanma bhumika khelne bare khulera i bolirahekale pani jhan aashabadi raheko tarka unko chha.

Yasari naya shakti haru mildai garda Nepali rajnitima aasha ko sanchar pani bhayeko ra yasle frustrate nagarikma urja bhareko bishwas pani Saud le byakt gare.

"Uhaharu hamro mandatlaai manera, naya shakti ek bhayera purana harulaai parast garne bhanda samwadma hununchha, jun Gen Z andolan ko chahana pani ho. Tara aba yasma Kulman laai pani tannauparchha ra tin shakti ekthau hunuparchha bhanera thapa dabab hamile dairaheka chhau," unle bhanne.

Yadi wartaa sakaratmak bhayera tin shakti ek thau aaye aaphu haru pani tyasma jodine Saud le bataye. Gen Z ra sarkar bich bhayeka samjhautalaai karyanwayan garne sart yi shaktile mane aaphu haru jodina tayar raheko bataudai unle thape, "Hami jun dal (purana bahaek) ma jodi e pani aaphno mandate liyera janchhau. Tyo hubahu manera karyanwayanma saghaunaiparchha. Tyasaile uhaharu ko chhalphalma pani Gen Z ka mag ra mandatlaai manchhau bhanekale hami ajha sakaratmak ra utsahit chhau."

Congress ko kriyashil sadasyata bitran sambandhi 4 bundai paripatra

8 Poush, Kathmandu. Nepali Congress ka mahamantri Gagan Kumar Thapale party ko kriyashil sadasyata bitran ka lagi sahajikaran bhanda 4 bundai paripatra jari gareka chan.

Mangalbar sanjh sabai jilla laai sambodhan garera 4 bundai paripatra jari gareka hun.

"Naya kriyashil sadasyata 15 aau mahadhiveshan ko karyatalika anusar garnuparne ra naya sadasyata bitran Nepali Congress ko bidhan, niyamawali, kendriya karyasamitiko nirnay ra kendriya paripatra anusar sahaj ra byapak bitran garne party ko niti rahekale sohi anusar mapadanda samet pathaisakeko" paripatrama ullekh chha.

Rashtriya sabha nirbachan: Pradeshgat matbhar ra dal ko sthiti

8 Poush, Kathmandu. Aagami 11 Magh ma rashtriya sabha ko nirbachan hudaichha. Nirbachanma saataiwatai pradesh ka 550 pradesh sabha sadashya ra 753 sthaniya taha ka 1 hajar 506 pramukh tatha upapramukh matdata rahanchan. Uniharu ko matbhar bhane pharak-pharak hunchha.

Kul janasankhyalaai pradesh sabha ka kul sadashya le bhag garera pradesh sabha ko matbhar linchha ra tyaslaai punah ek hajar le bhag garda aaune bhagaphal ek pradesh sansad ko matbhar hunchha.

Rashtriya janaganana 2078 anusar Nepal ko janasankhya 2 karod 91 lakh 64 hajar 578 chha. Kul janasankhyalaai 550 le bhag garda 53026.50 hunchha.

Yaslaai punah 1000 le bhag garda 53.26 auchha. Yasari ek pradesh sansad ko matbhar 53 tay bhayeko ho.

Sthaniya taha ko kul sankhyalaai dui le guna gari tyasle kul janasankhyalaai bhag garera aaune parinamlaai feri 1000 le bhag garda aayeko bhagaphal sthaniya taha ko ek pratinidhi ko matbhar ho.

Yas anusar sthaniya taha ka janapratinidhi ko matbhar 19 hun auchha.

Rashtriya sabha sadashya ko rikta 19 madhye 18 pad ka lagi chunab hudaichha. Manonit sansad Bamdev Gautam ko thau ma bhane sarkarle arko byakti ko naam sifaris garnechha.

Baki 18 pad ka lagi chunab hunechha. Koshi pradesh bata 3 jana, Madhesh pradesh bata 4 jana, Bagmati ra Gandaki pradesh bata 2/2 jana, Lumbini pradesh bata 3 jana, Karnali ra Sudurpashchim pradesh bata 2/2 jana rashtriya sabha sadashya ka lagi nirbachan hunechha.

2076 Phagunma nirbachit bhayera aayeka rashtriya sabha sadashya haru bida huna lagayeka hun.

Koshi ma Emale baliyo, Sudurpashchim ma Congress

Pradeshgat matbhar niyald a Koshi ma Emale baliyo chha bhane Sudurpashchim ma Congress chha.

Koshi pradeshma 137 sthaniya taha ka 274 ra pradesh sabha sadashya 93 gari 367 matdata chan. Koshi pradeshsabhama Emale sab bhanda thulo dal chha.

Pradeshma Emale ka 40 Congress ka 29, Maobadi ka 13, Raprpa ka 6, Ekikrit Samajbadi ka 4 ra JSPA ka 1 pradesh sansad chan.

Palika pramukh ra upapramukh ma Emale ka kramashah 47 ra 63 garera 110 jana chan. Congress ka 69 ra 46 garera 115 tatha Maobadi kendra ko 12 ra 19 garera 31 jana chan.

Ekal pratispardha garne ho bhane Koshi pradeshma Emale baliyo chha. Tyasapachhi Congress ra tesroma Nekpa Maobadi kendra ra Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi milera baneko Nepali Kamyunis Party chha.

Sudurpashchim pradeshma bhane Congress baliyo chha. Sudurpashchim ma 53 pradeshsabha sadashya chan. 88 wata sthaniya taha ka pramukh ra upapramukh pani matdata chan.

Pradeshsabhama Congress 18 sit sahit thulo dal chha. Maobadi kendra 11, Emale ka 11, Nagarik Unmukti Party ka 7, Ekikrit Samajbadi ka 4 ra Raprpa ra swatantra ek/ek jana pradeshsabha sadashya chan.

Sthaniya taha tartha Congress ko pramukh 40 ra 46 upapramukh chha bhane Emale le pramukh ra upapramukh garera 50, Maobadi kendra ko 24 raheko chha.

Yo pradeshma Congress thulo dal chha. Emale dosro, Nekpa Maobadi kendra ra Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi milera baneko Nepali Kamyunis Party tesroma chha.

Pradeshsabhama Nekpa le Emale laai uchineta pani sthaniya tahma raheko Emale ko pramukh ra upapramukh ko sankhyale Emale laai samagra matbhar ma dosro sthanmai raakheko ho.

Rashtriya sabha sadashya ko nirbachanma thula tin dal bich ekla ekla i pratispardha hune ho bhane Congress agadi chha. Dosro ra tesroma raheka dal laai Nagarik Unmukti Party sahit ka sana dal harule saath dida samet Congress ko barabar matbhar hudaina.

Madhesh ma gathabandhan aniwarya

Madhesh pradeshma 107 pradesh sansad ra 136 sthaniya taha ka 272 pramukh ra upapramukh matdata chan.

Pradeshsabhama Emale ka 25, Congress ka 22, JSP Nepal ka 19, Janamat Party ka 13, Loktantrik Samajbadi Party (LSP) ka 9, Maobadi ka 9, Ekikrit Samajbadi ka 7, Nagarik Unmukti, Raprpa ra Sanghiya Samajbadi ka 1/1 pradesh sansad chan.

Madhesh pradeshma Congress agadi chha. Tyasapachhi Emale chha. Tesroma JSP Nepal chha. Chauthoma Nekpa Maobadi kendra ra Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi milera baneko Nepali Kamyunis Party chha. Tara, Congress, Emale ra JSP Nepal ko tulnama nikai pachadi chha.

Yo pradesh bata rashtriya sabha sadashya ko chunab jitna ka lagi thula dal harulaai pani sana dal haru sanga gathabandhan aniwarya garnuparne hunchha. Jasama JSP Nepal, Nepali Kamyunis Party, Janamat, LSP lagayatka dal haru nirnayak hunechan.

Bagmati ma Emale-Nekpa ustai

119 sthaniya taha raheko Bagmati pradeshma 110 sadashyiya pradesh sabha chha. Sthaniya taha ka 238 pramukh upapramukh tatha 110 pradesh sansad gari 348 matdata raheka chan.

Pradeshsabhama 37 sit sahit Congress pahilo dal chha. Emale ko 27, Maobadi ka 21, Ekikrit Samajbadi ko 7, Raprpa 13, Nemkipa ko 3, Hamro Nepali Party ka 2 pradesh sansad chan.

Sthaniya taha tartha Congress ka 108, Emale ka 60, Maobadi ka 57 pramukh/upapramukh chhan.

Bagmati pradeshma Congress agadi chha. Nekpa Maobadi kendra ra Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi milera Nepali Kamyunis Party banesangai Emale bhanda yo party kehi agadi pugeko chha. Tara, duwai ko matbhar ustai-ustai chha.

Gandaki ra Lumbini: Pratispardhama chhaina Nekpa

Gandaki pradesh sabha 60 sadashyiya pradeshsabhama chha. Jasama Congress 27, Emale ka 22, Maobadi kendra ko 8, Raprpa ko 2 pradesh sansad chan.

Yo pradeshma 85 sthaniya taha chan. Palika pramukh ra upapramukh garera 170 jana matdata hunchhan. Jasama Congress ka 67 Emale ka 68 jana chan. Maobadi kendra ka 30 jana chan.

Pradeshma dal gat aadhar ma Congress pahilo ra dosroma Emale chha. Tesroma raheko Nepali Kamyunis Party nikai pachadi chha ra ekla ekla i chunab huda yo party pratispardhama aauna muskil chha.

Nekpa ko sandarbhama Gandaki ma jastai awastha Lumbini ma pani chha.

Lumbini pradeshma 87 sadashyiya pradeshsabha chha bhane 109 sthaniya taha ka pramukh ra upapramukh 218 gari kul 305 matdata chan.

Pradeshsabhama 29 sansad sahit Emale sabai bhanda thulo dal chha. Nepali Congress ka 27, Maobadi kendra ra Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi milera baneko Nepali Kamyunis Party ko 12, Raprpa ra Nagarik Unmukti Party ka 4/4 jana, Janamat Party ra Loktantrik Samajbadi Party ka 3-3 jana, JSPA ko 2, JSP Nepal ko ek, Rashtriya Janmorcha ra Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi ka ek-ek jana raheka chan. Ek jana swatantra sansad raheka chan.

Yasaigari, sthaniya taha tartha Congress le 48 palika pramukh ra 44 upapramukh jiteko chha bhane Emale le kramashah 27 ra 40 tatha Maobadi le 25 ra 15 jiteko chha.

Lumbini ma Congress agadi

Lumbini pradesh ko matbhar ma Congress agadi chha. Dosroma Emale chha. Tesroma raheko Nepali Kamyunis Party nikai pachadi chha. Tatkalin Nekpa Maobadi kendra ra Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi sahit ka dal milera Nepali Kamyunis Party banesangai yo pradeshma sansadiya dal eutai banisakeko chha.

Karnali ma swatantra nirnayak

Karnali pradeshma 79 sthaniya taha raheka chan. Sthaniya taha ka pramukh ra upapramukh gari 158 ra pradeshsabha ka 40 sadashya gari 198 matdata raheka chan.

Karnali pradesh sabhama Congress ka 14 ra Maobadi kendra ka 13 sansad chan. Emale ka 10, Ekikrit Samajbadi ka, Raprpa ra swatantra ka 1/1 sansad chan.

Yasaigari sthaniya tahama Congress ka 32 pramukh ra 27 upapramukh chan bhane palika pramukh ra upapramukh ma gari Emale ka 35 ra Maobadi kendra ka 48 jana chan. Ekikrit Samajbadi ka 10 raheka chan.

Karnali ma Congress, Nepali Kamyunis Party ra Emale harahari ma chan.

Nekpa Maobadi kendra ra Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi milera Nepali Kamyunis Party banesangai Nekpa ra Congress harahari ma pugeka hun. Tesroma raheko Emale pani thorai matbhar le matrai pachadi chha.

Tin wata dal ekla ekla i chunab ladne ho bhane yo pradeshma swatantra nirnayak huna sakdachha.

Ekal bahumat arjan ko kasaratma Congress

11 Magh ko chunab bata Nepali Congress rashtriya sabhama bahumat najik pugne kasaratma chha. Yas ka lagi aanya dal sanga chunawi gathabandhan garda ke hunchha ra ekla i chunab lad da bhanne chhalphalma neta haru chan.

"Sthaniya tahama hamro ramro chha. Pradesh sabha ko sthiti samet ko aadhar ma aanya dal sanga gathabandhan garda kati sit jitna sakinchha ra ekla i chunab lad da ke hunchha bhanera antarik chhalphal chaliraheko" neta haru batauchhan.

Emale ka adhyaksha KP Sharma Oli le gat Magh 19 gate ra Somabar Congress sabhapati Sher Bahadur Deuba sanga bheteka thie. Yas bichma Nepali Kamyunis Party ka sanyojak Pushpa Kamal Dahal Prachanda le samet Congress sabhapati Deuba sanga bhet gareka chan.

Sabhapati Deuba ko sachivalay ka anusar Prachanda le Madhesh sarkar ko sandarbhama kura garda nai rashtriya sabhama samet sahakary ko prastaw raakheka thie. Tathapi, kunai nirnay wa jawaf sabhapati Deuba le nadiyeko unko sachivalayle janayeko chha.

Emale le samet rashtriya sabhama sahakary ko prastaw raakheko neta haru batauchhan. Congress bhane rashtriya sabhama ekal bahumat arjan garna sakinchha bhanne ma chha.

59 sadashyiya rashtriya sabhama haal Congress ka 16 jana sansad chan. Uniharu kohi pani aagami Phagun 20 ma bida hune chainan.

Aagami Phagun 20 ma bida hune rashtriya sabha sadashya haruma Emale ka 8 jana ra Maobadi kendra ka 7 jana chan. Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi, Loktantrik Samajbadi Party ra Janata Samajbadi Party Nepal ka 1/1 jana bida hudaichan. Manonit sansad Bamdev Gautam pani bida hudaichha.

Yaso huda nirbachan agadi rashtriya sabhama Congress ka 16 jana baki rahanchan.

Haal 17 sitma raheko Maobadi kendra ka 7 jana bida huda 10 jana baki rahanchan ra chunab jitera aauda thapine hun.

Haal 10 sitma raheko Emale ka 8 jana bida bhayepachhi 2 jana baki rahanchan. Jati naya jitera auchhan uniharu thapinchhan.

8 sadashya raheko Ekikrit Samajbadi ka 1 jana bida huda 7 jana baki rahanchan.

Nekpa Maobadi kendra ra Nekpa Ekikrit Samajbadi milera Nepali Kamyunis Party banaisakeko chha. Yasoh huda Nepali Kamyunis Party ko 17 sit yathawat rahanechha. Yasama kati thapinchhan wa thapindainan 11 Magh ko chunab pachhi thaha lagchha.

Haal 3 jana sansad raheko Janata Samajbadi Party Nepal ka 1 jana bida huda 2 jana baki rahanchan. Haal LSP ka ek jana uni bida hudaichan.

Yasto ankaganitma Congress le sana dal haruko saath liyera chunab ladne ki Emale wa Nepali Kamyunis Party sanga gathabandhan garne nirnay li sakeko chhaina.

Congress le ekla i chunab lade 18 watai sitma ummedwar uthauna sakchha. Sana dal ko matrai saath liye adhikatam sitma ummedwar uthauna saknechha.

Emale wa Nepali Kamyunis Party sanga gathabandhan garda sit bandaphadma bargaining hunechha. Kun modalma jane tay nabhayeko batauchhan Congress ka prabhakta Prakash Sharan Mahat.

Mahat le onlain khabar sanga bhanne, "Kura sabai sanga bhayeko chha. Sana dal sanga pani bhayeko chha. Emale ra Nepali Kamyunis Party sanga pani bhayeko chha. Karyabahak sabhapati le kurakani garirakhnubhayeko chha. Tara, yasaigari jane bhanne tungo lagisakeko chhaina."

Neta Mahat ka anusar Budhabar party ko karyasampadan samitiko baithak basdai chha. Ukt baithakma rashtriya sabha ko nirbachan ko sandarbhama chhalphal hunechha. "Karyasampadan samitiko baithakma reporting hola, samiksha hunchha ra euta nirnayma pugiyela" Congress prabhakta Mahat ko bishwas chha.

Raprpama mishra ko naam parsama pani sifaris

8 Poush, Kathmandu. Aagami 21 Phagunma hune pratinidhi sabha chunab ka lagi Rashtriya Prajatantra Party ka upadhyaksha Rabindra Mishra ko naam Parsa kshetr number 3 bata pani sifaris bhayeko chha.

Pratyaksh tartha Mishra ko naam Kathmandu kshetr number 1 bata pani sifaris ma pareko chha. Yas kshetr bata unko naam sifaris bhayepani party bhitra bibad utpanna bhayeko chha.

Parsa kshetr number 3 bata Mishra sahit 5 janako naam pratyaksh tartha ko ummedwar ka lagi sifaris bhayeko kshetr number 3 ka adhyaksha Narendra Prasad Chaurisaya le janakari diye.

Pratyaksh tartha Mishra sahit Angad Thakur, Nagina Kumar Yadav, Narendra Prasad Chaurasiya ra Dipesh Sah sifaris bhayeka hun.

Samanupatik antargat Madhesi mahila tartha bhane Priyanka Kumari Yadav ra Gudiya Devi ko naam sifaris bhayeko chha.

Yasaigari samanupatik antargat Madhesi purush bata Chandrika Sahani, Sujit Tripathi ra Mukesh Sah ko naam sifaris bhayeko chha.

Indonesia cricketer Gede Priyandana ko ekai overma panch wicket

8 Poush, Kathmandu. Indonesia cricket toli ka 28 barsiya daya hate pesa balar Gede Priyandana le T-20 antrarashtriya cricket ma ekai overma panch wicket liyera kirtiman banayeka chan.

Antarrashtriya cricket ma yo upalabdhi hasil garne uni pahilo kheladi baneka hun. Mangalbar Bali ma bhayeko Indonesia ra Cambodia bichko pahilo T-20 antrarashtriya khelma unle kirtiman banayeka hun.

Indonesia le diyeko 168 run ko lakshya pachyai raheko Cambodia 15 over pachhi 5 wicket gumaayera 106 run banayeko awasthama thiyo ra khelma jiwitai dekhinthyo.

Tara aaphno pahilo over balling garna aayeka Priyandana le chamatkarik pradarshan gare. Unle over ka pahilo tin balmai hatrik pura gardai tin batter laai aut gare. Tyasapachhi ek dot ball bhayo ra antim dui balma thapa dui wicket liye. Cambodia le tyo overma wide ko ek run (wide) matra jodna sakyo ra 60 runle parajit bhayo.

Yasaghi battingma Priyandana le opener ko rupma 11 balma 6 run banaye. Indonesia ka lagi wicketkeeper batter Dharma Kesuma le utkrishta pradarshan gardai 68 balma nataut 110 run banayeka thie.

Yasaghi purush T-20 cricket ma dui patak matra ekai overma panch wicket liyeko thiyo. Tara antrarashtriya T-20 ma yo pahilo patak bhayeko ho.

Yasaghi ekai overma chaar wicket line ghatana 14 patak bhayeko chha, jasama sabai bhanda charchit san 2019 ma Sri Lanka ka Lasith Malinga le New Zealand biruddha lagatar chaar balma chaar wicket liyeko ghatana ho.

