Sansad ra mantralay: Shaktiprithakikaran ko marm

Balen Shah netritwako sarkarle bharkhar aaphno kaam thaleko chha. Tyasaile yaslaai aashaka aankha harule herneharuko panktima hami pani chhau. Aaphna baicharik aagrah anusar kasailaai presle bolyo wa badhta bolyo bhanne lagayeko huna sakchha. Tara hami anawashyak uttejanma lagdaina. Samachar, bishleshan ra bichar haruma presle aaphno dharana raakhchha nai.

Yasai bichma mantralay ka kam haruma sahajikaran garna party ka sansad harulaai lagine Raswapa ko tayaripachhi malaai yo espresso banaune bichar aayo.

Bhanna ta yasta tippani garnuagadi 100 din ta kurau bhanne chalan chha. Tara Balen sarkar ani Raswapa aafai chaleko chalan bhanda bhinnai len bata aayekale uslaai kaamlagda kura sunauna sai din kurau bhanne lagen. Hami ajhai pani shraddhaka bela biralo bandhne linama ta kamtima hoina. Tyasaile yo espresso sarkar bhanda pani sansad haru tartha lakshit chha.

Raswapa ka party prabhakta Manish Jha le bataye anusar sansad harulaai paripatra garne tayari thiyo, ahile samma patra gayeko chhaina. Shayad chhalphal krammai hola.

Aba yasma dhyan dinuparne ke chha bhane, Raswapa ko niyat aaphaima kharab nahudo ho. Bishayabigyata ko aadhar ma sansad laai sambandhit mantralayma khataune, taki kehi sikdai garun. Bholi yinai sansad ta hun kunai pani bela mantri banna sakne.

Tara loktantrama niyat bhanda thulo niti hunchha. Raswapa ka priya sansad haru, byabasthapika karyapalika bichko spashta bhinnatalaai bujhna tapai haruko kartawya ho. Hijokale ke gare bhanera bhanibasne samaya chhaina, aba aaphule ke garne bhanne dayitwa pramukh ho.

Shaktiprithakikaran siddhant arthaat power separation theory le bhanchha – rajya ka tin mukh anga madhye byabasthapika pahilo ho, jaha tapai haru hununchha. Karyapalika, jasko netritwa sangha ma pradhanmantri Balen Shah le gardai chan. Nyayapalika, jasama haal Sapana Pradhan Malla kayamukayam pradhan nyayadhish chin. Yi tin prithak jimmedari bokeka sanstha laai ekapasama khaptina mildaina mildaina. Hudai humdaina.

Kin mildaina, thaha chha? Kinabhane sansad haruko kaam kanun banaune ho. Pradhanmantri karyalay ani sabai mantralay haruko kaam tyaslaai rajya ko shakti prayog garera lagu garne ho. Ra, adalat ko kaam kanun ko byakhya ra tyas ka aadhar ma aadesh garne ho.

Tapai haru madhye dherai jana learning attitude bahut bhayeko mananiya haru hununchha. Aba aaphna party ka neta sathi harulaai yo kura bujhaidinus. Feri aaphno priya party le bhanihalyo bhanera khurukka mantralayma sahajikaran garna jane hoina ni! Satta pakshma bhayepani tapai haruko kaam sarkar laai kehi bhannuparne bhaye sansad batai bhanne ho. Aaphno bigyata sansadmai dekhaaune ho. Mantralayma ta sarkarle tyatro karmachari khatayekai chha ni! Mantri ko sachivalay ra tim tyahin hunchha. Tapai haruko sara kaam sansadmai chha.

Mantralay gayera ke bichha ra, aaphnai party ta ho bhanda aaphno simarekha aliali michdai garne huda ta Congress, Emale, Maobadi yaham samma aipugeka hun. Yadyapi tinle pani sansad laai mantralayma chahin khataenan. Tinle arko kai kharab gare.

Euta udaharan ko samjhna dilauna man lagyo: tapai harulaai najik bigatko itihas thaha hola. Yaha ta sansad le aaphno maryada birsine huda asti samma ke ke bho? Karyapalika bhitrako jhagdako hissedar banne huda tatkalin Maobadi party ka tarfa bata tyasabela upasabhamukh baneki Onsari Ghati Magar ko chamber ma khursani kai dhulo lagayera samet lukaaye party najik ka sansad harule.

Kin lagayeko ta bhanda, sarkar sanga ko jhagda thiyo. Sansadma sattapaksh ka sansad laai khursani ko dhulo hanna re! Upasabhamukh bhaneko ta samwaidhanik ohoda ho ni, tyaha khursani bokera gaidine? Tara prem ra yuddha ma je pani sambhaw chha bhanda kamred harule jhandai bitaidine. Yasta ghatana dherai chan. Raswapa ta yasto party hoina hola, jaha bigat ka prawritiko namitho punarawritti hunchha.

Hami ta baru ke aasha garchhau bhane yo naya party ko nawajat sarkarle hamilaai ra Nepali samajlaai bilkul naya sanskar sikau chha. Tyasaile sattapaksh ko benchma base pani sansad haruko dayitwa byabasthapika bhitra nai simit hunuparchha. Tyas ka samiti haruma tapai haru kharo utrinuparchha.

Tapai ka kamle antatah sarkar ra Nepali rajya laai nai phaida pugne ho ni! Yi hernus ta, hami sarkar bhanda kati tada basera patrakarita garchhau, ke hamra kamle ahileko sarkar laai, yo desh ko byabasthalaai ani nagarik laai phaida pugdaina ta? Tyasaile saathi haru, mantralaylaai saghaunai parne bhayo bhane ki ta bishayabigyata kai aadhar ma tapai harule sidhai mantri pad lidine, hoina bhane sansad ko paribhashit kaamma 100 pratishat dhyan dine.

