Ag̅i maile anirbachit ko gherabandi kina bhaneko ho bhane, olisangai chunaaw pracharma gaeka kehi byaktiharuko naamai kiṭera yetibela matdatarharu unako alochana gariraheka chan. matdatarle olilai nirbachit gareka hun, tara sthanīya ko bishwas nai nabhaeka byaktiharuko waripari ghumera basnu bhane ka hoinan.
Tara oli tyasta byaktiharuko waripari kehi hapta wa mahina hoina, barsaum base. tyasai le jhapama yetibela ti anirbachitaruko hoina, swayam oli ko alochana bhairaheko cha. yo kura uni baḍo binayashil dekhi dai suniraheka chan. chunaaw ko mukhma olilai aaphno swabhaw biparit namra hunuparne badhyata cha. oli ko malin anuhar ka chheuchhau tinai anirbachitaru dekhinchan.
Charapalt pradhanmantri bhaeka olile jun samasya ahile jheldai chan, bholi kathamkadachit balen nirbachit bha e bhane tyastai samasya nadohori'ela bhanna sakindaina. kinabhane wigatma kathmandu mahanagar ko mayor chalaudai garda balenmathi karyalay ko aupcharik santrabata kam, niji ṭimabata badhta chaleko arop cha. unle anirbachitarusanga base ra kam garne parampara sthanīya taha batai suru garisakeka chan. upamayor, waḍadhyaksh, karmachariharusanga unako ṭhakṭhuk parinai rahyo. karyashaili ka karan samasya charkirahyo, tara samadhan khojne kam bhaena.
Parti neta ko rupma hos ya sansad ka rupma– balen aaphno ṭimabata chalchan. raswapa ko aupcharik karyasamiti ra balen ko sahayogi ṭima chhuttai dhangale chaleko spasht dekhna sakincha. raswapa ko samparka karyalayama balen ko matra tasbir cha, rawi ko chaina. yad rahos, raswapa ka kunai pani karyalayama rawi ko phoṭo anibarya hune garcha. tara balen ko samparka karyalayama rawi ko kunai tasbir dekhi̐daina. khās ta phoṭo nai rakhna parch bhanne kehi chaina, tara ekarkalai sakdo minimij garne gatibidhi bhane chunaaw kai mukhama pani dekhnu pariraheko cha.
Yas bichma parti sabapati rawi ra barishtha neta balen jasalai pradhanmantri nai prastawit gariyeko cha, uniharu bich ekdamai thorai matra samanway bhairaheko bujhiyeko cha. phagun 6 pachiko chunaaw prachar yojana, ani bachapatra nirmanbare dui netabich spashṭa samanway bhaeko jasto mahasus hudaina.
Byakti ekatira cha, bichar arkatira. ummedwar ekatira cha, parti arkatira. tasarth yo hamro rajnitik netritwa ko karyashaili ra sanskriti ko prashna pani bannuparcha. kinabhane ahile matdataraharu jhapama emale hoina, olisanga jawaf khojiraheka chan. raswapa hoina, balen ko upasthitisanga matlab gariraheka chan.


chunawapachhi oli wa balenmadhye kasle jitnechhan, wa aru nai kohi bijeta banlan ahile nai aakalan garnu ahile hataro ra aparipakwa hunchha. tara jasle jite pani anirwachit harubata gherine oli–balenko ustai ustai charitrale bhane haros.

27 chait, kathmandu. pratinidhisabhako upasabhamukh padma shram sanskriti partyki rubikumari thakur nirwachit bhayeki chhan.

shukrabar bhayeko nirwachanma raprpaki saraswati lamalai parajit gardai rubikumari nirwachit bhayeko sabhamukh dipi aryal le sabhalai jankari garaye.

rubikumari lai unko dal shram sanskritisangai sattarudha dal raswapa, nepali congress ra nekpako samarthan thiyo.

raprpale bhane ekal pratispardha gareko ho. nekpa emale le bhane yo nirwachanma bhag liyena.

aja sadanma 256 sansad upasthit thie. yimadhye le rubikumari lai upasabhamukh banaune pakshyama 229 jana le matadan gare. unako bipakshma 5 jana le matadan gare bhane 22 jana tatastha base. raprpaki saraswatiko pakshma jamma 5 mat khasyo.

27 chait, kathmandu. upasabhamukho shapat ko samay tay bhayeko chha. rastrapati karyalay shitalnibasle aaja saan 6 baje upasabhamukho shapat hunechha.

aja aparanha 4 baje pratinidhisabhako baithakle upasabhamukh chayan garnechha. upasabhamukh padko lagi 2 jana ummedwar le manonayan darta gareka chhan.

sattarudha dal raswapasahitko samarthanma shram sanskriti partyki rubikumari thakur ra raprpaki saraswati lama ummedwar chhan. rubi upasabhamukh banne pakkajastai chha.

27 chait, kathmandu. rastriya swatantra party (raswapa) le upasabhamukh ma shram sanskriti partyki rubi kumari thakur lai matadan garne nirnay gareko chha.

singhadarbarsthit raswapa sansadiya dal ko karyalay baseko sansadiya dal ko baithak le upasabhamukh ma thakur lai matadan garne nirnay gareko prwokta manish jhal le jankari die.

baithakma sahabhagi hun pradhanmantri samet raheka sansadiya dal ka neta balen shah, party sabhapati rabi lamichhane lagayat pugeka thie.

upasabhamukh ma shram sanskriti partyki rubikumari thakur ra raprpaki saraswati lama ummedwar chhan. shram sanskritiki 25 barsiya thakur le bihibar raswapako samarthanma ummedwari darta garaeki thin.

pratinidhi sabhama raswapa jhandai dui tihai bahumatma raheko raswapako saath pauda thakur upasabhamukh nirwachit hune pakka chha.

26 chait, kathmandu. pratinidhisabhako upasabhamukh padma 2 janako ummedwari pareko chha. raprpaki saraswati lama ra shram sanskriti partyki rubi kumari thakur ummedwar baneka hun.

raprpale ekal samarthak ra prastabak ma upasabhamukh padma ummedwari dieko chha. uta shram sanskriti partyki ummedwar rubi kumari lai bhane sattarudha dal raswapale pani samarthan gareko chha.

raprpaki lamako prastabak ma dal ka neta gyanendra shahi chhan bhane samarthak ma tahir ali, khushbu oli ra bharat giri chhan. shram sanskritiki rubiko prastabak party ka sansad aren rai chhan bhane raswapaka sansad ashokkumar chaudhary le samarthan gareka chhan.

upasabhamukh ma rubi kumari nirwachit hune lagbhag nishchitjastai chha. sattarudha dal raswapa sangai eklai jhandai dui tihai mat chha.

26 chait, kathmandu. raprpale upasabhamukh padma ummedwari dine tayari gareko chha. raprpaka ek neta ka anusar sansad saraswati lamalai ummedwar banaune yojana chha. lama raprpako samanupatik tarbata sansad baneki hun.

pratinidhisabha sabhamukh raswapa bhayeko le aaba sambaidhanik byabastha anusar phark dal ra lingako byakti upasabhamukh chahinchha.

tyasaile sansadma pratinidhitwa garne dal haru madhye anya thula dal lai raswapale samarthan nagarne sanket dekhaepachhi raprpaka neta harule raswapasanga samwad garirakheka thie.

yasaghi raswapa sabhapati rabi lamichhane ra raprpa sansadiya dal ka neta gyanendrabahadur shahi bich kurakani samet bhayeko thiyo. ‘aja pani kura bhayeko chha. raswapale samarthan garne sanket dieko chha’ raprpaka ek shirsh netale bhane, ‘hami partyma aaba chhalphal garera tunga lagaauchhau.’

pahilopati sansadma pravesh gareko shramsanskkriti partyle pani upasabhamukh ko manonayan pharam lageko chha. usle baicharik rupma nai raswapaprati sansad ahile batai nai kadda rupma prashna uthairaheko chha.

tyasaile raswapale shram sanskriti bhanda raprpalaai samarthan garne sambhawana dekhieko chha.

26 chait, kathmandu. nepali congress ra nekpa emale upasabhamukh padma ummedwari dine ki nadine bhanera chhalphalamma juteko chha.

emaleka sansad guruprasad baral ka anusar pratiipakshma raheka dal harusanga samwad bhairakheko chha. ‘upasabhamukh pratiipaksh ko adhikar ko bishay pani ho. yaskaran hami pratiipakshma raheka dalharusag samwadma chhau’, sansad baral le bhane.

unka anusar nepali congress, nepali kamyunis t party ra shram sanskriti partysanga samwad bhayeko chha. tara, kasari aghi jane bhanera tunga lageko chhaina.

emale le rastriya prajatantra party (raprpa) sanga samet samwadko pahal garirakheko chha.

nepali congresska sansad mohan acharyale pani aafu chhalphalmai raheko jankari die. ‘upasabhamukh ma ummedwari dine wa nadine ke bhayo’, bhanne prashnama unle bhane, ‘chhalphalmai chhau. kehiberama euta tungoma pugchhau.’

upasabhamukh padma ummedwari dine samay aaja bihana 11 baje dekhi diuso 2 bajesamma chha.

yasaghi nai raswapabata sabhamukh bhaaisakeko le upasabhamukh ma arko dal ko byakti hunuparchha. saathai, sabhamukh ma purush raheko le upasabhamukh ma mahila ummedwar hunuparchha.

26 chait, kathmandu. shram sanskriti partyka adhyaksh harkaraj rai (hark sampang) le upasabhamukh ko lagi nirwachan hune bataeka chhan.

‘upasabhamukh ko chunaw hunechha. chhalphal garnus, bargenin hoina’ unle samajik sanjalm ma lekheka chhan.

sanghiya sansad sachibalay ka anusar bihana 11 baje dekhi diuso 2 bajesamma manonayan darta ko samay chha. prapt ummedwar ko suchi prakashan aajai diuso sadde 2 baje hunechha.

bholi shukrabar nirwachan hunechha.

sabhamukh ma dolaprasad aryal nirwachit bhaaisakeka chhan. aaba upasabhamukh ma mahila sansad le matrai ummedwari dina pauchhan.

pratinidhisabha ma shram sanskriti partyka saat jana sansad chhan. tyasamadhye ambika debi sangraula, radhika ramtel ra rubi kumari mahila sansad raheka chhan.

24 chait, kathmandu. shram sanskriti partyka adhyaksh tatha pratinidhisabha sadashya hark sampang le darchulama tuin bisthapan garna bhanera chanda aawhan garepachhi dherai le antarartyiya simanma eklauti pul banna nasakne pratikriya janaye. darchula batai nirwachit pratinidhisabha sadashya ganesh thagunna le sampang le ‘stntabaji ra hawa kura gareko’ pratikriya janayeka thie.

Nepal sarkar purba sachib bhim upadhyay le antarartyiya nadima pul banauda kutniti, border surakchha, bhugol jasta kurama dhyan dinuparne batae. ‘yasta sambhab hudaai nahune kaamma pani hawa ko bhar ma kudeko ra aru haru pani bhawuk bhayera unkai pachhipachhi kudiraheko dekhdai chu. yasta kura bigyako sallamma garne ki aafai hawama bigya banne?’, samajik sanjal facebookma upadhyay le lekhe.

mangalbar darchula pugera sampang le jholungge pul ko shilanayas garichade. yasto kasari sambhab bhayo? ‘mananiyajyu le byas gaupalika ko wada nambar 2 sthit dumlingkathama pul ko shilanayas garnu bhayeko ho, jun nepal–bharat ko sima nadhi hoina,’ darchulaka pramukh jilla adhikari anil paudel le bhane.


mahakali nadima nabhayera ghatte kholama pul banna lageko byas gaupalika ka adhyaksh mangalsingh dhamile jankari die. sampangsangaai shilanyas garna dumling pugeka dhamile pahila kaathe pul raheko thauma pul banna lageko batae.

byas gaupalika-1 ka wadadhyaksh ashok byasi tyahako bhugol nabujhne harule mahakalimai pul banna lage jastari halla gareko batae. uni bhanchhan, ‘yahako bastabik bhugol thaha napaaune harule mahakali nadima hola bhanera halla gareka hun.’

darchulaka sansad thagunnale tyaha jholunge pul aawashyak rahe tara sampangle anawashyak prachar baji gareko batae. uni bhanchhan, ‘uhaan le garnu bhayeko pahal sakaratmak chha. desh bidesh ka nepali lai mahakalimai pul haalchhu, tuin bisthapit garchhu bhannu chahi stuntbaji ho.’

shram sanskriti party ka mahasachib aren raile bhane darchulaka jantalai sajaj hos bhanera swaichchhik sahayog aawhan garera jholunge pul banauna lageko batae. yasama aaphno partyko kunai swarth nabhayeko unko bhanai chha.

sampangle pani aaphno rajnitik swarth nabhayeko bataeka chhan. ‘darchulako pul banauda kunai kisimko rajnitik uddeshya rakheko chhaina maile, bhot nadida pani hunchha tyas bhegakale tara kasailai khutta tanne ra birodh garne nagarnu hola,’ unle facebookma lekheka chhan.

ek say 20 mitar lamau pul banauna karib ek karod lagat anuman gareko byans gaupalika ka nimitta pramukh prashasakiya adhikrit krishnanand badule jankari die. baduka anusar pul ko lagi sampangle palikasanga anumati samet lisisakeka chhan.

24 chait, kathmandu. shram sanskriti partyka adhyaksh harkaraj rai (sampang) le bikas simawarti kshetrma kendrit garnuparne aaphno manyata raheko bataeka chhan. uttar pashchim simanako darchula pugera sampangle pari bharatle dhamadham bikas garda wari nepali bhukam bhanne upekshama pareko bhandaai rastrabata baliyo banauna sima kshetrma bikas ramro hunuparne bataeka hun.

‘paripatti tu len bhanda dherai phor len ko bato indiyale banayeko chha. yastarph nepal sarkarle dhyan dinuparchha,’ sampangle bhane, ‘kinabhane ma chahi simawarti kshetrma bikas kendrit garnuparchha bhanne manyata rakhne manchhe ho.’

kathmandu, biratnagar, butwal, birganj jasta sahar ma bikas kendrit garera bairaheko unle batae. unle bhane, ‘aaba banne budget ma thoraima pani 60 pratishat gau kendrit budget banaunuparchha bhanne manyata ma rakhchhu. yo kura ma sansadma pani uthaune wala chhu.’

lipulek jane bato bharatle bato banayeko sthaniyale bhaneko unle bataeka chhan. ‘rastrasangha jasta nikayma gayera hamro simako chaar kila sunishchit garnuparchha bhanne pahilo maag maile sansadma rakhisakeko chhu. sambandhit kaamma nepal sarkarle dhyan dinuparchha,’ unle bhane.

darchulaka wikat gau dekhera aaphulai dukh lageko pani unle batae. ‘yahaan paripatti rati pani jhilimili hudo rahechha. yahaan wari chahi rati andhyaro hudo rahechha,’ sampangle aghi bhane. aaba mahakali nadibata bijuli nikalera nepal lai jhilimili parnuparne unle batae.

uta bikas ka kamle tiwrta liirahannda yata waripatti chupchap lagera basnuparne awasthako antya garnuparne unle batae.

23 chait, kathmandu. shram sanskriti partyka adhyaksh hark sampangle grihamantri sudhan gurung laai fewatal ko 20 ropani jaggar bara prashytauna sujhab dieka chhan.

fewatal ko 20 ropani jagga ma naam muchhiyepachhi unle samajik sanjal facebookmarphat grihamantri gurung laai jaggabare prashytauna sujhab dieka hun. ‘khas kura ke ho patrakar sammelan rakhihalnus,’ adhyaksh sampangle bhaneko chhan, ‘naitikatako sawal khada bhayo.’

unle fewatal ko jaggabare utheko sawal ko jawab na die jantale kura katne ra praharile pani grihamantrilai ternu chadne ullekh gareka chhan. ‘aaba yo sawal ko jawab nadine ho bhane jantale kura katchhan ra bishwas gardainan,’ sampangle lekheka chhan, ‘tapaai lai mandainan. praharile pani ternu chhadchan.’

kam garne manchheko khutta tatine ra kam garne kramma apajas paine samjhan dai un le pokhara ko fewatalma 20 ropani jagga grihamantriko naam ma raheko khabar le samajik sanjal tatda namajja lageko bataeka chhan.

adhyaksh sampangle aafule sadanma uthaeko jenji aandolan ra sahakari thagi prakaran mudda nabhul pani grihamantri gurung lai aagrah gareka chhan. ‘ajhai aghi badhnuhos shubhakamana chha,’ unle lekheka chhan, ‘tara, maile sadanma uthaeka duita mudda nabirsanu hola. ek, jenji aandolanko 24 gateko ghatnako doshilai karabahi. dui, jibi rai lai pakrera rabi daile nyaya dine.’

22 chait, kathmandu. shram sanskriti partyka adhyaksh hark sampang ka gat 17 gate aaphno facebookma lekhe- darchulama jada baikma hude na hai chituwa lagchha.’

lagattai chait 18 gate unko arko status aayo- darchulama pun banauna niskau hai shramadata ho. 24 gate shilanayas chha. gaphle desh bandaina, pasina bagauna tayar hau.’

dui din lagatar yasto lekheka sampang 19 gate pratinidhasabhako pahilo baithakma nai unle nepal ko sima ra rastriyatako bishay pravesh garaye.

darchulako nepali bhumi bharatle michyeko ra tyaha bharatiya pakshabata asahayog huda nepali harulai samasya pariraheko awasthabare jankara sampangle aabako aaphno mission darchulatarph kendrit garna khojeko chhan.

sudurpurba ko dharnama shramadan abhiyan chalayera tyasaiko balma rastriya rajnitiki manchma shaktisahit udaeka uni aaba sudurpashchimko uktam bhumi ma aaphno abhiyan laijana khojdai chhan. tyaha pul banaune shramadan ko yojana aghi saraeka chhan.

unka gatibidhi ra sansadko pahilo baithakma gareko sambodhanbata sanket milchha aaba uni aaphno rastriya ajenda rastriyatalai banauna khojdai chhan.

unle pahilo baithakma sambodhan garne kramma bigatma pani sansadma lamau bibadma pareko amerikasanga ko ameriki sahayog pariyojana mileniyam chyaleñji karporesan (emsisi) kampyakt ko kura uthaye.

unle uktam sahamata kharej hunuparne dharana rakhe. chhimiki mulukharuko gatibidhilaai nigarani garnuparne dekhi sanyukta rastrasanghma gayera nepal ko chaar kila yakin garnuparnesamma ka bishay uthaye.

pratinidhisabha baithakma sampangko dharana yasto thiyo:

prithwirahunjel yo desh rahirahanu pardachha. hamro deshko chandra–surya ankita jhanda rahirahanu pardachha. deshko swadhinata bhurajnitik santulan ra asanglan pararastra nitilaai bachai rakhna sainya rananiti uddeshyaka saath shuru gareko asamana rashtraghati byapar sandhi samjhauta emsisi laai kharej garnupardachha.

simawarti kshetrma chhimiki mulukharule gariraheko gatibidhi laai sakriya rupma nepal sarkarle nigarani rakhunupardachha. sanyukta rastra sangha lagayetka nikayharuma gayera hamro deshka chaar kila, kati ho hamro bhugol bhanne yakin garera simanako raksharth nepali senalai khataunu pardachha.

jhatta sundha kamyunis t partyko netako jasto lagne yo bhanaibata shram sanskriti partyko aagamii karyadisha kasto hunchha bhanne aankalan garna sakinne bishleshak haru batauchhan.

pradhyapak krishna pokharel adhyaksh sampangle swabhabik ra sakaratmak kura uthayeko batauchhan. nepali jantama bhayeko rastriyata sambandhi soch laai punjikrit garna khojeko huna sakne pokharelko bishleshan chha.

‘katisamma tikkchha thaha chhaina ahilesamma hark sampangko bichar ra byabahar ma tadyamta chha. yo rastriyatako kura pani bhannako lagi bhanne hoina sacho arthama uthainai ko lagi ho bhane yasto muddlaai jantale man parauchhan,’ pokharel bhanchhan.

chuchche naksa ra nakabandiko bela lieko adaan laai purba pradhanmantri kepi sharma olile punjikrit gareko samjhan dai pokharel bhanchhan, ‘tyasto mudda uthaune party le space banauna sakdachha.’

sampangle nirwachan agi nai uthaundai aayeko kuralai nai pratinidhisabha baithakma dohoryaeko bishleshak shyam shreshthako bujhai chha.

‘sampangle rastriyatako kura nirwachan agi nai gardai aayeka thie,’ shreshtha bhanchhan, ‘nepal jasto deshko lagi unle lieko niti nai thik chha. hoche minhle pani tyastai gareka thie.’

pratinidhisabha ma sampangle rakheko dharana ra shram sanskriti partyko ghoshana patrama birodhabhas dekhinna. yo party le ‘kunai pani samajik wa rajnitik bahanaharule deshko bhugol khandit hune desh tukrina dine chhainaun’ bhaneko chha.

ghoshanapatrama pani sima atikraman rokna senako prayog garne ullekh chha. bhaugolik akhandanta ra sima surakchha shirshakma bhaniyeko chha, ‘simanama senaa rakhi huna sakne sima atikraman rokinchha. deshko akhandanta chunauti dine ra simana atikraman garne khal ko kunai pani aantarik wa bahya gatibidhi laai rok lagainechha.’

shram sanskriti partyka mahasachib aren rai pratinidhisabha ma sampangle partykai niti ra nirnay anusarko dharana rakheko batauchhan. ‘adhyakshajyu le partykai adhikarik dharana rakhnu bhayeko ho. emsisi lagayatka deshko bishay ta hamro party le matrai hoina sabaile uthaunu parne hoina ra?,’ raiko prati prashna chha.

nirwachan lagattai sampangle nepal bharat simana pul banauna bhanera sahayog sankalan shuru gareka thie. unle sahayog maagdai facebookma lekheka thie, ‘darchulako tuin ko sato jholunge pul banaune ghoshana anurup ru. 10 dekhimathi jati sahayog garna chahanuhunchha, sahayog garnu hola.’

sima nadima pul banauna sahayog sankalan bhairaheko mahasachib raile jankari die. swechchhik sahayog uthayeko ra chhittai pul ko shilanayas hune unle batae. ‘adhyakshajyubata pul ko shilanayas garne tayarima chhau,’ khotangbata pratinidhisabha sadashyama nirwachit raile onlinekhabarsanga bhane.

pradhyapak pokharel sansadma sankhya jati bhayepani sampangle paripakwa rajneeti garne dekhieko batauchhan. uni bhanchhan, ‘hamro jasto dui wata deshko chepuwama pareko mulukma rastriyatako mudda sanwedanshil ra sabaiko chasako bishay hunchha.’

7 magh, kathmandu. nepal deri esiyesiyanko 27au warsik sadharan sabha, sthapana diwas tatha nawau rastriya mahadhibeshanbata prahlad dahal ko adhyakshyatama naya karyasamiti nirbirodh nirwachit bhayeko chha.

esiyesiyan mahadhibeshanle dahalalai punah aagamii karyakaal ko lagi sarbasammat adhyaksh chayan gareko ho.

nirwachan samiti sanyojak prahlad mahat ka anusar naya karyasamitiko barishtha upadhyakshma deepaprasad dhamala, upadhyakshma manojkumar yadav, yogendra chimauriya, karnabahadur hamal, manojkumar ghimire, dayaram bhandari ra rambhakta dahal nirwachit bhayeka chhan.

tyasaigari mahasachibma hemchandra khanal, sachib shivahari aacharya, koshadhyaksh shivalal bhusal, upamahasachib bijayaprasad chaurasiya, sahasachib ramesh sanjel ra sahakoshadhyakshma aashishkumar bu dhathoki chayan bhayeka chhan.

