27 chait, kathmandu. sarkarle upabhokta laai rahat din bhandaai petroliyam padarthma lagdai aayeko karm a 50 pratishat chhut dieko dui din nabitdai nepal aayal nigamle indhan mulyama achakli briddhi gareko chha.

24 chaitma pradhanmantri balendra shah ko adhyakshyama basheko mantriparishad baithakko nirnay sarbajanik gardai sanghiya mamila tatha samanya prashasan mantri pratibha rawal le petroliyam padarthma lagdai aayeko karm a 50 pratishat chhut dieko sunaeki thin.

‘sarkar parardarshi chha, tathya lukaaudaina ra jantako pida pani bujhchha,’ unle nirnay sunaundai bhaneki thin, ‘sab bhanda dherai kar lagne shirshakbata 50 pratishat katauti garda mulya niyantranma sahayog pugne apekchha chha.’

sarkarko yo nirnay sunera upabhoktale petroliyam padarthko mulya ghatne ra kehi rahat paune aasha gareka thie.

mulya ghatne aashama baseka upabhoktalaai nigamle ultai madhyaratdekhi lagu hune gari indhan ko mulyama bhari briddhi garera mahangiko maar ma pareko chha.

nigamko yo nirnaypachhi sarkarle jantalaai sankat ko awasthama rahat dinuparchh ma ultai mahangiko maar ma dhakeleko bhandaai aakrosh pokhiraheka chhan.

naya mulya anusar petrolma pratilitar 17 rupaiya ra dijel/mattitelma 25 rupaiya briddhi gariyeko chha. yo briddhisangai ra petrol pratilitar 2 say 19 rupaiya pugeko chha bhane dijel ra mattitelko mulya pratilitar 2 say 7 rupaiya kayam bhayeko chha.

tyastai elpi gasma pratisilindar 1 say ra hawai indhan aantartarph 6 rupaiya le briddhi gariyeko chha.

yo briddhisangai khana pakaune elpi gas ko mulya pratisilindar 2 hajar 10 rupaiya pugeko chha. hawai indhan ko mulya 2 say 57 rupaiya kayam chha.

nepal ko mulyasanga bharatiya bajar ko mulya tulan garda aakash–jamming ko pharak dekhinchha. shukrabar bharatiya rajdhani nayadillima petrol pratilitar 94 rupaiya 77 paisa bharatiya rupaiya (bharu) ra dijel 87 rupaiya 67 paisa chha. nepali rupaiyama petrol ko mulya 1 say 51 rupaiya 63 paisa ra dijel 140 rupaiya 27 paisa parchha.

yasari tulan garda nepalma petrol pratilitar karib 67 rupaiya 37 paisa ra dijel 66 rupaiya 73 paisa mahango dekhinchha.

bharatiya bajar ko tulanama nepalma petroliyam padarth mahango bhayeko bhanne janagunaso bara aayal nigam prawakta manoj thakur le nepal ko mulya laai bharatko aantarik bajar sanga tulan garna namillene daabi gare.

prawakta thakur le indiyan aayal karporesan (iyaa'isi) bata kharid garda ra nepal lyai puryauda telko lagat naikai mahango parna jane batae.

unka anusar nigamle iyaa'isilai petrol ko kharid mulya pratilitar 1 say 53 rupaiya 78 paisa tirne gareko chha. tyasaigari dijel ra mattitelko kharid mulya pratilitar 2 say 42 rupaiya 49 paisa chha.

tara, uktam kharid mulyama nepal sarkarle line bhansar tatha anya kar, dhuwani bhada, nigamko prashasanik kharcha ra dilar kamisan lagayat sabai kharcha jodda (mulya samayojan pachhi) nepalma petrolko kul lagat mulya pratilitar 2 say 21 rupaiya 32 paisa parna janchha. tyasaigari dijelko kul lagat mulya pratilitar 2 say 94 rupaiya 99 paisa pugne thakurle jankari die.

‘bharat bhuparibeshthit desh hoina, tyaha aafnai raifainari (prashodhan kendra) chhan, bharatma 3 wata sarkari ra 2 wata niji kampani ka raifainari chhan, uniharule 21 deshbata sasto ma kachcha tel (krud aayal) ra 41 deshbata prashodhit tel lyauchhan,’ unle bhane, ‘tara, hamilaai iyaa'isile dine mulya bhaneko antarartyiya bajarma kayam raheko 15 din ko ausat mulya ho, bharat aafai le kinne mulya pani tyahi ausat mulya nai ho.’

kar ghatauda pani pakshiya 10 arb ghaata

nigamle jari gareko bigyaptima antarartyiya bajarma mulya badheka karan sarkarle bhansar ra purbadhar kar aadha ghatauda samet ghaata narokieko ullekh chha.

kar samayojanpachhi pani nigamlai petrolma 16.65 rupaiya, dijelma 109.50 rupaiya ra gasma 4 say 16 rupaiya ghaata raheko ra 15 dinmai 10 arba 21 karod noksani hune dekhiepachhi badhya bhayera mulya badhaunupareko nigamko spashtokti chha.

nigamle mulya badhaepachhi pani pakshiya 7 arba badhi ghaata hune bhandaai upabhoktalai indhan kam prayog garna (mitabyayi banna) apil samet gareko chha.

Nigam purna sarkari swamitwako sanstha ho . sarkarle bhansar ra purbadhar kar ma 50 pratishat chhut dinu bhaneko sarkarle aaphno rajaswa ghatayera aaphno company ko wasalat baliyo bana'unu ho . samagrama rajyalaai nafa pani chaina, ghata pani chaina . tara, yo bichma pilsieko ‘upabhokta’ ho, jasle kar chhut ko mahasus garna paena .
Nigamle jahile pani antarrastriya bajarama mulya badhda ‘hami swachalit mulya pranalima chhau, mulya badha'unuko bikalp chaina’ bhancha . tara, jaba sarkarle kar ghatayera lagat kam garidincha, taba mulya ghata'unuko saṭṭa ‘purano ghata purti garna ra ioc ko rin tirna baki cha’ bhanne tark aghi sarcha .
Badhda ‘aṭomeṭik’ badhne, ghatda ‘myanual’ brek lagne yo kasto swachalit pranali ho bhnera upabhoktale prashna gariraheka chan .
Yo nai upabhokta lai rahat ho : karyakari nirdeshak bhaṭṭ
Sarkarle petroleum padarthama kar chhut di'elgattai mulyabriddhi garera upabhokta lai marama pareko bhandai chautarphi alochana bhairaheka bela nigamle aaphno kadam ko bacha'u gareko cha .
Nigam ka karyakari nirdeshak dr. chandikaprasad bhaṭṭale sarkarle dieko kar chhut le indhan ko mulyama huna lageko ‘asahya briddhi’ lai rokeko ra yo nai upabhokta ka lagi thulo rahat bhaeko tark gareka chan .
‘Yobhanda pani thulo mulyabriddhi hudai thiyo, sarkari nirnayale tyaslai rokyo,’ bhaṭṭale onlinekhabarsanga bhane, ‘yadi kar chhut nabhaeko bha e diesel ko mulyama pratilitar 70 dekhi 75 rupaiyasamma briddhi hunthyo, tara ahile 25 rupaiyasamma matrai badheka karan yaslai upabhoktale paeko rahat ka rupma bujhnuparcha .’
Unka anusar nigamle antarrastriya bajarabata kharid garda behornupareko atyadhik ghataka karan mulya badha'unu badhyata thiyo . diesel ma ajhai pani pratilitar 95 rupaiya barabar ko ghata raheko bataundai unle kar chhut nahuda ko abasthama yo sabai bhar upabhoktamathi parne abastha raheko dabai gare .
Nigam aaphai pani charam arthik sankatma raheko bataundai bhaṭṭale aagami ek mahina bhitra nigamle karib 13 dekhi 14 arba rupaiya lani garera ghata byabasthapan garne tayari gareko dabai gare .
Upabhokta adhikarkarmi ko akrosh : nigam ra sarkar ko badamasi ho
Upabhokta adhikarkarmi madhav timalsinale bhane aayal nigam ra sarkar ko yo kadam lai ‘thulo khel ra badamasi’ ko sangya dieka chan . sarkarle kar chhut dieko naṭak garera ulṭai jantako dhaḍ sekne kam gareko unako arop cha .
‘Antarrastriya bajarama kachcha telo ko mulya ghatiraheko cha, tara nigamle ioc ko 15 din agadi ko purano ra mahango mulyasuchi dekha'era yaha bhau badha'eko cha,’ timalsinale bhane, ‘dinbhari puranai mulyama diler lai tel baḍne ani rati 12 bajepachi mulya badha'une kam nigamle gareko cha, yo sarasar badamasi ho .’
Wigatma nigam naphama huda karmachari lai bonus baḍeko smaran garaundai timalsinale ahile euta sarkari swamitwako company ghatama gayo bhandaima sampurna bhar upabhokta ko taukomā thoparna napaine bataye .
‘Gas ko utpadandekhi dhwanisamma sabai niji kshetrle garcha, nigamle ta khali kagaj (pdo) matra dine ho, tara ghata bhayo bhandai arbau ko jagga kinera rakhne nigam ko anutpadak kharch ko bhar jantale kina bokne ?,’ unle prashna gare .
Jantalaai hiḍ bhanne, mantri ra hakim eklai gadima huikine ?
Nigamle bigyapti marphat upabhokta lai indhan kam prayog garna gareko apilprati timalsinale kada aapti janaeka chan .
‘Jantalaai gadi nachala'u, tel kam chala'u bhanne tara mantralay ka sachib ra nigam ka hakimharu bhane eklai euta gadi chaḍera hiḍne ? nigam bhitrai 20 jana director lai 20 wata i gadi chahinchha,’ timalsinale akrosh pokhe, ‘euta i ruṭma jane karmachari le euta i gadi prayog garne (car puling) wa sajjanik yatayat chaḍne abhyas khoi ? aphuharu arbau ko gadi ra tel ko duryupayog garne ani nimukha jantalaai marama parna milcha ?’
Sankatka bela sarkarle jor bijor pranali lagu garne, bidyutiy sawarisadhan lai protsahan garne ra sajjanik yatayat lai byabasthit garnu ko saṭṭa sidhai mulya badha'era sajilo bato rojeko unako bhanai cha .
Udyog, banijya tatha aapurti mantralay ka sachib ra pratispardha bajar prawardhan board ka adhikariharule upabhokta sanrakshan aain ko dhajji uḍaudai jantaprati charam gairjimmedaripan dekha'eko timalsinako arop cha .
Unle pradhanmantri karyalayle tatkal hastakshep garera yo aswabhawik mulyabriddhi phirta lina laga'unuparne mag samet gareka chan .
Sarkarle kar chhut dida pani aayal nigamle petroleum padartha ko mulya badha'unle nigam ko apardarshi karyashaili ra wigat ko noksani purti garna upabhoktamathi bhar thoparne prawritti dekhieko byagyaharu le bataeka chan .
Purbasachib tatha prashasanwid bimalprasad wagle le nigam ko mulya nirdharan prakriyama spashtata ko kami raheko ra yasle upabhokta lai sadhai marama parne gareko tippani gareka chan .
‘Samanyata antarrastriya bajarabata pratyek 15–15 dinma aune naya mulyasuchi ka adharma yaha samayojan hunuparne ho,’ unle bhane, ‘tara, nigamle sadhai tyaso gardaina, wigatma mulya ghate ra aunda pani purano noksani purti garne namama mulya naghat'a'i nafa kama'une gareko udaharan prashast chan .’
Purbasachib wagle ka anusar nigamle wigatma behoreko sanchit noksanilai purti garna mulya ghate ra a'eko samayama pani upabhokta lai rahat dinu ko saṭṭa mulya yathawat rakhne wa samanyamatra ghat'a'une gareko cha .
‘Wigatma nigam ko noksani 32 arba rupaiyasamma pugeko thiyo,’ wagle le smaran gare, ‘tyo noksani purti garna ḍeḍ–dui barsa lagyo, tyo kasari sambhab bhayo ta bhanda antarrastriya bajarama mulya ghate ra a'eka bela pani yaha mulya naghat'a'erai tyo ghata purti gariyeko ho .’
Rajyale dhukuṭibata yati thulo noksani behorna nasakne uni batauchan . ‘nigamle aaphnai aamdani bata mila'unuparne badhyata huncha,’ wagle le bhane, ‘tara, yasko pratyaksh marama sojha upabhokta parchan .’
Sarkari kharch kaṭauti nai mukhya samadhan
Petroleum padartha ko khopat ghat'a'una mulya badha'unu matra samadhan nabhaeko wagle ko tark cha . unka anusar yasle dhwani kharch badhauchha, jasle bajarama harek bastu ko mulyabriddhi garcha ra samagra arthatantrama nakaratmak asar parchha .
Wastabik samadhan sarkari starbatai suru hunuparne unako bhanai cha . unle suraksha ko bahanama rato nambar pleṭ ka gadi duryupayog bhairaheko bhandai sabai sarkari gadi lai seto nambar pleṭ anibarya garnuparne bataye, jasle anawashyak prayog lai nirutsahit garne cha .
Yasaka sathai unle mantralayharuma tel ko kupan kaṭera hune duryupayog rokna ukt pranali nai antya garnuparnema jod die . ‘maile ek adhyayan garauda euta mantralayama 12 jana le matra gadi subidha paunema 62 wata sawarisadhanma tel haliyeko bheṭieko thiyo,’ unle bhane, ‘tyasai le kupan pranali banda garera sambandhit adhikarilai tokieko rakam nagad nai dinuparcha, aaphno khalṭibata paisa tirnuparda swatah khopat ghatcha .’
Kras–sabsidi pranali lagu garna sujhaw
Wagle le petroleum padartha ko mulya byabasthapan ka lagi ‘kras–sabsidi’ siddhant apna'unuparnema jod dieka chan . unka anusar petrol ra hawai indhan jasto bastuma kehi badhi nafa li'era tyasbata utheko rakamle aam sarvasadharana le badhi prayog garne diesel ra mattitel ma anudan (sabsidi) dina sakincha .
‘Petrol ra hawai indhan prayog garne barg tulnatmak rupma sampanna hunchhan,’ unle bhane, ‘uniharubata kehi badhi mulya li'era tyaslai diesel ma anudan dine ho bhane dhwani lagat badhna paudaina ra bajarama mahangi niyantran garna sahayog pugcha, yasle watawaranma parne nakaratmak asar (jangal phandani) pani kam garna madat garcha .’
Unle upabhokta lai khopat kam garna agrah garnuaghi sarkari nikayaharule nai mitabyayita apana'era udaharan prastut garnuparne bataye .
Sarkar ko nirnaya ‘aparipakwa ra abishwasniya’ : arthawid khanal
Sarkarle petroleum padarthama kar kaṭauti garera jantalaai rahat dine nirnaya gareko dui dinmai nigamle mulya badha'unu sarkari kadam ko bishwasniyatamathi gambhir prashna raheko arthawid dr. dilliraj khanal batauchan .
Arthawid khanal le sarkar ra nigam ko yo kadam lai ‘aparipakwa ra abishwasniya’ sangya didai yasle sarkar ko sakhmathi nai sankat paida gareko tippani gare .
Sarkarle kar ghat'aune ra nigamle mulya badha'une birodhabhasapurna kadamle samagra ghatana kram nai euta asaphalta jasto dekhieko dr. khanal le bataye .
‘Bholi nai mulya badha'unu thiyo bhane aja kin ghatayeko ? yasle sarkar ra uska nikayharu ko nirnaya prakriyama gambhir bishwas ko sankat paida gareko cha,’ unle bhane, ‘kar ghat'aune nirnaya aaphaima sakaratmak thiyo, tara tyasko lagattai jasari mulya badhaiyo, tyasle purai prakriyalai abishwasniya bana'idiyo .’
Dr. khanal le aayal nigam purna sarkari swamitwako sanstha bhaeka karan sankat ko samayama kehi ghata aaphai le thegnuparne dayitwabata panchina namillne bataye .
‘Nigam shatapratishat sarkari sanstha ho, sankatka bela usle kehi ghata thegnuparcha, nafa huda manpari labhansh baḍne, tara alikati ghata hunasath turuntai upabhokta lai bhar thapne wa sarkarsanga paisa magne prawritti thik hoina,’ dr. khanal le bhane, ‘yasle nigam ko samajik uttaradayitwamathi nai prashna uthauchha .’
Yadyapi, antarrastriya bajarama mulya ghatne bittikai nepalma tyasko asar dekhina kehi samay lagne prabidhik paksh bujhnu sakine bhaepani samagra nirnaya prakriya paripakwa nadekhiyeko unle bataye .
Samagrama, kar ghat'aune nirnaya sakaratmak bhaepani tyasko karyanwayan ra lagattai bhaeko mulyabriddhile sarkar ko nirnayalai nai arthahin banaeko unako bhanai cha .
27 chait, kathmandu . sarkarle pensan bujhnelai bank dha'unuparne abastha antya garaeko cha .
Arthamantri dr. swarnim wagle le aja i-pensan pramanikaran pranali suruwat gareka chan . shukrabar artha mantralayama ayojit ek karyakramma unle mahalekha niyantrak ko karyalayle tayar gareko ukt pranali suruwat gareka hun .
Yosangai sadhe 3 lakh pensankarta ko dikdaripurna pensan nabikaran ra bank chhanoṭ jhanjhaṭ samapt bhaeko cha . sarkarle tirnuparne bank kamisan pani shoonyama jharne mantralayle janaeko cha .
Artha mantralay ka anusar ab nibrittabharak bhautik upasthit hunupardaina, gharaibata sewa prapt garna sakincha . bhuktani garnuparne bank kamisan ko bhar (barsik sardar 15 karod) ghatne bhaeko cha .
Nagad prabah anumanayogya bhaee dhukuṭima hune chap byabasthapan garna sakinne samet arthako bhanai cha . pensan ko myanual ganana ka kramma hune manawiy truti kami hune samet arthale janaeko cha .
Yo yojanabata 3 lakh 52 hajar 8 say 16 (nishkriya 44 hajar samet) labhanwit hune bhaeka chan
Yasaghi naya nibrittabharak bank chhanna ka lagi matra nibrittabharan byabasthapan karyalayama anibarya upasthit hunuparne abastha thiyo . nibrittabharak swayam bankmai upasthit bhaee harek barsa khata nabikaran garnuparne badhyata thiyo .
Pensan rakam ra kar ganana garne karya myanually hune gareko thiyo . samaymai nabikaran nahuda nagad prabah anumanayogya huna sakeko thiena .
27 chait, kathmandu . sajh dhaldai thiyo . patan krishna mandir paratanak ra sthanīya ko chahal pahalle bharieko thiyo . aitihasik mandir, kalatmak darbar ra bhiḍbich ekaek chichyahat suniyo .
Kehi kshanmai tyaha ko shant watawaran aatankit bhayo . jhapa ghar bhaee lalitpur basdai a'eka 33 barsiya sumit nemwang ra unka 25 barsiya bhai sirjan nemwang mathi chhura prahar bhayo . chhura prahar garne byakti thie– 32 barsiya sanjib nepali (sanju) . ukt ghatana budhabar sajh sadhe 7 baje ko thiyo .
Gambhir ghayte bhaeka uniharulai tatkal upachar ka lagi lalitpur ko bi end bi aspatal lagiyo . tara sadhe 8 baje daḳṭarle duwai janalai mrit ghosana gare . uniharu sahodar dajubhai hun .
Kasari bhaeko thiyo ghatana ?
Budhabar diuso sumit ra sirjan kaka nata parne basant nemwang sahit mangal bajar tira niskie . uniharu patan darbar kshetr ghumphir gariraheka thie . ghumne kramma sumit le ek jana saathilai telefon gare . aaphule chinekai byaktilai fon gareko thanera unle kura suru gareka thie . tara fon galat nambarma pugeko rahecha .
Sumit le gareko fon lalitpur mahanagarpalika–bholḍhoka basne 32 barsiya sanjib nepali ko mobailma pugeko thiyo . sumit ra sanjiv bich yasaghi kunai chinjan wa bheṭghaṭ thiena . pahilo patak fonmai kura huda duwaibich bhanabhan suru bhaeko thiyo .
Arkai byaktilai fon lageko thaha paepachi sumit le fon kaṭeka thie . tara tyaspachi sanjivle patak–patak fon garna thale . lalitpur prahari parisar ka pramukh esspī hobindra bogati ka anusar sanjivle fon garera sumit lai ‘ta kaha chas’ bhnera sodheka thie . sumit le aaphu mangalbajarma raheko batayepachi sanjivle pani tyah i aune bhandai bhetne prastab gareka thie .
Fonmai duwai paksh bich galigalauj samet bhaeko prahariko bhanai cha . tyaspachi beluka karib sadhe 7 bajetira nemwang dajubhai ra uniharu ka tin jana saathi mangalbajar sthit krishnamandir agadi puge . kehiberapachi sanjiv nepali aaphna saathi gagan sunar lai li'era skuṭarma tyaha aipuge .
Duwai samuha bich tyah i bhet bhayo . sirjan ra unka saathiharu talai basiraheka thie bhane sanjivsanga a'eka saathi pani tyah i base . sumit ra sanjiv bhane krishnamandir ko sidhi chaḍera mathi gae . mathi pugepachi duwaibich bibad charkiyo . bolda boldai jhagada suru bhayo . sohi kramma sanjivle aaphusanga raheko chhura nikaleka thie .
Bogati ka anusar sumit le kehiber sanjiv ko chhura boleko hat samatera mukka prahar gareka thie . tara sanjivle hat phutka'era sumit ko ghaṭima chhura prahar gare . chhura lagepachi sumit tyah i ḍhale . sumit lai ghayte bana'epachi sanjiv mandir ko sidhi jhardai tal jhareka thie.
Unlai rokna sumit ka bhai sirjan agadi badhe . tara sanjivle sirjan ko peṭ ra ghaṭima pani chhura prahar gare . chhura prahar bata gambhir ghayte bhaeka sirjan pani ghatanasthalmai ḍhale ka thie . praharile ghatanama sanglagn sanjiv nepali lai niyantranma li'era thap anusandhan gariraheko janaeko cha .
Manobaigyanik pato
Ukt ghatnale ‘awegama manish kin yasto nirnayama pugcha ? bhanne manobaigyanik prashna uthauchha .
Manochikitsakharu yasta ghatanalai achanak utpanna hune tiwra aweg karansanga jodera herchan . prahari ko prarambhik anusandhanle pani yastai nishkarsh nikaleko cha . lalitpur ka esspī hobindra bogatile awesh ra uttejana ka karan ukt ghatana bhaeko bataye .
Manochikitsak dr. sagunballabh pant ka anusar yasto ghatana prayah achanak utpanna hune tiwra aweg ra niyantran gumda hune manobaigyanik pratikriyasanga jodiyeko huncha .
Ris aaphaima asamanya kura hoina . yo manish ko samanya bhawnatmak pratikriya ho . tara jaba ris atyadhik huncha, tyasko karan ra parinamabare sochera niyantran garne kshamata le kamjor huda durghatana hunajancha .
Chikitsak ka anusar manish ko mastishka ko agadiko bhag lai pri–phranṭal korṭeks bhanincha . tyasle ke garne ra ke nagarne bhanne nirnayamaha mahattwapurna bhumika khelcha . yahi bhag le sambhabit jokhim, kshati ra parinamabare chetawani dine kam garcha .
‘Samanya abasthama manishle jhagada badhdai geko mahasus garepachi ‘yasle pachi samasya lya'una sakcha’ bhnera aaphai lai rokne wa samadhan khojne prayas garcha,’ pantle onlinekhabarsanga bhane, ‘tara kahilekahi byaktitwa ko samasyama byaktima atyadhik awegama pugda chetanashil soch kamjor huncha . rislai niyantran garna nasakda durghatana hunasakcha .’
Kehi abasthama byaktitwasambandhi samasya bhaeka byaktiharubata yasta ghatana garne hunchhan . jasto enṭisosyal parsanaliti, sosyopathi wa saikopathi ma yasto aweg niyantran garne kshamata jhan kamjor huna sakcha .
Yasta byaktiharule kshanik ris, jhok wa uttejanama gambhir hinsatmak karya garna sakchan .
Byaktitwasambandhi samasya
Manochikitsak tatha anusandhanakarta dr. rishabh koirala ka anusar yasto ghatanalai bujhna kehi pharak–pharak pakshbata hernuparcha .
Dr. koirala ka anusar pratyek manish ko swabhaw pharak huncha . kohi manish sano kurama pani jhankkai risaune, jhagada garne ra aakramak hune swabhaw ka hunchhan .
Yasto byabahar kahilekahi byaktitwasambandhi samasyasanga pani jodina sakcha . manobigyanma yaslai parsanaliti disarḍer ko samuh bhitra rakhincha . kehi byaktima aweg niyantran garna kaṭhin hune abasthaka hunchhan .
Manishle aaphno bhitri bhawna ra aweg lai niyantran garna nasakne abasthalai ‘impuls kanṭrol disarḍer’ bhanincha . yasto abasthama byaktile socna napaudai nirnaya garne ra tyasko parinam gambhir huna sakcha .
Tara, dr. koirala bhane lalitpur ko ghatanama aweg matra nahi swabhaw ko paksh pani baliyo dekhincha .
‘Samanya jhagada garda jana manishle chhura bokera jadaina . tyasle ke sanket garcha bhane byakti pahiledekhi nai aakramak manasikatama raheko huna sakcha,’ dr. koirala bhanchan .
Byagya ka anusar katipay abasthama manishle ghatana bha'isakepachi pachuto mahasus garchan . tara kehi abasthama usle aaphno byabahar ko parinamabare socnai sakdaina .
Bhawnatmak mana sakriya huda manishle ghatana ko parinamabare tatkal socna sakdaina . tyasai le kshanik awegle hinsatmak parinam nimtya'una sakcha .
Dr. pant ko ghatana ko wastabik karan bujhna aropit byakti ko prishthabhumi, usko manasik abastha, laguaushadhi prayog wa pahiledekhi aweg niyantransambandhi samasya thiyo ki thiena bhanne bishay ko adhyayan aawashyak huncha .
Dr. pant bhanchan, ‘ke kuralae samanya bibadle kshanabharmai charam abasthama puryayo bhanne bujhna manobaigyanik mulyankan pani aawashyak huna sakcha .’
Kasaile apmanjanak byabahar gareko, chunauti dieko wa prabhutwa jama'una khojeko anubhab bhaema kehi manishma tiwra pratikriya auna sakcha . manishharhu uksahama pharak–pharak tarikale pratikriya dinchan . dr. koirala bhanchan, ‘kohi sano kuralai bewasta garera hiḍchan, tara kohi tyasaibata thulo jhagadama pugchan .’
Chikitsak ka anusar madak padartha ko prayogle pani aweg niyantran kamjor bana'una sakcha . dr. koirala apradhalaai sidhai manasik rogasanga jodera byakhya garnu nahune batauchan .
‘Dherai jaso hinsatmak ghatanama sanglagn byakti samanya manish nai hunchhan . kahilekahi manasik rog bhaeko byakti ko ghatana bahira dherai charchit huncha . tara adhikansh aparaadh samanya swabhaw ra paristhiti ko karan huncha,’ koirala bhanchan .
Manochikitsakharuko bhanaima, atyadhik ris wa aakramak swabhaw bhaeka byaktile paramarsh ra upacharmarphat aaphno byabahar sudhar garna sakchan .
Dr. pant ka samajama badhdo awegajanya hinsalai rokna byaktile aaphna bhawnatmak pratikriya pahichan garna, ris byabasthapan garna ra bibad ko abasthama sanyam apna'una siknuparne aawashyakta jhan badhdai gaeko cha .
Dr. koirala bhanchan, ‘ris niyantran garna nasakne samasya dekhie manoparamarsh wa manasik swasthya bisheshagyasanga sahayog linu aawashyak huncha . samaymai sambodhan garna sake yasta durbhagyapurna ghatana rokna sakincha .’
27 chait, kathmandu . akhtiyar durupyog anusandhan ayogle purbasabhamukh krishnabahadur mahara, unka chora rahul sahit 29 janamathi muddachala'eko cha . akhtiyarle karmachariharumathi bhepa ma luka'iyeko sun patta laga'una nasakeko arop lagayeko cha . sun lyau'neharumathi taskari garera matiyar ko bhumika kheleko arop cha .
Sun taskarima muchieka harumathi yasaghi nai jilla adalat kathmanduma sampatti shuddhikaran ko abhiyog sahit mudda chaleko thiyo . tyahi ghatanama akhtiyarle arko mudda pani dayar gareko ho .
Yasto ho ghatana
Tribhuvan antarrastriya bimansthalbata 10 pus, 2079 ma chiniya yatru li hang sung dui wata suṭkes sahit nepal a'eka thie . bhansar janch ka kramma dui wata suṭkesma 73 wata baṭṭama 730 wata bhep (bidyutiy churoṭ) bheṭiyo .
Bhansar ka karmachariharule bhep ko bhautik parikshan garnuparne bhani janchapas roke ra parchā khada gari saman niyantranma lie . tara akhtiyarle uniharumathi saman rokepachi pheri chekjanch nagara'eko arop lagayeko cha .
Ghatanapachi pramukh bhansar adhikrit muktinārāyan shreshth ko aadesh ma bhansar adhikrit subendra shreshth ra nasu bhubanraj ghimire lai ganana garna lagaeka thie . ani jafat gareko rasid li'era bhep lai aaphno karyakakshma rakheka thie .
Akhtiyarle tyo kam lai badaniat bhandai kin sun baramad bhaeko bhani ullekh nagareko bhani prashna uthaeko ho . ghatana ko ḍeḍh mahinapachi jafat bhaeko bhep bhansar ko mudda tatha lilami shakhama pathaiyeko thiyo .
Akhtiyar ko dawai anusar, ti saman prashasanik bhabanma rakhiyo . tinalai prashasanik bhabanma nahi godam ma rakh nuparne akhtiyar ko jikir thiyo .
Baramad bhaeko bhep byapari udayachandan shreshth le parikshan gareka thie . tyasari phukda dhumba na'aeka karan thap shanka garnuparnema bhansar ka karmachariharule milemato gareko akhtiyar ko arop ho .
Suraksha gard le thaha pae, karmachari le luka'e
Saman laijane kramma suṭkesbata suraksha gard nirmal bik le euta bhep lageka rahechan . tyaskramma unle bhep bhitra sun raheko thaha paeko akhtiyar ko dawai cha .
Akhtiyar ko arop anusar, tyaspachi bhep saṭapher bhaeko thiyo . aru sadasyaharulai dekha'era pramukh bhansar prashasak ko sanyojaktwama gathit samitle 5 lakh 11 hajar parne bhani bhep ko mulyankan gareko thiyo .
Bhansar karyalay ka suraksha gard nirmal bik le abinash raut sanga koṭeshwar ko suchandi pasalma bhep chek garauda karib sadhe 99 lal (ek tolama 100 lal huncha) sun bheṭeko akhtiyar ko dawai cha . aroppatra anusar, tyaspachi nirmalle tyo sun ko sikri bana'i lagaeka thie ra bacheko sun ko mulya parne 3 hajar rupaiya pani li'era gae .
Nirmal kumar wikle bhep bhitra sun raheko thaha paepachi byapari marphat karmachari lai bhaneko tara tyo kura aupcharik rupma luka'eko akhtiyar ko arop ho .
Mahara kasari muchie ?
Bhep lam samay bhansarma alapatra parepachi saman chhuṭa'una purbasabhamukh krishnabahadur mahara, unka chora rahul lagayale patakpatak pramukh bhansar prashasak, bhansar adhikrit lagayatlai fon gareko ma akhtiyarle prashna uthaeko cha . uniharu bhansar karyalayama gaeko ma samet akhtiyarle badaniat bhaneko cha .
Akhtiyar ko dawai anusar, tyaspachi nasu rewanta lagayale sun saṭeko arop lagayeko cha . dui barsaghi ko ghatanama akhtiyarle dui wata mudda chala'isakeko cha .
13 bhadau 2081 ma bhep taskari bhaeko aropma jilla adalat kathmanduma pahilo mudda chaleko thiyo . jenji aandolanpachi antarik sarkar gathan bhae lagattai 27 asojma purbasabhamukh mahara, unka chora rahul lagayatmathi akhtiyarle sampatti shuddhikaran ko arko mudda pani chalayo .
Akhtiyarle bhansar ka uchchapadasth karmachariharumathi bhep jafat bha'isakepachi kayam rakh nuparne suraksha ra gopaniyatama chukeko arop lagayeko cha . ani purbasabhamukh krishnabahadur mahara ra unka chora rahul sanga samparka gareko bhanne adharma badaniat dekhieko bhandai mudda chala'eko ho .
Karmachariharumathiko arop ke cha ?
Pramukh bhansar adhikrit mukti prasad shreshth mathi suṭkes ko punah chekjanch ra bhautik parikshan nagara'eko ra tyasle garda bhrashtachar bhaeko bhanne arop cha .
Arka pramukh bhansar adhikrit ambika prasad khanal mathi bhep ma sun bhaeko bhani ullekh nagari mulyankan gareko ma prashna uthaeko ho . bhansar ka karmachariharumathi aru aropitaharusanga ko milemato ma bhep ko thap parikshan nagareko bhanne arop cha .
Purbasabhamukh mahara ra unka chora rahul mathi paṭapaṭak sarkari adhikarilai samparka gareko ra sun taskari ko milemato ma uniharulai samel gara'eko akhtiyar ko dawai cha .
Akhtiyarle sun taskari sambandhi janchbujh ayog, 2080 le samet maharalai kasuradar dekha'eko bhandai bhrashtacharma pani sanglagn bhaeko jikir gareko ho . rahul maharalai arko muddama kasuradar dekhieka karan bhrashtachar pani gareko bhanne akhtiyar ko dawai ho .
Akhtiyarle aath kilo 480 gram sun taskarima bhumika kheleko bhandai uniharumathi saat karod 78 lakh 68 hajar rupaiya hinamina gareko arop lagayeko ho .

Karmachariharumathi shankaspad bastu 19 din bhansarama rakhera tyaspachi matrai mudda tatha lilami shakhama patha'eko bhandai akhtiyarle pachi samagri paribartan garne badaniatle cctv ko kabarej nabhaeko thauma sareko arop lagayeko cha .
27 chait, buṭwal . ‘digo pashudhan ra khadya suraksha ko lagi swasthya marg’ narasahit rupandehima 16aum rashtriya bheṭerinary sammelan suru bhaeko cha .
Nepal bheṭerinary esosiyasan (enbhi e) ko ayojanama rupandehi ko manigramma suru bhaeko sammelan ko lumbini pradesh ka mukhyamantri chetanārāyan acharyale udghaṭan gare .
Sammelan udghaṭan gardai mukhyamantri acharyale krishi ra pashupalan nai nepal ko digo bikas ra aatmanirbhartako mukhya adhar bhaeko ullekh gardai rajye kisan ra bheṭerinary chikitsak ko mahatwalaai bujhna nasakeko swikar gare .
Unle kisan ra pashu ko upachar garne chikitsak lai aja badhi samman garnuparne agrah gare .
‘Hamima manchhe ko upachar garne daḳṭar ko matrai samman garne tara dudh, masu, gobar dine gai, bhainsi, bakhra jasta pashudhan ko upachar garne daḳṭar ra kisan lai samman nagarne chintan cha, yo galat ho’ mukhyamantri acharyale bhane, ‘duwaithari daḳṭar ko a–aaphno kshetrma uttikai mahatwa cha, tara pashu ko upachar garne daḳṭar lai badhi samman garnuparcha, pashu swastha bha e kisan ko utpadan ra aamdani duwai briddhi huncha .’
Mukhyamantri acharyale pashupankshi chikitsak ra bheṭerinary janashaktilai rajye herne drishtikonma paribartan lya'una ra bibhedkari kanun baneko bha e sachya'una pradesh sarkar tayar raheko bataye .
Pashupalan ko paramparagat peshalai adhunikikaran ra byabasayikaran garna bheṭerinary janashakti ra pashu chikitsak lai protsahan jaruri raheko ma mukhyamantri acharyale jod die .
Sammelanma nepal bheṭerinary esosiesan ka adhyaksh dr. kedar subedile barambar taketa garda pani bheṭerinaryanharulai medical daḳṭar sarahako darja ra sewa subidha din mag gare . aphuharumaithi asamanta ra bibhed gariyeko gunaso gardai unle sarkar ko niti tatha bajeṭma pani apekshit rupma prathimikata napako bataye .
Adhyaksh subedile niti nirmanma nepal bheṭerinary esosiesan ka byagyaharuko sahabhagita sunishchit garna, aushadhi aain ra pashu chikitsa parishad aain jasta kanun sansodhan garda byagya ko ray lina pani mag gare .
Sammelanma krishi tatha ban bigyan bishwabidyalay rampur chitwan ki upakulapati pra. dr. sharada thapaliya, krishi tatha pashu panchhi bikas mantralay ka sahasachib dr. ramanandan tiwari, hephar inṭarnesanal ka kanṭri dairekṭar dr. tirtha regmi lagayale muluk ko arthik samriddhi ko euta baliyo pashu pankshipalan bhaepani tinai tah ko sarkar ko niti, karyakram ra bajeṭma prathimikatama napareko aulyaundai prathimikatama rakhna ra bheṭerinary janashaktilaai protsahan, naya khoj anusandhanma lani badha'una sujhaw die .
Sammelanma 150 bhanda badhi anusandhanapatra prastut hune ra samuhagat chhalphal hune batai'eko cha .
Sammelanle nepalma pashu swasthya, anusandhan tatha nabin prabhidhiko bikasma tewa purya'une apeksha gariyeko cha .
26 chait, kathmandu . naya pratinidhisabha banepachi raswapa netritwako sarkar lai sadan ra bahirabata chhinachhinama khabardari garne byakti hun–hark sampang . shram sanskriti parti ka adhyaksh samet raheka sampang chhinachhinama samajik sanjalmai prakaṭ bhaera sarkar ra raswapa ka karyashailimathi prashna garchan . bipakshi benchma basera sarkar lai khabardari garne sampang netritwako partilai raswapale bhane upasabhamukh samarthan garne nirnaya gareko cha .
Sansadma pahiloṭak naya shakti ko rupma pravesh gareko shram sanskritilai pratinidhisabha ko upasabhamukh jasto bishisht pad mileko ho .
Saat jana sansad raheko yo parti ki ummedwar rubikumari thakur upasabhamukh banne karib nishchit cha . kinabhane raswapa ko samarthan paune bittikai unako pakshma sansad ko dui tihai bhanda badhiko samarthan huncha .
Naya chunaawpachi paribartankari shaktiharubich milera jana shramsanskritilai samarthan garerako raswapa ka mahamantri kabindra burlakotile janakari die .
Raswapabata pratinidhisabha ko sabhamukh bhaeka karan samwidhanik prabadhan anusar arko dal ra lingko byaktilai upasabhamukh bannuparcha . tyahi adharma raswapale shram sanskriti ki raprpa kaslai samarthan garne bhanne dohoro chhalphal chaliraheko thiyo .
Raprapa sadiya dal ka neta gyanendrabahadur shahile kehi din agi raswapa sabapati rabi lamichhane lai bheṭeka thie . tyaskramma upasabhamukh ka ekarkalai samarthan garnebare kurakani bhaeko thiyo . bihibar pani raswapa sabapati lamichhanesanga kura bhaeko ra tyaskramma raprpa lai samarthan garne ashwasan paeko shahile gyanendrabahadur shahile onlinekhabar lai bataeka thie . rabisanga kura garepachi raprpa ka netaharu saraswati lamalai upasabhamukh bana'une nirnaya garna ka lagi baithakma gae .

Yata shram sanskriti partisanga pani raswapa ko kurakani chaliraheko thiyo . raswapa ka barishtha neta samet raheka pradhanmantri balendra shah sanga hark sampang ko kura hune gareko thiyo . raprpa uta baithak gariraheko bela kabindra burlakoti sahit ka raswapa netaharu shram sanskriti partisanga chhalphalma thie . ukt chhalphalma shram sanskritilai sahayog garne nirnaya raswapa netaharu le suna e .
Raprapa netaharu saraswati lamako naam li'era ummedwari darta garna auda shram sanskriti ki rabikumari thakur lagayat ka sansad pharam li'era basiraheka thie . raprpale suruma aaphnai sansadharu prastabak ra samarthak rakhera saraswati lamako naam darta gara yo . tyaspachi chhalphalma raheka raswapa ka kabindra burlakoti ra shramsanskriti ka aren rai lagayat ka netaharu ummedwari darta sthalma a'e rubi ko ummedwari dosro nambarma darta bhayo .
Raswapa ko ashwasanpachi ummedwari darta gareko dabai garne raprpa sadiya dal ka neta shahile ‘kin samarthan garne ashwasan dieko ? bhandai rabi lamichhane lai nai prashna gareka chan . ummedwari darta pachi shahile sansad sachibalayama patrakarharusanga bhane, ‘uhaharu le boleko iman kati pura garnuhuncha hami herchhau .‘
Shahi yaso bhane pani ab raswapa aupcharik samarthan rubi lai bhaeka karan uni nai upasabhamukh banne nishchit jastai cha . kinabhane raswapa ra shramsansriti milda pratinidhi sabhama 189 siṭ huncha . yo pratinidhisabha ko dui tihai badhiko samarthan ho .
10 minet agadi ko tyo nirnaya
Shram sanskriti parti ka adhyaksh sampang sanga budhabar beluki raswapa ka mahamantri kabind ra burlakotile sanwad gareka thie . bihibar bihan raswapa ka sabapati lamichhane le raprpa ka sadiya dal ka neta gyanendra shahilai fon gareka thie .
Sabapati lamichhane ra mahamantri burlakotile sampang ra gyanendra shahilai dieko sandesh saman thiyo– ummedwari dinus . upasabhamukh ma adibasi janajati kalsṭar hos bhanne hamro chahana cha .
Yasto sandesh nekapale paena . tyaspachi upasabhamukh ma dabai gareko nekap ummedwari nadine nirnayama pugyo . rasprpa ra raswapa ummedwar chayanma lage .
Raprapale suruma khushbu oli lai ummedwar bana'une tayari gareko thiyo . raswapa ka sabapati lamichhane le nai adibasi janajati kalsṭarbata ummedwar hos bhane pachi khushbulai mana'era saraswatilai ummedwar banayo .
Yata, shram sanskriti partile pani suruma ambikadebi sangraula lai ummedwar bana'une tayari gareko thiyo . raswapale janajati klusṭarbata ummedwar hos bhnera sandesh diepachi chhalphalma juṭe ra thakur lai ummedwar bana'une nirnaya lie .
Raprapa ra raswapa duwai raswapale matdanmai sahayog garne bujhayima thie . yasanusar duwaile tayari gare .
Tara, ummedwari darta chalirahanda raprpa ra shram sanskriti duwaile ‘sarparizd’ pae .
Raprapa ko ummedwari darta prakriya chaldaithiyo . shram sanskriti parti ki thakur palo kuriraheki thin .
Raprapa ka netaharu ummedwari dartapachi ko phoṭo liraheka thie . tyahi bela shram sanskriti parti ka mahasachib aren rai ra raswapa ka mahamantri burlakoti ekasath chire . burlakotile thakur lai samarthan garne nirnaya bhaeko janakari die .
Tyaspachi thakur ko prastabakma shram sanskriti parti ka mahasachib aren rai, samarthakma raswapa ka ashok chaudhari ra shram sanskriti parti ka ambikadebi sangraula base .
Raswapa ka mahamantri burlakoti aphuharu antim samaymai nirnayama pugeko swikar garchan . baru nekap ra raprpale samet upasabhamukh ma chahana rakheko unle suna e .
‘Kras bheṭghaṭma nekap ko prastab pani thiyo . hamile uhaharulai huncha bhanenaun, hudaina bhanenaun . yo (shram sanskritilai samarthan garne nirnaya) pani thyakkai 10 minet agadi ṭungya'eko ho’, burlakoti bhanchan, ‘hami park ra hera ko abasthamai thiyau . kasle ummedwari dinuhuncha bhanne mai thiyau . pahile bachan kasailai dieka thienaun .’
Burlakotile bhane jastai uniharu ummedwari darta ko karyalay prawesh garda dui bajan kehi minet matrai thiyo .
‘Samay sakina lagisakyo bhanda sansad sachibalay ka karmachari ra anyale samet dhoka bhitra chirisakepachi pharam bujha'une samay paincha bhnera samjhaeka thie .’
Antim samayama nirnaya liepani aphuharle janabhawnalai sambodhan gareko mahamantri burlakoti ko bhanai cha .
Uni bhanchan, ‘uda'uda parti ek thauma ubi'era januparcha bhanne janapeksha cha, yaslai khyal garyau . paka sabhamukh hunuhuncha, upasabhamukh ma jenji umer ko aunu hune bhaeko cha . samwidhanik parishad pani samabeshi dekhinecha .’
Eklīyo raprpa
Pratinidhisabhama 6 wata parti chan . upasabhamukh ko chunaawma ekatira panch dal ra arkotira raprpa eklai bhaeko cha .
Upasabhamukh ma nepali kamyunisṭ parti, raprpa ra shram sanskriti partile dabai gareko thiyo ra raswapa ko samarthan chaheka thie . nepali congress ra nepa emale le dabai nai garena wa raswapa lai ‘sagha'unuhos upasabhamukh ma ummedwari dinchhau’ bhanena .
