unle pachhilo bhet pani samjhe. ‘kathmanduma bhet hunda pani uhaanle naya git bara sodhnu bhayeko thiyo. maile banauchhu bhaneko thie, tara tyo sambhab huna sakena,’ unle bhane.

baskotale shraddhanjali byakt gardai bhane, ‘mera srijanalai alaukik awajle singarera mero sangitlai garbijilo banaidinu bhayeko ma yasalai aaphno jeevan ko aashirbadko rupma lieko chhu. didiko nidhanko khabarle ma atyantai marmahat bhayeko chhu. yas dukhko ghadi ma ma yaham prati bhawapurn shraddha suman byakt gardachhu. asha didi, yahaanle yas bhautik sansar bata bida linubhayepani sansar bhari raheka sangitpremi ko man mastishk ra sangit akashma sada gunjirahanuhunechha. yahaanle nepali sangitlai lagaunu bhayeko gun yug yugasamma rahirahnechha. hami sabai nepali le didi prati bhawapurn shraddhanjali byakt garchhau.’

bharatiya sangit jagat aaja gahiro shokma dubeko chha. mahan parshwagayika asha bhosleko 92 barsako umer ma mumbai sthit brich kyandi aspatama nidhan bhayo.

unko nidhan kewal ek kalakar ko bidai hoina, bharatiya upamahadwipko sangitik itihasko swarnim adhyay band bhayeko kshan ho.

achanak swasthya bigriyera aspati bhrna bhayeki bhoslema suruma chhatiko sankraman dekhiyo. pachhi mutu, phokso ra anya angma jatilata badhdai jada awastha ‘multiorgan phailiyar’ma pugera nidhan bhayeko bataiye ko chha.

kasari achanak bigriyo swasthya ?

pariwarik shrot anusar asha bhoslelai shanibar saanj achanak asahaj mahasus bhayeko thiyo.

unki natinijani bhoslele samajik sanjalmarphat suruma atyadhik sharira ekdamai galisakeko awastha ra phokso ma sankraman ka karan aspati bhrna gariyeko jankari dieki thin.

kehi prarambhik reportma cardiac arrest ko ullekh bhayepani pachhi chikitsakharule sankraman ra swas pra shwas sambandhi jatilata mukhye karan bhayeko spashta pare.

umera 90 barsa naghepachhi samanya dekhine chhatiko sankraman pani naikai jokimpurn banna sakchha.

sankramanle phokso ma oksijan ko aadan pradan ghatauchha, jasle mutu ma dabab badhauchha. mutu kamjor bhayepachhi mirgaula, kalejo ra mastishkma raktasanchar kam huna thalchha. yahi kram badhdai jada ekpachhi arko angle kaam garnu chodne awastha aunchha.

asha bhosleko kesma pani yastai shrinkhalabadh jatilata dekhiyeko karan bachauna nasaki yeko unko upacharma sanglagn chikitsak dr. pratit samadani le jankari dieka chhan.

‘multiorgan phailiyar’ bhaneko ke ho ? kasari yo sthitismma birami pugchha ?

janaral praktisanar dr. anam pyakurel ka anusar ‘multiorgan phailiyar’ chikitsa bigyanma atyant gambhir awastha ho, jaha sharirka dui wa dui bhanda badhi mahatwapurna angle le ekaipatak wa kramashah kaam garna chhodchan.

samanayata yas ma mutu, phokso, mirgaula, kalejo wa mastishk prabhawit hunchhan.gambhir chhatima sankraman wa nimoniya huda phoksoma sankraman hunda sharirabhar oksijan ko matra ghatchha. briddha byaktima yo awastha chhito bigrina sakne uni batauchhan.

‘sankraman badhdai jada mutule paryapt rakta pump garna nasakda anya angma rakta ra oksijan pugdaina. sankraman ragatmarphat sharirabhar phailyo bhane angharu ekpachhi arko phel huna thalchhan, ’uni bhanchhan.

yasto samasya briddha umer ma kina dherai ghatak hunchha ?

chhatirog tatha saghan upachar bisheshagya dr. raju pangenika anusar yo samasya briddha awasthama badhi ghatak hunchha. ‘briddha umerma sharir ka angharu pahile jasto baliyo huddainan. phoksako kshyamata kam hunchha, mutuko pumping shakti ghatchha, mirgaulako philtar garne kshyamata kamjor hunchha. samanya sankramanle pani thulo jatilata nimtyauna sakchha, ’da. pangenī bhanchhan.

90 barsa pachhi roga pratirodhatmak kshyamata, angharuko punasthapana shakti ra upacharko pratikriya naikai kam hunchha. unka anusar yo samasyaka lakshanma pahila sas phernu garo hunchha. sharir ma oksijan kam pugchha. mutu ma dabab badchha. raktachap asantulit hunchha. mirgaula ma asar parchha. sharir ma bishakta padarth badchha.

yasari ekpachhi arko ang prabhawit hudai jane shrinkhalabadh jatilata sirjana garchha, jaha euta ang bigridaa arko ang pani prabhawit hunchha. yahi karan le briddha byaktima ‘multiorgan phailiyar’ko jokim dherai hune uni batauchhan.

‘pahiledekhi kunai rog thiyena’

halsamma paribar, brich kyandi aspatal ra bharatiya sanchar madhyam bata aayeko jankari anusar asha bhoslelai pahiledekhi kunai khas dirghakalin rog bhayeko pusti gariyeko chhaina.

uni umeranusar sakriya thin, stage karyakram ra sarbajanik upasthitima pani dekhiraheki thin. tara 92 barsako umerma sharirbhitraka angharuko karya swabhawik rupma ghatisakeko hunchha.

yahi karan samanya byaktima samanya dekhine chest infeksan pani briddha umerma naikai gambhir banna sakchha. chikitsakiya rupma yasto awasthalai ‘ej riledat phrayaliti’ bhaninchha.

yaso artha sharir ma kunai euta thulo roga nabhayepani samagr rupma umera badhdai ga e pachhi phoksako kshyamata kam hune, mutuko sahanashakti ghatne, mirgaulako shakti kamjor hune, rogasanga ladne pratirodhatmak shakti susta hune, swasthya samasya dekhie niko hune gati dhilo hune jasta paribartan bha isakeka hunchhan.

antim darshan ra shraddhanjali

paribarle sombar bihana 11 baje dekhi diusosamma lowar parelsthit unko nibas ma antim darshan ko byabastha gariyeko janayeko chha. antyeshti shibaji parkma saanj 4 baje garine batai yeko chha. maharashtra sarkar, sangitkarmi, kalakar ra lakhau prashansak le shraddhanjali byakt garirakheka chhan.

asha bhosleko sangit yatra : swarle bandheko panch dashak

8 september 1933 ma janmieki asha bhosle le balyakalmaai sangit yatra suru gareki thin. unle hindi, marathi, bangali, gujarati, punjabi, tamil, malayalamdekhi antarartyiya bhashasamma 12 hajar bhanda badhi git gaeki thin.

dherai srotle unalai sansarai sab bhanda dherai recording garne gayika ko rupma ullekh gareka chhan. unko bisheshta kewal gitko sankhya hoina, shailiko bibidhata thiyo. unle filmi git, gazal, bhajan, pop, shastriya sangit, kyabare nambar, romantic yugal gitma saman prabhaw chhodin. ar.di. barman sanga ko unko sahakarya bharatiya film sangitkai swarnim yug maninchha.

sadabahar git jasalai pustau lai bandhyo

asha bhosleka git kewal manoranjan hoina, samayko bhawana bokeka sanskritik dastabez hun. unka kehi amar git : ‘piya tu ab to aaja’, ‘dam maro dam’, ‘jhumka gira re’, ‘o mere sona re’, ‘chura liya hai tumne’ ‘ye mera dil’ ‘dil chij kya hai’, ‘in aankhon ki masti’ jasta githaru ajhai radio, riyality sho, stage konsart ra samajik sanjalm uttikai lokapriya chhan.

samman, kritiman ra abismarniya birasat

asha bhoslelai padma bibhushan, dadasaheb phalke puraskar, grami nominasyon, ra bishwa kirtimansamma ka samman prapt bhayeka thie. uni guinij bukma sab bhanda dherai git record garne gayikako rupma pani charchit rahin.

euta swar kahilyai mardaina

asha bhosleko bhautik yatra tungieko chha, tara unko swar samay bhanda dherai lamau bachnechha. sangit itihasma yasto kalakar biralai janminchha, jasako awajle tin–chaar pustalai saman rupma chunchha.

unko nidhanle sangit jagatlai apuraniy kshati pugeko chha, tara unle chodeko sangitik sampada sadhai jiwit rahanechha.

18 mangsir, kathmandu. ruska rastrapati bh ladimir putin aaja (bihibar) bharat bhramanma aaudai chhan. uni dui diwasiya bhramanko lagi bharat auna lageka hun.

bharatiya sanchar madhyam haru ka anusar putin bihibar bharatiya samayanusar aparanha 4 baje naya dilli pugdai chhan. unle bharatiya pradhanmantri narendra modi sanga kayau muddaharu ma chhalphal garne karyatalika chha.

putin ko bhramanlai madhyanajar garī bharat ko surakchha byabastha kadda pariyeko chha. sabai surakchha angaharu lai ‘hai alert’ ma rakhiyeko chha.

‘putin ko aagaman dekhi phirta hunesamma surakchha ejensiharule harek gatibidhi nigarani garne chhan,’ nab bharat taimsma samachar chha.

