18 mangsir, kathmandu. nepali congress le rastriyasabha ra pradeshsabha ma haal bahalma raheka byaktilai aagamii nirwachanma ummedwar nabanaune bhayeko chha.

rastriyasabha ra pradesh sabhama haal bahalma raheka byaktilai congress le a sanna pratinidhisabha ra rastriyasabha nirwachanma ummedwar nabanaune bhayeko ho.

mukhya sachib krishnaprasad paudel le ummedwar sifaris sambandhi yasaghi ko paripatralai thapa prashytaaudai pheri gareko paripatrama matahatka karyasamitiharulai rastriyasabha ra pradesh sabhama haal bahalma raheka byaktilai ummedwar ko lagi sifaris nagarna bhaneka chhan.

‘rastriyasabhama haal bahal rahanu bhayeka mananiya sansadharuko naam ummedwar ko rupma sifaris garna paine chhaina,’ paripatrama bhaniyeko chha, ‘pradeshsabhama haal bahal rahanu bhayeka pradeshsabha sadashyharuko naam ummedwar ko rupma sifaris garna paine chhaina.’

sthaniya tahama haal bahal raheka janapratinidhi haru pratinidhisabhako pratyaksh ra samanupatik tarpha tatha rastriyasabha nirwachanma ummedwar banna napaaune bhayeka chhan. congress le sthaniya tahama haal bahal raheka nirwachit janapratinidhi haruko naam ummedwar ko rupma sifaris nagarna bhaneko chha.

yastai pradeshsabha nirwachan–2079 ma samanupatik tarphako bandasuchima samawesh bhayeka ummedwar haruko naam pani a sanna nirwachan ko lagi sifaris garna napaine paripatrama ullekh chha.

paripatrama tokiyeko bhanda badhi sankhyama ummedwar ko naam sifaris garna napaine pani bhaniko chha. ‘toki yeko sankhya bhanda badhi naam sifaris gariyema kendrale tyasako karyanwayan nagarne byahora yasai paripatramarphat pashta parinchha,’ paripatrama ullekh chha.

congress le pratinidhisabhako pratyaksh tarphako nirwachan ko lagi ek mahila sahit tin jana, samanupatik tarpha samabeshi siddhantalai samet dhyanma rakhi kamtima ek mahila sahit badhima dui janako naam sifaris garna nirdesh dieko chha.

yastai rastriyasabha nirwachan ko lagi pratyek ek sit ko lagi tin janako naam sifaris garna bhaniko chha. ‘naam sifaris garne baithakma sahamati huna sakema sahamatibata ra sahamati huna nasakema bahumata bata nirnay garnuparne chha,’ paripatrama ullekh chha.

18 mangsir, kathmandu. nekpa emaleka mahasachib shankar pokhrel le kulaman ghisinko sahabhagitama ghoshana gariyeko ujyalo nepal party prati lakshit gardai kadda tippani sarbajanik gareka chhan.

pokhrel le kasai ko naam nalii ujyalo nepal ko yojana eutako bhayepani jas arkai le payeko ullekh chhan. ani party tesro le kholeko unko bhanai chha.

ujyalo nepal ko yojana jasako ho, usai le shrey napayeko unko gunaso chha.

mahasachib pokhrel le facebookma lekheka chhan, ‘lodsedibirodha ujyalo nepal ko yojana eutako, jas payo arkole, party khol yo tesrole. jasako yojana usailai shreydine kahile ?’

18 mangsir, kathmandu. doshro sanskaran ko siddharth bank nepal premier lig (enpel) cricketma aaja dui khel hudai chhan.

tribhuban bishwabidyalay antarartyiya cricket rangashalama pokhara ebjenjars ra kathmandau gorkhaj tatha sudurpashchim royals ra chitwan rainoj bich khel huna lageko ho.

pahilo khel 11:45 baje pokhara ebjenjars ra kathmandu gorkhaj bich hunechha. aparanha 4 baje hune doshro khelma sudurpashchim royals ra chitwan rainoj le pratispardha garnechhan.

kathmandu le bhane 6 khelbata 8 ank jodeko chha bhane pokharale 5 khelbata 4 ank matra jodeko chha. tyasaile playaph ko sambhawana jiwit rakhna pokharalai aajako khel jitnaiparne dabab chha.

panch khelbata chaar ank jodeko chitwanlai pani playaph ko lagi jitnaiparne badhyata chha. playaphma pugisakeko sudurpashchim bhane 10 ank ka saath shirsh sthanma chha.

18 mangsir, dhangadhi. 11au rastriya mahadhibeshan pratinidhi chayan ko bishayama asantushti janaaudai nekpa emale parityagko ghoshana gareka baitadiko pancheshwar gaupalika ka adhyaksh gorakhabahadur chand le puna: partykai kriyashil rahane bataeka chhan.

13 mangsir ma bhayeko pratinidhi chayan ma ekalauti ra gutabandi gariyeko bhandaai chand le samajik sanjal facebookmarphat party parityag gareko jankari dieka thie. tara, budhabar pheri samajik sanjalmarphat nai unle emale maai kriyashil rahane nirnay gareko ullekh gareka chhan.

lamau chhalphal ra gahan samiksha pashchat pradeshka netaharu ko aagrahma aaphule yo nirnay lieko unle bataeka chhan.

‘nekpa (emale) 11 au rastriya mahadhibeshan pratinidhi chhanaut prakriyama mero bimati bhayi emale party parityag gariyeko bishaya hatar hatarma samajik sanjalma post gariyeko sandarbhama partyka jimmedar netritwaharu kramashah: nekpa emaleka politbyuro sadashya tatha nibartaman mukhya mantri mananiya rajendra rawal, kendriya sadashya tatha nibartaman udyog mantri mananiya damodar bhandari, sudurpashchim pradesh sarkar ka bhautik purbadhar mantri mananiya surendra pal, yojana ayogka mananiya sadashya da. hira chand lagayat jimmedar neta kamared saithiharusanga ko lamau chhalphal, gahan samiksha pashchat uhaanharuko aagrahma sakaratmak nishkarsh ka saath nekpa emale party ma kriyashil rahane nirnay lieko chhu,’ chand le lekheka chhan.

kathmandu. bijay baral ra upasanasingh thakuri kramashah utkrishta abhineta ra utkrishta abhinetri ghoshit bhayeka chhan. baral le sarbakalin blakbustar film ‘purnabahadur ko sarangi’bata utkrishta abhineta ra thakuri le ‘khusma’bata sarvotkrishta abhinetri ko 2082 sal ko rastriya chalachitrit puraskar prapt gare.

