chalachitrit bikas bordale ayojit gareko samarohma 9 bidhama rastriya chalachitrit puraskar pradan 2082 pradan gariyo.

tasbir : bikash shreshtha/onlinekhabar

aaja paus 8 gate santaneta shri krishnaprasad bhattarai ko janmajayanti ko din. krishnaprasad bhattarai, jo bigat ek shatabdi ko nepal ko rajnitik itihasma euta bishisht charitra ra pahichan banaeka tara nepali samajma thoraile matra tyo gahirailai chinna sakeka shraddheya mahapurush. lekhak hari adhikari ko shabdama bhanda ‘eklo nayak’.

halla ra bhramka pachadi dagnrne, parkhane dhiryata bilkul shunya bhayeko, kaamko bhanda mamko chaso rakhne dekhawati ebang ushrrinkhal jeevanshailima ramaune byakti nai neta banne ahile ko awastha chha. shaktima hunda afant/ asepaseko bharan poshan bahek anya kurako matalab narakhne netritwako bolbala bhayeko samaj chha.

tara, krishnaprasad bhattarai tyo sab bhanda bilkul alag shant, adhyayanshil, adhyatmik, sapata, prajatantrik ebang sadharan aachar shaili ra sanskar ani sushashanka pratimurti hununthyo.

sarvapratham uhaan ko janma jayantiko awasar ma tyasto durlabh gunle sampanna samadarniya shri krishnaprasad bhattarai prati shraddhanjali byakt garna chahanchhu ra bhanna chahanchhu – kisunji, aaja tapai ko swargarohan bhayeko 14 barsa pachhi nepali manle tapai ko naam naliyeai sahi, aajaka netaharu ma tapai ko jasto aachar, sanskar, ra sadachar ko khoji gareko chha. tyahi kurako maag garera yuba bargale sansar halline tahko bidroha ra birodhasamet gare.

sambhabata: tapai ko jasto jeevan shaili, chintan ra aadarsh tapai pachhika netaharu ma hundo ho bhane na nepal ko haalat yasto hunthyo, na jenji bidroha hunuparthyo wa hune thiyo. tasartha, tapai le dekhaunu bhayeko aadarsh ko tyo alok prati satat naman.

bigat ek shatabdi ma kasaisanga tulana huna nasakne tyasto neta chhoto samaylai sahi, deshko netritwama aaisakepachhi nepali samajle tyo kohinur lai kina chinna ra sanrakshan garna sakena ru yo nai aajako milyan dolar ko prashna ho.

kisunji le deshlai yogadan dinubhayo, tara kisunji lai sanrakshan chahiyeka bela deshle tyo kura bujhena. tyobela pharak samay thiyo. sayad aajako jasto digital yuga hundo ho bhane, tyo sambhaba pani hundo ho. tara, tyatikhera lai tyo bhayena, huna sakena.

yas lekhma ma nepali samajka kehi nihita bidambanaharu ko charcha garna chahanchhu. jasa ka karan nepal aajako niyatima gujreko chha.

nepali rajnitika praayas sabai kyamp haruma sadhai jaljhel, aswastha pratispardha ra aprajatantrik tarikako duryyog hudai aayeko jagajaher chha. nepali congressma yo rog ta kam haina, badhi nai thiyo. krishnaprasad bhattarai le dekhaeko aadarsh marg bhanda congress bhitraika thuprailai aru kura nai pyaro thiyo. tyo prawritti paleka lai ‘bhandama jae congress, bhandama jae desh’ bhaneko jastai tyobhanda aaphno swarthapurti nai badhi pyaro thiyo. ra, mauka pauna sath krishnaprasad ra unka aadarsh lai tyo prawrittile dhulisat parna baanki rakhena.

usle bhabhi santatilai sant neta ko charitra ra aadarsh ko path kina padhaunthy o ru man ra byabaharma je jasto bhayepani bahira chaartare jhanda bokeka tiniharulai kisunji ko matalab nabhayepachi anya dallai ke matalab hunthyo ?

hamro desh ameerika wa belayat haina, jaha sammanayogya ko samman hunchha. jaha kramashas jorj basington ra winston churchil aajako pustalai chinaairahane aawashyakta nai pardaina. yaha ta nakkalī nayak khada garinchha, sakkalī nayak laai gumnam rakhne sangathit prayas nai garinchha.

krishnaprasad bhattarai ko saral jeevanshaili ra bhrashtachar prati ko shunya sahanashilta uhaan ka chara chand thie. tyasai karan 2046 pachhi bhayeka yatika nirwachanma dui patak congress le prashtha bahumat lyayo ra dubai patak mukhyatas uhaan ko naam, kaam ra anuhakai aadhar ma. yo kura janamanasle gahiro gari dekhn, bujhn ra manan garna payeko bhaye kisunji laai bisthapit garna swargaka raja indrale pani sakne thiyenan. yasto sthitima sabai tah ra tapkaka kharab tatwa ko lagi uhaan laai parda pachhi dhakelnu atyant aawashyak thiyo ra bhayo pani tyahi.

addhyatmaprerit kisunji laai satta kahilyai pyaro bhayena. uhaan le nilakantha banera aaphno naamma arjit janmatasamet tyag dinu bho. tara, pachhismma pani uhaan ko naam ma phaida uthaune prayas bhane bhai nai rahyo. garnele koshish garirahe, milesamma ahile pani garne nai chhan. tara, bastabikata ke bhane swayam congress party le krishnaprasad bhattarai laai chhiena. chinna chahiena. mulyankan garena. gareko chhaina. chinaena, chinauna chaheko chhaina.

euta party dherai ko yogdanle baneko hunchha, tara sabaiko yogdan euta lahar ma ekamusht phoolmala chadhaera sakine khal ko hudaina. tyasama bhinna yogdan ko bhinna parakh hunu parcha. natra tyaha nyayako pratyabhuti hudaina. jasle itihas lekhnama ta nyay gardaina, tyas gharmaa bartamanma nyay hunchha bhanera kasari bhanna sakinchha ?

congressma yogdan ko kurama chhyan/pahichan nai chhaina. kasailai party nakholeka bela kisunji le aaphno agrasaratama party kholne himmat ra agrasarata linu bhayeko ho. 2017 salpachhi swayam aaphna sahayoddha panchayatma pravesh garera dhamadham phaida lina thale, aru kohi kayalnama lekhara jaelabata mukta huna thale, tara krishnaprasad eklai satishal banera ubhirahanu bhay o, jasako naitik balle antatas ajey nirankushatalai latakkai galaidiyo.

tyobela raajako nigah swikar chhainu bhanera humkar garne himmat ko salam garna kunai shabda nai chhaina. ra, tyo ghatna tyasto ghatna banna pugyo, jahambata pheri prajatantrik sochko punarjagaran ra nirankushatako oraliko dinaganti suru bhayo.

uhaan ko tyo balidan, himmat ra aadarsh ko birashat bokeko congress ta ahile pani cha tara bahirikhola ma matra congress. rogagrasta congress. sustaeko/dharmaraeko congress. itihas bolna nasakne congress. mulyankan garna nasakne congress. sattako swad waripari sangathan dhaneko congress laai satta chahida sankhya chahine nai bhayo ra sankhyako lagi mukh ma patti launu parne badhyata. yahi ta chha bidambana.

