7 paus, kathmandau. kathmandau ko maitighar mā miraj dhungana netrittwa ma kehi jenji ra pratinidhi haru pradarshanma utrieka chhan. pradarshanma utrieka kehilai praharile niyantranma lieko chha bhane kehilai niyantranma lieko kehiberamai chhadisakeko chha.

pradarshankari lai praharile niyantranma lieko birodh ma dhunganasahitle samuhik giraftari dine bhandaai jilla prahari parisar kathmandau tarph jada praharile rokeko chha. praharile rokepachhi ahile uniharu jilla sarkari wakil ko karyalay agadi pradarshan garirakheka chhan. tyahambata bhadrakali tarph bhane praharile jana rok lagayeko chha.

prashasan ko anumatibina pradarshan gareko bhandaai praharile uniharuko pradarshanlai nistej parna khojiraheko chha. aaitabar kathmanduma patrakar sammelan garera dhunganasahitle aaja pradarshan garne bataeka thie.

6 paus, kathmandu. 23 ra 24 bhadau ko jenji aandolanpachhi baneko antarim sarkarle 100 din pura gareko chha. yosangai jenjika bibhinna samuhle sarkar ka kaam–karabahi ko mulyankan garna thaleka chhan.

katipay jenji sarkar sanga asantushta chhan bhane kohi sarkarko mandetanusar chunawma kendrit hunuparne batairaheka chhan. asantushtamadhyeko kehi samuhle sadak aandolan tataune tayari samet gareka chhan.

jenji aandolanko din sadakma nadekhiyeka mıraj dhungana le aaitabar patrakar sammelan gardai aaba aafu sadakma jane batae. dhungana netritwako samuhle sarvapakshiya sarkar gathan ko maag gardai aandolan ghoshana gareko ho.

kathmandau ma patrakar sammelan garī dhungana samuhle bartaman sarkarle jenji aandolanprati dhoka dieko bhandaai sarvapakshiya sarkar gathan ko maagsahit birodh ko karyakram garnuparne awastha aayeko batayo.

dhungana le sushila karki netritwako sarkarko 100 dinko kaam herda asaphal bhaisakeko daabi gardai sombar dekhi nai aandolan garne batae.

‘bhadau ma bhayeko jenji aandolan kunai byaktiko brand ra netako sindhi hoina. aandolanmaathi tekera kohi aglo hune prayas nahos. sushila karki netritwako bartaman sarkarle aandolanko marm bokdaina, hamro netritwa gardaina,’ unle bhane, ‘tyasaile aaba sarvapakshiya sarkar gathan hos. aajako aawashyakta tyasto rajnitik netritwa ho, jasle sabai pakshalaai bishwasma lina sakchha ra deshlai nikas dina sakchha.’

sushila karki netritwako sarkarle aandolanko marm bokna nasakne daabi dhunganale gare. ‘2084 ko chunaw 2082 ma sarna aandolan bhayeko thiyena. yo sarkarle nikas dine kaam gareko dekhinna. sushila kina chunawko rat lagaunuhunchha ?’

yasari dhunganale chunawma janu nahune tark sarkarko 100 dinalai mulyankan garera gareka hoinan. patrakar sammelanma so daabi garepani uni suruwatbatai yo sarkar dhale ra naya sarkar banaunuparne bataunthye. gata kattik 1 gate dal kholne bhandaai ebharest hotelma patrakar sammelan gareka unle aafu harule chunawma jana dal nakholeko tark gareka thie.

tyasbela nai dhangana le yo sarkarko mandet chunaw garaunu narheko bataeka thie. yo sarkar mahatwapurna bishayama sambidhan sansodhan garayera aghi badhna baneko le chunaw garaune yasako mandet narheko unko tark thiyo.

‘yadi ahileko sarkar chunawi sarkar banne kura socnu bhayo bhane tyo bhram ho. yo sarkarko uddeshya yahi awasthama chunaw garaunu hoina,’ unle bhane.

yasari suruwatbatai chunaw nachahneka dhungana aaba bhane gathabandhan banayarai aandolanma jana kassieka chhan. aandolan garne jenji gathabandhanma 26 wata samuh raheko uni nikata harish bhattale bataye. yasama ko–ko chhan bhanne bara chhittai khaline unle batae.

‘deshbyapi aandolan garne yo gathabandhako shakti chahi kati ho ?,’ onlinekhabarko prashnama bhattale bhane, ‘aaba hamile aahwan garne ho. kati aunuhunchha tyo ta bholi nai thaha hunchha. deshlai maya garneharu aandolanma aunuhunchha ra saath dinuhunchha bhanne bishwas chha.’

chunaw nai chahanchha : jenji front

jenji front bhane ahileko aawashyakta aandolan bhanda pani chunaw nai raheko batauchha. raksha bam netritwako yo samuh ko bujhai anusar ahile chunawko bikalpa narheko le sarkarle tyastarph dhyan dinuparchha.

aafu harule pani tyasakai lagi tayari gariraheko ra sangathanbata swatantra ummedwari diekalai sahayog garne yojana raheko frontka aguwa yujan raj bhandari le batae.

anya shaktiko aadma uthaieko aandolanma aafu haruko saath nahune unko tark chha. yasari chunaw bitholne niyat le garine aandolan kunai hisable sahi nahune unle batae.

‘hami aandolanko pakshma chhainau. sarkar dhale ra ahile sarvapakshiyako naamma arko sarkar banaune laphadama fasnu humdaina. aba yahi sarkarle chunaw garaunuparchha ra hamile tyasama sahayog garnuparchha,’ raj bhandari le bhane.

baru aaphno samuh bata kohi swatantra hisable chunaw ladna chahe tyasama sahayog garne unle batae.

nikas ko lagi chunaw aniwarya : jenji mubhament alayans

jenji mubhament alayans pani ahileko awasthama chunawko bikalpa narheko le aafu haru aandolanko pakshma narheko batauchha. alayanski aguwa monika niraula ka anusar ahile miraj dhungana samuh le garne bhaneko aandolanma pani yasako sanglagnata chhaina. baru awastha bujhera sabaile chunaw laai sahayog garidinunle anurodh garin.

‘aba ka–kasle aandolan garne bhanu bhayeko chha, hami tyasama sanglagn chhainau. ahileko awasthama hami chunaw nai hunuparchha bhanne ma adig chhau,’ niraula le bhanin, ‘yadyapi, aandolan garnu sambaidhanik adhikar ho. uhaan harule garnuhunchha bhane hamile kehi bhanne kura pani bhayena. tara ahileko awastha bujhera paripakwa nirnay liidie hunthyo bhanne anurodh matra chha.’

dhungana samuhle uthaeko tatkal sambidhan sansodhan garnuparne mudda ahile ko lagi byawaharik nabhayeko tark pani niraula le garin.

baru yasako satta aafu haru chunaw kendrit abhiyan ma raheko unle bataiin. yadi jenji mubhament alayans wa anya kunai jenji samuh bata swatantra ladne yubalai aafu harule chunawma sahayog garne unko bhanai chha.

‘yadi chunaw laai ali samay bhaidiye ko bhaye hamile dal kholera wa aru kunai tarika le sahabhagi hunthyaula. tara aandolanpachhi ko tin mahina samjhautakai waripar rahanuparyo. rajnitik rupma kehi garna sakyena,’ niraula le onlinekhabar sanga bhanin, ‘tara pani rajnitik nikas ko lagi chunawko bikalpa chhaina.’

chunawko bikalpa chhaina : da kaunsil aph jenji

da kaunsil aph jenjika aguwa bhane ahileko awasthama chunaw bhanda ramro bikalpa kehi huna nasakne batauchhan. koshi pradesh sanyojak uparjun chamalingka anusar da kaunsil aph jenji chunawbata dayabaya garna nahune pakshma chha.

‘aandolan ghoshana garneharu jenji hun ki ke hun ? janta sachet chhan. ko–kasta hun sabai dekhiekai chhan,’ chamaling le bhane, ‘hami chahi yasta phandaka pachadi lageka chhainau. ahileko awasthama chunaw bhanda ramro ra sundar bikalpa kehi pani haina.’

miraj dhungana prati sanket gardai chamaling le thape, ‘hijo jenji aandolanma sadakbatai bhagneharu aaja kina sadakma aunchhu bhandaai chhan. yi kura jantale spashta bujheka chhan.’

chunaw nahuda dui wata batoma muluk hindne jokim dekheka le tyo pakshma deshko bhalo chahane jenji nalagne unle batae. chunaw nahuda ki ta adhinayakwadi shakti aune wa sansad punasthapana hune awasthama muluk jane unle batae. tyasaile jenji le yimadhyeko ke chahiyeko ho bhanne ma spashta hunuparchha.

‘ahileko yubale na adhinayakwadi shakti chahanchha, na ta puraina gundi gyang lai satta sumpne sansad punasthapana,’ unle bhane, ‘tyasaile ahile chunawko bikalpa chhaina.’

