sirkularma harek nirwachan kshetrbata kamtima ek jana jenji yuba ra ek mahila sahit badhima panch janalai pratyaksh tarpha sifaris garna bhaniyeko chha.

‘sifaris bhayeko ummedwar yasaghi nirwachit janapratinidhi bhayena bhayeko khulaune,’ pratyaksh tarphako mapdanda bara sirkularma lekhieko chha, ‘sifaris garda lokapriya ra jitne ummedwar laai prathamikata ma rakhne.’

