sirkularma samparka samanwaya pradesh, upatyaka bishesh pradesh, prabas pradesh, janawargiya sangathan ra morchako kendriya samiti harule dui mahila ra dui purush ka darle chaar–chaar jana sifaris garnuparne ullekh chha.

