5 pus, chitwan . rashtriya swatantra parti (raswapa) ka sabapati rabi lamichhane le aphalai bish bhaeka sarparule ḍaseko ra tyahi bishay li'era ahile pani aphu bachiraheko tippani gareka chan .
Chitwan ko chaubiskotima ayojit sabhalai sambodhan gardai lamichhane le yasto tippani gareka hun . hijomatrai bhairahawa karagar bata riha bhaeka lamichhane lagattai bhaeko pahilo sabhalai sambodhan garne kramma unle aaphumathi anyay bhaeko dohorya'e .
‘Aaja paryanta anyay ka birudhma chitwanbasile ajhai pani anyay ka birudh yah ibata uṭhna, yo gun tapaiharule malai matrai hoina desh ka lagi laga'unubhae ko cha . desh laai tirne tapaiharuko gun sanbahak bhaera desh laai tirnechu,’ lamichhane le bhane, ‘malai ḍasne sarparu mare ki marenan thaha bhaena tara yinle mero sharirma dieko bish bokera ma aja pani bachiraheko chu . mero sharir mathi baseko bish ajhai pani baki cha . ma yo bishay li'era pani laḍchhu . jenji bhaibahiniharuko ragat ko thopa khera jana dinna .’
So kramma unle purana pustaka netaharu taraf ingit gardai uniharule desh lai nai dukh dieko ra tyasko agadi aphalai dieko dukh kehi nabhaeko pani bataye .
‘Yinle malai anyay gare malai thune, dukh die bhnera ke chitta dukha'unu . singo desh laai dukh dieka chan . singo desh ko agadi malai dieko dukh kehi hoina . singo desh ra pustalaai dieko dukh ko hisab mila'unu cha . yiniharusanga laḍnu ra badala lina kunai jaruri chaina,’ lamichhane le bhane .
Unle thap bhaneka chan, ‘hamile laḍnuparne yiniharusanga hoina, jasalai jantale apadast gare yiniharu ko agadi ke laḍnu ? hami laḍne ta hamilai dieko upharswarup chaḍhayeko bhog, shok, jamin, ashiksha, berojgari birudh laḍne ho .’
Unle jenjiharule gareko aandolan ko prashansa pani gare . ‘ma jenji pustaka dajubhai didibahiniharulai salam bhanna chahanchhu, hamile ta chunaaw kureka thiyau, tapaiharule chunaaw sunaaw kurnubhaena . baja'idinubhayo,’ lamichhane le bhaneka chan .
7 pus, kathmandu . nepali congress ka mahamantri gagankumar thapale 15aum mahadhiwesanma sabapatima laḍne ghosana gareka chan .
Aphu nirbachit bhaeko kathmandu–4 ka neta–karyakartasanga chhalpal gardai mahamantri thapale aphu sahabapatima laḍne ghosana gareka hun . unle aphu sabapati banne dabai samet gare . ‘ma ahile parti ko sabapati ko 15aum mahadhiwesan ko sabapati ko ummedwar ho . ma parti ko sabapati banchhu, banna chahanchhu’, unle bhane .
Mahadhiwesan netritwa paribartan garne matra nahi partilai naya bana'une samay bhaeko bataundai unle ahile kriyashil sadasyako kam dhila bhaeko bhandai aapti janae . unle mahadhiwesan samaymai garne bishwas aphuma raheko bataye .
Mahamantri ko haisyatle aaphule parti sabapati sherbahadur deubalai mahadhiwesan samaymai hunuparne bhaniraheko ra yasbarema aphu spasht raheko unako bhanai cha . unle bhane, ‘samaymai adhiwesan sampanna garna sakin thiyo . tara kata kata kata ali ali tyo smel gariraheka chhau . yo bishayama parti ko liḍarshiplai spasht bhaniraheka chhau . hami junsukai mulya chuka'una pani tayar chhau .’
Mahamantri thapale niyamit wa bishesh adhiwesan huna i parne bataundai mahadhiwesan bina congress nirbachanma najane bataye .
7 pus, kathmandu . nepali congress ka mahamantri gagankumar thapale samwidhan laai ṭryakma pharka'una 21 phagunma nirbachan garnu anibarya raheko bataeka chan . unle mahadhiwesanbina congress chunaawma najane pani bataye .
Dhum barahi byankeṭma somabar kathmandu–4 ka karyakartaharusanga ko chhalphalma unle parti ko mahadhiwesan garera 21 phagun ko nirbachanma sahabhagi hune bataye .
Thapale bhane, ‘adhiwesan bina nepali congress parti nirbachanma jadaina, janu hudaina, jana sakdaina, kliyar yasama .’
Unle ahile sajjanik bhaeko wada adhiwesan ko sandarbhma kehi din talamathi bhaepani adhiwesan narokine bataye . ‘jun tithima hamile wada ko adhiwesan bhaneka chhau, tyasama ek–dui din talamathi hola, thorai talamathi hola,’ unle bhane, ‘ki niyamit adhiwesan sarasar agadi badhcha ki bishesh mahadhiwesan huncha . tyobhanda arko kura kehi pani chaina . adhiwesan huncha .’
Unle adhiwesanpachi parti chunaawma jane bataye . chunaaw phagun 21 mai hunuparnema unle jod die . ‘parti ko adhikarik nirnayama ṭekera maile bhannuparcha ki phagun 21 gate chunaaw garne kura anibarya cha,’ mahamantri thapale bhane, ‘phagun 21 gate chunaaw hune kura kina aawashyak cha bhane samwidhan ṭryak bhanda bahira gaeko cha, samwidhan laai ṭryakma pharka'unaka nimti phagun 21 gate nirbachan garne .’
Nirbachanbata chuni'era aune sansadle bistarai samwidhan anusar kamharu agadi badha'une unako bhanai thiyo . ‘nirbachanle naya sansad lyauchha . ani tyo sansadle bistarai aaphno kam garne,’ mahamantri thapale bhane .
21 phagun ka lagi tay bhaeko nirbachan congress ka lagi anukul–pratikul jesukai bhaepani chunaawma januparnema mahamantri thap ko jod thiyo .
‘Chunaaw ko parinam ke hola, hamra lagi kati anukul hola, kati pratikul hola, tyo hamro aantarik bishay ho,’ unle bhane, ‘hami chhalphal garaula, tyaslai anukul bana'une kosis garaula, thap mehanat garaula, aaphna kura bhannaula .’
Mahamantri thapale chunaaw nabha e desh thulo anishchitataraf jane pani jikir gare . ‘ab chunaaw bhaena bhane hami pheri thulo anishchitataraf jana sakchhau . 2007 sal dekhi 2015 sal ko jasto abastha,’ unle bhane, ‘tyaskaranle garda elekṣan garne kura aawashyak bhayo .’
7 pus, kathmandu . nepali congress ka mahamantri gagan thapale jenji aandolan ra tyaspachi ka dinama aaphno khaṭma chor suteko dekhi ḍera napayeko samma ka anubhuti sajjanik gareka chan .
Dhum baristhit ek parti paryasama aja bihan karyakarta tatha shubhachintakharusanga ko chhalphalma thapale jenji aandolan ra tyaspachi ka dinama bhoge ka anubhawharu sajja gareka hun .
Jenji aandolan ko kramma ratopul sthit thapako gharama agajani bhaeko thiyo . tyaspachi ḍera khojeko tara gagan thapa basne bhanne thaha paepachi gharbeṭile bhadama dina namaneko unle suna e .
‘Baneshwar ma saathiharu le ḍera khojeko, huncha–huncha bhanubhaecha . ani ko basne bhaneko falano bhanepachi ta pahila cha bhaneko pani pachi ta yaha pani aaudaina bhnera patha'idinubhaecha,’ mahamantri thapale suna e, ‘hamro halat ta tyo thiyo ni pahila .’
Baneshwar ma ḍera napayepachi ahile budhanilkantha ko chapalima basiraheko unle janakari die . ‘khojdai jane kramma mero shrimatle bhaitika laga'une gareko dai, uhaharu ko purano ghar, tyaha pahila skul baseko, ahile sareko, thyakka samay mil yo, kehi samay khali bhaeko thaum, tyaha basiraheko chu .’
Aphu janmehurkeko ratopul ko ghar punarnirmā huna kehi samay lagne ra punarnirmā bha'isakepachi punah tyah i sarna unale bataye .
Thapale jenji aandolan ko kramma gharama agajani bhaepachi sthanīya karyakartaharu le aphalai ra aaphno paribar ka sadasyaharulai uddhar gareko pani unale bataye .
Tesro din gharama pugda aaphno khaṭma ek jana chor sutiraheko dekheko thapale suna e . ‘tesro din gharama pugda euta chor ta mero luga laga'era merai khaṭma sutirako,’ thapale bhane, ‘kahabata ayo yo bhaneko ta pahilo dinma lugasuga chorera gaeko rahecha . aru kehi baki cha bhnera ako re . a'epachi ekachhin sutna man lagyo re . yaso suteko nidra lageko re .’
Tyo chor laai ‘saathiharu’ le tyah ibata pakra'u garera li'era gaeko unale bataye .
‘Bhadau 23 gate ko ghatana ko jimmedari tatkalin sarkarle linuparcha’
Congress mahamantri thapale gata bhadau 23 gate jenji aandolan ko kramma bhaeka ghatana ko jimmedari tatkalin sarkarle linuparne bataye .
Thapale bhane, ‘ghatana kasari bhayo yasko chhanbin hudaigarla tara yasko jimmedari sarkama basne saathiharu le linuparcha . ma bha e linthēm . jo cha usle linuparcha . pradhanmantrile linuparcha .’ naitik jimmedari lidaima kohi sano nahune unako bhanai cha .
Unle bhadau 23 gate ko ghatanalai akalpaniya, duḥkhad ra kalo din ko sangya die . congress neta samet raheka tatkalin grihamantri ramesh lekhak laai rajinama dina lagaeko janakari pani unale die .
6 pus, kathmandu . nepali congressma aagami nirbachan ka lagi jilla-jillabata ummedwar ka aakanshiharuko naam pradesh hudai kendrama sifaris ko kam chaliraheko cha .
Jillale naam sifaris garda sabbhanda dherai mahamantri gagankumar thapako naam sifaris bhaeko cha . thapa bibhinna jillasanga tehrathumbata ekal sifaris bhaeka thie .
Tara, koshi pradesh samitile bhane unisanga sita gurung ko pani naam thapera kendrama pathaeko cha . gurung bigatit pratinidhi sabhama congressbata pratyaksh nirbachan jitne ekmatra mahila sadasy thin .
Koshi pradesh samiti ka upasabapati rameshjang raymajhile sita gurung ko naam thapera pathaiyeko janakari die .
Unle mahamantri ra uninitak harule ‘sṭanṭ’ gariraheko arop pani lagae . ‘mahamantri ra unka manchheharule sṭanṭ gare . yasari sifaris nai garne ho bhane sherbahadur deuba ko naam sabai jillabata hunthyo hola ni,’ unle onlinekhabarsanga bhane, ‘shekhar koirala ko tyastai hunthyo hola, purnabahadur khadka ko pani kati jillabata naam aunthyo hola . nirbachan ra ummedwar sifaris ko bishayama aaphno kshetr jaha ho tyah i aawashyak rajnitik garaun . yasari sṭanṭ garera partilai rajnitik rupma phaida hudaina ni .’
Yasaghi sita gurung ko naam jillabata sifaris nahunuma purbasansad tulasi subba samuha habi bhaeko tyaha sthit kehi neta batauchan .
‘Aghillo chunaawma tulasi ta sitalai hara'una bhnera lageko manchhe ho ni . ahile unle ummedwar nai sifaris nahune gari jillama rajnitik gareka hun,’ tehrathum jilla karyasamiti ka ek padadhikarile bhane, ‘tulasilai ta anushasan ko karbahi pani gariyeko cha . karbahi phukuwa pani bhaeko chaina .’
Sarkarle phagun 21 gate ka lagi ghosana gareko pratinidhi sabha nirbachan ka lagi pratyaksh taraf thapa ko matrai ra samanupatik taraf bhane tehrathum congressle krishnaman tumbahamphe, dilliram nepal, bijay sambahamphe, rudra kandangwa, basanti subba gurung, sharada koirala ra shanisha bheṭawal ko naam sifaris gareko thiyo . samanupatik taraf bhane pradesle pani kunai naath thapghaṭ nagareko batai'eko cha .
3 pus, kathmandu . nepali congress ka mahamantri gagan thapale congress rashtriya shakti bhaeko hunda abhibhawakiya jimmedari hune bataeka chan .
Congressle wigatma aaphu bhitra ko ghau pida wirsera rashtriya shakti ko bhumika nirwah gareko mahamantri thapale smaran gardai bhane, ‘sabai kura wirsera hinsa ko aahabata desh laai bahira nikaleko hoina ? tyaspachi ko chunaaw haareko hoina hami ? chunaaw jitne ra harne ko hisab kitab gareko hoina ni . hamro jimmedari nirwah gareko ho ni .’
Ahile tyastai bhumikama congress dekhinuparne mahamantri thapale bataye .
Phagun 21 gate hune nirbachan bartaman byabastha ka lagi sarbadhik mahattwapurna raheko bataeka chan . pokhara ma ayojik karyakramma mahamantri thapale phagun 21 gate chunaaw nabha e arko bato li'era durghatanatar laane bataye .
‘Bangaladesh, shri lanka, maldibs, pakistan desh haru bhanda bharat thik dhangale agadi gairaheko cha . bharatma elekṣan ko chakra brek bhaeko chaina,’ mahamantri thapale bhane, ‘harne le jitne laai swikar garcha . satta ko hastantaran baḍo sahaj dhangale huncha . nepalma tyo brek bhayo .’
2062/063 salpachi nirbachan chakrama brek nabhaeko unale bataye . tokieko samayama chunaaw gara'une pramukh jimmedari sarkar ko bhaeko mahamantri thapale bataye . dalharusanga sanwad garne ra kohi ka manma sanshay bhahe hata'une kary sarkar ko bhaeko thapale bataye .
‘Taṭastha bhumika dalharuko rahanupardacha . ra, dalharule pani sath dinupardacha,’ mahamantri thapale bhane .
24 mansir, kathmandu . nepali congressle parti ka sampurna kriyashil sadasyaharuko sadasyata anibarya rupma nabikaran garna matahat laai nirdeshan dieko cha . mahamantri gagankumar thapale budhabar paripatra garera matahat laai sampurna kriyashil sadasyaharuko sadasyata anibarya rupma nabikaran garna nirdeshan dieka hun .

paripatrama nabikaran garda mrityu bhaeka, party parityag gareka, kendriya anushasan samitile antim karbahi garer niskasan gareka tatha kriyasil nabikaran nagaridinu bhanī likhit wa maukhik agrah garekāru bahēk sabai sadasyaharuko nabikaran aniwary rupma garna ka lagi aawashyak byabastha garn bhaneko kriyasil sadasyata byabasthapan samiti sadasyak prakash rasailee ‘snehee’ le jankari diye . unka anusar atyant jaruri bhandaī 77 watai jilla sabhapatiharulaai pathaeko paripatrama kriyasil sadasyaharuko sadasyata nabikaran narokne gari aawashyak byabastha ra matahatka samitima samanway garn bhaniyeko cha . ‘nabikaran ka lagi yogya byaktiko kunai karanle nabikaran rokie ma nijle sadasyata nambar ra shulkasaha sadasyata byabasthapan kendriya samitima nivedan die ma kendriya karyalaybata nai sadasyata nabikaran garna sakne nirnay bhaeko hunda kasaiko pani nabikaran narokne gari aawashyak byabastha ra matahatka samitima samanway garnu garaunu hola,’ mahamantri thapale bhaneka chan . kendriya karyasamiti baithakle gareko nirnay anusar naya kriyasil sadasyata bitran ka lagi pratinidhisabha kshetrīya karyasamitilaai nai sidhai sadasyata pharam pathaeko paripatrama ullekh cha . ek matra nirwachan kshetr bhaeka jillale 10 pus bhitar ra duibhanda badhi nirwachan kshetr bhaekale jillale 11 pusma sampurna prakriya pura garer naamawali prakashan gari kendrama pathaunu parne paripatrama ullekh cha . ‘naya sadasyata bitran nepali congressko bidhan, niyamawali ra kendriya karyasamitiko nirnay anusar sahaj ra byapak bitran garne partyko niti raheko le sohi anusar mapadanda samet pathaisakeko awasthama mapadanda pugeka byaktilaai sahaj dhangale sadasyata nabikaran tatha bitran gari tokiyeko samay bhitrai kendrama upalabdha garnu garauna hun yo paripatra garieko cha,’ mahamantri thapale bhaneka chan . 9 pus, janakpurdham . atyadhik jadoka karan dhanusha hamsapur nagarpalika-2 baghachaudaka 62 barsiya bauelal sada ratbhar nidauna sakdainan . patalo chadar odhera paralma sutne sadalaai tyattile jado chalna muskild parchha . chisole nidra naparepachi uni rati nai ghur baler tapanchan . ‘hami garib manche . bharpet khana ta muskil cha . odhne-ochyaune kaham bata lyaunu ?,’ mangalbar madhyahna aangana baser dhan chhandai gareka unle dukhesho pokhe , ‘tal paral ochhyamchu . mathi patalo chadar odhchu . yasle jado thegdaina . dherai jadole nidra nalagepachi ghur tapchu . jiu tataer feri sutne prayash garchu .’ sadaki shrimati sanechari devi pani ochyaune-odhneko abhawma jadole kathyangrinchin . ailani jaggama khar-paralko chano bhaeko 15 barsa purano ghar jirna bhai dhalne awasthama pugeko cha . tyahi ghar ma sada dampatiko gujara chaliraheko cha . khetma jhareka dhanaka bala badhaer safa gari kutako chamal khayera duwai janko saanjh-bihan katcha . uniharuko lagi euta nyano kambal kinnasamet paisa chaina . tyahi bastika kehi musahar paribarka ghar janata aawas karyakramantargat madhesh sarkarle banai dieko cha . tar sada dampatilaai jado chalna ghur ra paralkai bhar cha . unka kancha chora ramsharan ko paribarka 6 jana sadashya pani arko phuskai ghar ma paral ra euta kambalko saharama rat katiraheka chan . sthaniya ra pradesh sarkarle aaphu haru bare kahilyai nasocheko bhandaī sadale kathyangrier rat kātna badhya bhaeko gunaso gare . unkai chimekiki 65 barsiya kesodevi sada pani diuso karib 12 baje tira angenama ghur tapdai thiin . ghur karib nibhisakeko thiyo . chadar odhera ghur najik baseki kesodevisaha unka sat janko paribar paral ra euta kambalko bhar ma gujara chalairaheko cha . ‘jado dherai cha . paral ra euta kambalka bhar ma sat jana sutchaum . dherai jado bhayeparalai odhchaum, nabhe ghur taper jado bhagaumchu,’ unle aafno pida sunain . chimeki rajkishor sadako awastha pani ustai cha . unko taukomathi otka lagi chyatieko plastic matra cha . tintir chyatieka kapdale gherieko thau ma paral ochyaer euta patalo kambal odhi uni sutchan . ‘yaha buba sutnuhuncha . ghar bhitra bhij ra buhari sutchan . arko thau ma ma ra ama sutchaum . aru kunai upay chaina,’ chori bhuli sadale sunain . jadoma sthaniya 65 barsiya duhkhani sadako pani din-rat ustai cha . afantale dieko eutai kambal paribarko jado chalne sahara baneko cha . jaso taso sutchan . tar jiuma lagaune nyano luga, chadarbahek kehi chaina . ‘kutumbale odhne kambal nadieko bhaye kati garo hunthyo . paral ra yahi kambal jado katne sahara ho,’ duhkhanile bhanin , ‘odhne-ochyaune yahi patalo chadar ho . yasle jado jadaina . dherai jado bhayobhane ghur tapchu .’ bauelal, keso devi ra duhkhani sada matra hoinan . aawashyakata anusar jadoma odhne-ochyaune tatha lagaune kapadako abhaw singo bastima cha . yasle bridhdadekhi balbalikasamma jadoma kathyangrin thaaleka chan . katipay balbalikaka khuttama chappalsamet chaina . yi basti udaharn matra hun . tin din dekhi madhesh ma atyadhik chiso badheko cha . bihan ko samayama sheetalahar chalcha . madhesh ka praaya pratyek sthaniya taha ma yastai dalit tatha bipanna basti chan . odhne, ochyaune ra lagaune nyano kapadako abhawma jado badhdai jada janajeevan kashtakar baneko cha . tar uniharulaai lakshit gari sthaniya ra madhesh sarkarle khasai tayari gareko dekhidaina . tarai madhesh ma sheetalahar badhepachi kaiyau sthaniya tahale bidyalaharuma jado bida dieka chan . hamsapur nagarpalikaka meyar pradeep yadavle bhane aaphno palikaka dalit bastima odhne-ochyauneko abhaw naraheko dabi gare . unle kehi gharparibarma matrai samasya raheko bataye . ‘jadoma odhne ra nyano kapadako thoraailai matra abhaw cha . jado chalna daura bitranko tayari gardai chaum . kambal kharidbare aba basne baithakle nirnay garcha,’ unle bhane . 9 pus, kathmandu . singo lumbini pradesh sakshar bhaeko cha . yasko aupcharik ghosana yahi pus 13 gate garidai cha . dang ko deukhuri ma bishesh karyakram aayojan garer sakshar pradesh ghosana garna lagieko ho . samajik bikas mantri janmajay timilsinale mukhyamantri chetanarayan aacharyale sakshar pradesh ghosana garne jankari die . lumbini pradeshma parne sabai 12 watai jilla sakshar bhaekale singo lumbini pradeshlaai nai ‘sakshar pradesh’ ghosana garna lagieko unle bataye . unka anusar anusar dang, palpa, arghakhanchi, gulmi, rupandehi, banke ra kapilbastu jillama saksharata dar 96 pratishat bhanda badhi cha . saksharata dar uchch bhaeka palikahruma rupandehika butwal upamahanagarpalika ra tilottama tatha palpako tansen nagarpalika chan . SEE parikshako natijama pani sudhar dekhieko mantri timilsinale bataye . unka anusar shaikshik satta 2080 ma 38.65 pratishat uttirn dar raheko ma 2081 ma 62.06 pratishat pugeko cha . 9 pus, kathmandu . nepali congressko kendriya karyasampadan samitiko baithak aaja basdai cha . diuso ek baje kendriya karyalaya sanepama basne baithakma kendriya karyasampadan samitika padadhikari evam sadasyaharulaai pani bolaieko cha . baithakma 15 aum mahadhiveshan ko karyatalika, aasanna pratinidhi sabha nirwachan lagayatka bishayama chhalafl hune congresska mukhya sachiv krishnaprasad paudelle jankari die . 15 aum mahadhiveshan ka lagi purwanirdharit samayabhitra kriyasil sadasyata nabikaran ra bitranko kam sampanna nabhaepachi congressle mahadhiveshan karyatalika heraferko tayari gareko cha . congressko gata kendriya karyasamiti baithakle pus 26 gate dekhi 28 gatesamma 15 aum mahadhiveshan garne nirnay gareko thiyo . tar, kriyasil sadasyata natungeko lagayatka karan karyatalika prabhabit bhaepachi hereferko tayari garieko cha . sansthapana paksh aagaami 2 magh ma wada adhiveshan garnuparne pakshma dekhieko cha . tar, mahamantri gagan thapa ra bishwaprakash sharma 26 pusma wada adhiveshan garnuparne batiraheka srotko bhanai cha . 15 mangsirma sampanna kendriya karyasamiti baithakle 16 pusma wada adhiveshan garne nirnay gareko thiyo . 9 pus, kathmandu . pratinidhisabha sadasyako nirwachan ko miti najikidai jada rajnitik dalharule aantarik tayarilaai tiwra pareka chan . nirwachan aayogle rashtriyasabha ra pratinidhisabha sadashya nirwachan ko kaamlaai ekaisath agadi badhaeko cha . aayogle aagaami magh 11 gate hune rashtriyasabha sadashya nirwachan ka lagi jilla nyayadhishlaai nirwachan adhikrit niyukt garesakeko cha . yasaigari pratinidhisabha sadashya nirwachan ka lagi samanupatikatarfko ummedwarko bandasuchi pes garne samayasima najikidai garda rajnitik dal le aantarik tayari tiwra pareka hun . bighatit pratinidhisabhama raheka rajnitik dal ra naya darta bhaeka sabai dal le samanupatik suchi tayar garna aawashyak rajnitik chhalafl tatha tayari gariraheka chan . mangalbar matrai rashtrapati ramchandra paudelle pradhanmantri sushila karki, pramukh tin rajnitik dalka shirsh netasanga chhalafl gareka thie . sarkarle nirwachan ka lagi aawashyak tayari gareko, aayogle tayarilaai tiwra pareka karan kramashah watawaran bandai gaeko cha . nirwachan aayogka prawakta narayanprasad bhattarai anusar pratinidhisabha ko nirwachan ka lagi 93 dal le samanupatik suchima rahan nivedan dieka chan . aayogle samanupatik nirwachan pranalitarf sahabhagi hune rajnitik dalka lagi karyatalika banaisakeko cha . dalharule naya pratishatka aadharama samaweshi samuha milaer aagaami pus 13 ra 14 gate ummedwarko bandasuchi pes garne samayasima tokiyeko cha . aayogle samanupatikatarfko ummedwar chhanot ka lagi rajnitik dalaai aawashyak talim dieko cha . yasbata samanupatikatarfko pratishat nirdharan evam janasankhyaka aadharama badlindo byabastha anusar kaam garna sahaj hunecha . aayogle rashtriya janaganana, 2078 anusar janasankhyaka aadharama samanupatikatarfko pratishat nirdharan gareko cha . janagananama samaweshitarfka kehi samuhama janasankhya thapghat bhaeko sohi anusarko prabandh garieko cha . -rassasbata 9 pus, kathmandu . sarkarle gathan gareko uchchastariya rajnitik sanwad samitile aaja rashtriya swatantra party (raswapa), rashtriya prajatantra party (raprpa) ra janamat partyko karyalaya anugaman gardai cha . hijo yo samitile congress, emale ra nekapako kendriya karyalaya anugaman gareko thiyo . samitile aaja bihan 11 baje janamat partyko karyalaya, diuso 1 baje raprpako karyalaya ra diuso 3 baje raswapako karyalaya anugaman garne karyakram cha . tyaskramama ti partyka netaharusanga chhalafl pani hunecha . sarkarle kanoon, nyaya tatha sansadiya mamila mantri anil sinha ko sanyojakatwama sanchar tatha suchana prabidhi mantri jagadish kharel ra pradhanmantrika pramukh rajnitik sallahakar ajayabhadra khanal sahitko uchchastariya rajnitik sanwad samiti gathan gareko cha . so samitile aagaami phalgun 21 gate hun gairaheko pratinidhisabha sadashyako nirwachan ko watawaran banauna ka lagi dalka netaharusanga bhetghat tatha chhalafl gardai aayeko cha . sarkarka prawakta samet raheka sancharmantri jagadish kharele nirwachan ko mahol banauna charanabaddha rajnitik wartaa ra sanwadlaai tibra ta dier dalharukai karyalayama pugera wartaa gariraheko bataye . ‘nirwachan ko watawaran ka lagi sarkarle charanawaddha wartalaai nirantarata dieko cha, sarkar imandaritar saatha nirwachan garauna khojiraheko bhanne sandesh ho ra dalharulaai sakaratmak dabaw pani ho,’ mantri kharele bhane . mantri kharele nirwachan ko mahol banauna ra rajnitik dalharulaai pani yasprati kendrit garauna sarkar dalko karyalaymai pugera wartaa ra sanwad gariraheko ullekh gare . 9 pus, kathmandu . rahadani bibhagle aba dui karyadin bhitra rahadani upalabdha garaune janayeko cha . aawashyak bhaekalaai tattakai upalabdha garaine bibhagle janayeko ho . kul teen lakh chayannai hajar thaan rahadani chhapai bhayera aapurti bhaesakeko bibhagle janayeko cha . bibhag anusar yasaghi antarim awadhi ka lagi saat lakh thaan rahadani pustika upalabdha garaune nirnay bhaeko thiyo . bibhagle haal purna kshyamata ma rahadani aapurti garairaheko janayeko cha . rahadani jilla, ilaka prashasan karyalaya tatha bideshsthit nepali niyogbata aawedan dieka laai upalabdha garinecha . gata mangsir 15 samma aawedan diekalaai yahi pus 15 gatesamma naya rahadani upalabdha garinecha bhane tyaspachi aawedan diekalaai kramashah upalabdha garine bibhagle janayeko cha . – rassasbata 9 bhadau, kathmandu . raprpaka barishtha upadhyaksh evam purbakpatrakar rabindra mishrale hiraasat baseka bela lekheka kavitaharu ko sangrah bhadau 28 gate sarvajanik garne bhaeka chan . gata chait 15 gate ko rajabadi aandolan pachi pakrau pareka mishrale 50 din hiraasat basda lekheka kavitaharu sangrahit gari ‘mathiko aadesh cha’ namak pustak sarvajanik garna lagieka hun . mishrale aaphno kawita sangraha hiraasatsanga ko badhyatmaka sansargabata janmieka santan bhayeko bataye . ‘yi kawita ‘hiraasatko ‘m’ ka aawaz, aaweg ra aartanad hun,’ unle bhaneka chan . ‘50 din hiraasatma basda malaai 35 wata kawita phurechan . kawitako soch dimagma aaunu samanya ho tar, tyo soch kawitako swarupma abibyakta hunu asamanya ho . hiraasat basaima malaai nirantar rupma kawitaka sochharu dimagma phurechan ra tinlaai maile kawitama rupantaran garna sakechu,’ kawitabare unle bhaneka chan . chhoto awadhi ma aaphule dherai kawita nalekheko bhandaī mishrale hiraasatma ekai din dui wata samma kawita lekheko bataye . mishraleko yo dosro kawita sangraha ho . unko pahilo kawita sangraha ‘rabindra mishraka kawita’ 2071 salma prakashan bhaeko thiyo . mishraleko kawita sangraha fine printle prakashan gareko ho . 8 saun, kathmandu . gata 15 chaitma rajabadile rajasanstha punasthapanako maagsaha kathmanduko tinakunema pradarshan gare . hinsatmak baneko ukta pradarshanma duijanale jyanasamet guma e . pradarshanko kramama rashtriya prajatantra party (raprpa) ka barishtha upadhyaksh rabindra mishrale 86 barsiya nawaraj subedilaai haat samayer manchma puryaka thie . subedi tyatibela rajasanstha punasthapanaka lagi gathit ‘sanyukt janaandolan samiti’ ka sanyojak thie . sanyukt janaandolan samitiko sanyojak bhaepachi subedile sarvajanik karyakrambatai raprpa parityag ko ghosana gare . tyaspachi subedile raprpama samhaldai aayeko anushasan samiti sanyojak padma adhyaksh rajendra lingdenle roshan karkilaai manonit gare . subedilaai padamukta gareko behora narakhi unko thau ma arko byaktilaai jimmedari dieko thiyo . 25 asarma adhyaksh lingdenle gareko ukta nirnaypachi raprpabhitra spasht dui kitta dekhieko cha . yadyapi, subediko sanyojakatwama raheko nirdeshak samitima sadasyasachib samet raheka barishtha upadhyaksh mishra partybhitrako kichaloma kahikatai boleka chainan . subediko jimmedari khosieko ra prawakta sagun lawatilaai padamukta gareko bishayle raprpabhitra bibad badhdai gaeko cha . sansthapanaitar samuha baithak nai baser adhyaksh lingdenko nirnay badar ko maag sahit nirwachan aayog pugyo . asantusht pakshako baithak ra shringkhalawaddha bignaptiharu ma mishra maun chan . 29 asarma asantusht paksh nirwachan aayog jada mishra gayenan . netaharulaai padamukta gareko bishayama aayogle raprpasanga jankari ka lagi patra katisakeko cha . barishtha upadhyaksh bikram pande, upadhyaksh mukundashyam giri, mahamantridway dhawalshamsher rana ra kunti shahile adhyaksh lingdenko swechhacharita swikarna nasakine bhandaī bignapti nikalda mishra paksh-bipakshma bolenan . bignapti nikalneharusanga rusht adhyaksh lingdenle upadhyaksh girilaai padamukta gardasamet mishrako aupcharik dharana sarvajanik bhaena . party bhitrako yoko ukusamukusama barishtha upadhyaksh mishra kin maun rahe ?, uniprati prashna uthauneharu partybhitra chan . party bhitro aantarik bishay matrai hoina, arko sandarbhama pani unko boli achael kam bhaeko cha . samajik sanjalma sakriya mishra 15 chait agadi dinmai aadha darjan samma twit garthe . hiraasatbata riha bhaepachi uni samajik sanjalma pahileko tulanama kam dekhinchan . raprpabhitri unipakshiya netaharu aantarik kichaloma fasne chahana nabhyaekai karan mishrale pratikriya nadieko bataumchan . mishra najik kendriya sadashya jayaprakash guragaai le aantarik kichaloma lagne swabhab nabhyaekale pratikriya nadieko bataye . guragaaile onlinekhabarsanga bhane, ‘bidhiko pakshma uha le sadhaim wakalat garnuhuncha . samuhagat bibadma parne uhan ko ruchi hoina . tyaskaran naboleko ho . samagra bishayama kehi samay pachi bolnuhuncha .’ guragaai anusar mishrale kawita sangraha ko tayari gariraheko le pani arko bishayama dhyan kam dieka hun . hiraasatma rahnda lekheka kawitako sangrah nikalne tayarima mishra chan . party bidhan micher padamukta gareko bhandaī ek pakshko adhyaksh lingdensanga takaraaw badheko cha . purvadhyaksh dr. prakashchandra lohani, barishtha upadhyaksh bikram pande, padamukta upadhyaksh giri mahamantridway rana ra shahi adhyaksh lingdenwirudh chan . sansthapana pakshka netaharule purvadhyaksh lohaniko uksahatma arko netaharu parichalit bhayeko aarop lagaeka chan . adhyaksh lingdenle bidhisangat nirnay nagareko sansthapanaitar ko dabi cha . party ma rajinama dine paddhati raheko tar adhyaksh lingdenle tyo paddhatilaai anusharan nagareko asantusht pakshko jikir cha . raprpako sanshodhit bidhan (2078) ma ‘pratyek tahako karyasamitika kunai pani sadashyale adhyakshasamaksh ra adhyakshle karyasamitisamaksh aaphno hastakshyarit rajinama pes gari swikrit garaer pad tyag garnasakne’ byabastha cha . yahi bidhilaai adhyaksh lingdenle kulchieko asantusht pakshko nicho cha . anushasan samiti sanyojak subedile party ma likhit rajinama dieka chainan . likhit rajinama nadieko ra baithakma chhalafl ka lagi pesasamet nabhaeko hunda asantusht paksh adhyakshko nirnay badar hunuparne maagsaha nirwachan aayog pugeko cha . raprpa bhitraka asantusht pakshka netaharule mishrale aaphu harulaai samarthan garne dabi garchan . asantusht pakshko baithakma sahabhagi ek netale bhane, ‘uha (mishra) jiko maun samarthan cha . partybhitra bidhan ko byabastha sabai bhanda badhi uha laai jankari cha . bidhi michneka birudh uha hunuhuncha .’ tinakune ghatnama hinsa bhadkaeko aaropma unisaha 15 chait rati pakrau pareko mahamantri dr. rana sakriy bhaer party ma lageka chan . asantusht pakshko aguwai ranale gareka chan . mishra bhane sakriy dekhidainan . raprpa netaharuka anusar mishrako maun rahuma adhyaksh lingdenko byabahar pani jimmedar cha . mishra netritwako brihatta dhruwikaran pakshbata ekta garer aayeka netaharuko naam nirwachan aayogma adyawadhik garna adhyaksh lingdenle chaso nadieko uni pakshiya netaharule bataumchan . 2079 asoj 12 mama mishrale raprprasanga ekta gareka thie . uni pakshbata padadhikari, karyasampadan samiti ra kendriya sadashya gari 40 jana neta kendriya samitima rahne sahamati baneko thiyo . ektabata aayeka netaharuko naam haalsamma nirwachan aayogma adyawadhik huna sakeko chaina . jabaki, padadhikari herafer ka lagi nirnay bhaeko mitile 30 din bhitra nirwachan aayoglaai jankari garaunu parchha . raprpale party baithakma nirnay garer abhilekhikaran ko prakriya suru garekai chaina . rajnitik dal sambandhi ain ko dafa 51 ma bhaniyeko cha, ‘dal ko aaphno naam, bidhan, niyam, chhap, jhanda wa chihnama bhayeko paribartan wa sanshodhan, padadhikari ko herafer ra aayogle tokebamojim ka arko bishay ko jankari 30 din bhitra aayoglaai dinuparnecha .’ mishra pakshka netaharuko nirwachan aayogma abhilekhikaran garauna adhyaksh lingdenle party baithakma agenda pes gareka chainan . karyasampadan samitilaai yasbarema nirnay lin kendriya samitile adhikar pratyayojan gareko kendriya sadashya ranjan karkile jankari garaye . karyasampadan samitika ek sadashyaka anusar adhyaksh lingdenle ukta bishayama chhalafl garnegari aupcharik agenda baithakma prawesh garaeka chainan . adhyaksh lingdenko naam nalii uni lakshit tippani bhane budhbar mishrale gareka chan . samajik sanjalma lingdenlaai chetawani ko shailima mishrale bhane, ‘ma deshko pramukh neta hoina tar padiya rupma partyko ekjana pramukh neta hum . tyasaile ma atyawashyak nabhai bolldina .’ partybhitro aantarik bishayama maunata raheko ma pratikriya ka lagi agrah garda mishra bolna tayar bhaenan . 7 saun, kathmandu . rashtriya prajatantra party (raprpa) ka barishtha upadhyaksh rabindra mishrale partyko pachhilo bibadma aaphu naboleko bishaylaai darayeko rupma nalina aagrah gareka chan . adhyaksh rajendra lingdenprati lakshit gardai unle yadi aaphno pratikriya naaunulaai kasaili darayeko bhane gari lieko bhaye tyas ko mulya mahango parnesakne bhandaī chetawanish sahitko status samajik sanjalma lekheka hun . raprprasanga party ekta bhayeko tin barsa pugna lageda samet mishra pakshka 40 jana ko neta ko naam nirwachan aayogma adyawadhik garne prakriya suru garieko chaina . adhyaksh lingdenle niyatabas prakriyama nalageko mishra pakshka nichi cha . sohi sandarbhama ek barsa agadi dieko television antarbarta ko euta clip share gardai mishrale lekheka chan, ‘nabolnulaai “darayeko“ bhaner kasaili socheko cha bhane tyas ko mulya mahango parna sakcha .’ unle aaphu atyawashyak nabhai naboline ra sabaili ekaipatak bolna naparne pani batayeka chan . 6 saun, kathmandu . rashtriya prajatantra party (raprpa) ra rabindra mishra netritwako brihatta dhruwikaran pakshadhar bich ekta bhayeko 3 barsa pugnai lageda nirwachan aayogma mishra pakshka netaharuko abhilekhikaran nai nabhaeko khuleko cha . raprpaka barishtha upadhyaksh mishra pakshka kendriya sadashya ranjan karkile yo bishay bahir lyaeka hun . 12 asoj 2079 ma raprprasanga ekta hunda mishra pakshbata 6 padadhikari, 5 karyasampadan ra 29 sadashya gari 40 jana kendriya samitima rahne sahamati bhayeko thiyo . brihatta dhruwikaranbata raprpa kendriya samitima raheka 40 janako naam haalsamma nirwachan aayogma adyawadhik nabhayeko karkile onlinekhabarsanga bataye . unle bhane, ‘adyawadhik ko prakriyama nalaijanuko karan adhyaksh rajendra lingden swayam laai thaha hola . hami 40 janako naam adyawadhik garne prakriya partyle suru garekai chaina .’ ekta prakriyabata aayeka netaharusaha padadhikari ra kendriya samitima bhayeko heraferlaai nirwachan aayogma jankari garauna party baithakma chhalaflsamet bhayeko cha . party kendriya samitiko baithakle nirnay gari nirwachan aayogma abhilekhikaran ka lagi aawashyak nirnay lin karyasampadan samitilaai adhikar pratyayojan garieko thiyo . kendriya samitiko nirnayma bhanieko cha, ‘ekta mahadhiveshanpachi bibhinna party, abhiyan tatha praweshmargat party ma jodieka tatha nabin raprpa karyayojanantargat chhanot bhaeka 40 barsamunika kendriya sadashyalaai nirwachan aayogma baidhanik rupma abhilekh garauna kendriya sadashyako sankhya thap garnuparne bhaekale party bidhan 2048 anurup aawashyak nirnay lin kendriya karyasampadan samitilaai adhikar pratyayojan garne nirnay garieko cha .’ mishra pakshka netaharuka anusar adhyaksh rajendra lingdenle ektapachi aayeka netaharuko naam adyawadhik garauna nirwachan aayogma jane agenda karyasampadan samiti baithakma kahile pani lyayenan . antim patak 11 dekhi 13 magh samma baseko kendriya samitiko baithakma adyawadhik ka lagi nirwachan aayogma tattakai januparne gari chhalafl bhayeko thiyo . karyasampadan samitima agendako rupma adhyakshle prastab nalyayepachi nirnay garnegari chhalafl huna nasakeko ektabata aayeka karyasampadan samitika sadashyale jankari garaye . ‘adhyakshle chhalafl ka lagi yo agenda karyasampadan samitima kahile pani lyaunu bhaena . netaharule aaphno bichar bhane rakhnubhayo,’ raprpaka karyasampadan samitika ti sadashyale bhane, ‘hamro pakshbata bhanda yo bishaylaai jod dier arko netaharule uthaunu bhayeko thiyo .’ unka anusar padadhikari, karyasampadan samiti ra kendriya sadashya thapieko bishaylaai baidhata pradan garna barishtha neta mishrale adhyaksh lingdenlaai patak patak aagrah gareka thie . party ektapachi nabin raprpako awadharana lyaune barishtha upadhyaksh mishra thie . unkai parikalpan anusar yuwa umer samuha laai partyko kendriya netritwama puryauna yuwaharulaai prawesh samet garaieko thiyo . nabin raprpaantargat purush ra mahila gari 20 jana laai raprpama prawesh garaieko thiyo . uniharuko naam samet adyawadhik garieko chaina . mishra pakshka netale bhane, ‘tin barsa agadi ekta garer aayeka netaharuko adyawadhik ko prakriya suru nagarnele asti bharkhar prawesh garne laai prakriyama lanchan hola ?’ haal raprpako abhilekhikaran bhaeka raprpako kendriya sadashyako sankhya 199 cha . mishra pakshadhar ra yuwa umer samuhabata prawesh garekaharulaai suchima rakhiyeko chaina . samayma nirwachan aayogma adyawadhik nagarda ektasangai jodieka neta karyakartama nishkriyata badheko mishra pakshka netaharuko bhanai cha . mishra pakshka ek netale adhyaksh lingden adyawadhik nagarne niyat dekhinulaai ‘uchch tahako fatyai’ ko sangya die . ‘adyawadhik nagarer mishra pakshlaai kamjor garaune khel adhyakshbatai bhayeko cha . niyatabas kamjor banauna lagieko cha,’ mishra pakshka ti netale bhane, ‘bela mauka herer pelna yahi aujaar prayog garna hola .’ raprpa ra mishra pakshko ekta hunda charbundey sahamati garieko thiyo . sabai tahgat samayojan dui pakshka adhyakshko sahamati anusar hune sahamati garieko thiyo . sahamatianusar sansthapana pakshko byabahar nadekhiyeko bhandaī mishra paksh adhyaksh lingdensanga rusht baneko cha . adyawadhik nagarne bhaner sanwad ko kramama lingdenle kahile pani nabhaneko tar niyatabas prakriyama lana nakhojieko mishra pakshko nicho cha . mishra pakshka uppallo tahaka ek netale bhane, ‘adyawadhik nagarne kahile pani bhanu bhaena . ektabata aayeko shaktilaai manonit garer kendriya sadashya thapne jasto kura garnuhuncha .’ dui pakshko ekta bhayeko hunda manonit sadashya sadashyako rupma thapne kaary swikaryo nahune mishra pakshka netaharuko bhanai cha . upadhyaksh evam sangathan bibhag pramukh buddhiman tamangle ektapachi aune netaharuko nirwachan aayogma abhilekhikaran bhayeo nabhaeko jankari nabhayeko bataye . adyawadhik garna ka lagi sachivalaya laai thaha hune unle bataye . mahamantri evam sachivalayaka rajendra gurungsanga bujhna patak patak phone garda uthena . lingdenko byabaharbata asantusht rahe pani party nirmanprati mishrale purna sahayog gardai aayeko uni pakshiya netaharuko dabi cha . nabin raprpa, nabin samajhdari ko awadharana lyaunuko saathai deshbharika prashikshanma adhyaksh lingdenlaai saghairaheko mishra pakshka netale jankari garayeka chan . netaharuko baidhatama prashna uthe sangai mishra pakshadhar adhyaksh lingdenasanga rusht bhayeka chan . dui dal ko ekta hunda ullekhit sahamati anusar sansthapana paksh agadi nabadheko asantusht pakshka netaharuko bhanai cha . ektalaai koshedhunga bhaneka dui pakshbichko ektama haal sankat dekhieko netaharu swikarchan . nirwachan aayogma adyawadhik nabhaeka mishra pakshka kendriya netaharu : padadhikari rabindra mishra– barishtha upadhyaksh sharadaraj pathak – mahamantri ujwalkrishna shreshtha – sahamahamantri amrit pudasaini – sahamahamantri harikrishna adhikari – sahayak mahamantri saurendrabahadur shah – sahayak mahamantri kendriya karyasampadan samiti anupaman saiju shobha shakya nirupama yadav karnabahadur shahi narayan koilara kendriya sadashya arjunprasad khanal hariprasad gautam uddhavaprasad bhetawal ghanabahadur shah chokaraj ghimire jayaprakash guragaai dipakprasad upreti madhusudan kesi ranjan karki roshan shiwakoti laxmanraj sitaula sushil devkota dinesh bhandari madhav bhandari pashupati pande shanta giri eske shreshtha laxmi ghimire basanti gyawali bina shah bipana sharma saraswati panthi bhusal nirupama yadav laxmi shahi raju basyal basant blon tamang keshav khanal sangita shreshtha shashank shamsher thapa.
Pradhanmantriy pranali ta hoina yo, taipani partiharule pradhanmantri ummedwar tokdasamma taibisek thikai thiyo. chunaaw laai raunak thapna gagan thapa, kp oli, balen shah, hark sampang naam pradhanmantri ka sambhabit anuhar ko rupma pes gariyo.

Yi anuharle laib dibeṭ ta garenan. kohi boldai naboline, kohi boleko bolyai garne, kohi thikthikai bolne, kohi chahin phaisbukma lekheko lekhyai garne. laib nabhaepani dibeṭ ta bhairahekai cha bhanne maanera chitta bujhaiyo. taipani bahas garnalai arko pani bishay thiyo ghosanapatrako. congress, emale, raswapa, nepa, shram sanskriti parti, ujyaalo parti ityadile ghosanapatra lyaulan, ani tyaska adharma kun dal kasto bhnera nagarik bich bahas garaula bhaneko!

Yo espreso shoṭ tayar pardasamma ghosanapatra nai!

Baru ummedwarharule aaphu yo mantri, aaphno saathi tyo mantri bhnera matdatar samu nirlajja talama khulakhula ghosana gareko po dekhnu paiyo. dhanushatir manish jha aaphu sahit 5–6 jana ummedwar ko mantrimandal nai ghosana gardaithie. dp aryal pani aaphu chunaawpachi kun mantri banne bhnera tokdai bhoṭ magdaithie.

He prabhu; chunaaw phagunma cha, mantri chahin maghmai tokna milcha ? ke ho yojana, ke ho karyakram, kasari prapt huncha tyo ḍelibhari bhnera bahas garne belama mantri tokdai hiḍne kasto thiti aailagyo gãṭhe !

Raswapa ka sabapati rabi lamichhane le upasabapati swarnim wagle laai bajeṭ lekhna suru garnus bhandasamma manchhe le khasai kuro kaṭena. ab dp aryal, manish jha, ganesh parajuli lagayale hami yo mantri banne ho, bhoṭ dinuhos bhanda matdata akka na bakka parne abastha a'ekai ho. a'eko chaina ra ?

Chunaaw kin laḍne bhanda mantri banna. sansad bhaera, ramro bidhayak bhaera desh ko niti, thiti basaalne kuro kasai ko chaina. sab ka sab laai yaha pawar chahieko cha. sattama napugunjel, sansadmai matra aḍkera bariyo bhane yo chunaaw laḍeko arthai nahola jasto gari garib jantako dimag bhuṭne kam bhairaheko cha.

Chunaaw ta wigatma pani a'eko thiyo, bisheshata sangai wikriti pani anek a'eka thie chunaawsangai. tara yo had ko wikrit abastha yasaghi apwad bahek dekhnu paiyeko thiena.

2070 sal ko samwidhan sabha chunaaw ko prasanga yaad ayo. maobadi chhapamar dasta ka upapramukh nandakishor pun ‘pasang’ kathmandu kshetr na 4 bata laḍdai thie. maobadile unlaai bhabigrihamantri bhnera khub prachar garyo. pasangle aaphnai mat ko suraksha garna sakena. uni grihamantri banne din kahilyai aayena.

Rajnitik ekai dinma sikincha, bujhincha bhanne hoina. sikne sanskar bhane chahinchha. matdatar sanga mat magna jada binamrata bhanne chij pani sathai li'era januparcha. ani bacha pani thik ko gare huncha. chunaaw aayo bhandaima asambhaw ṭaip ka bacha garnai parch bhanne chaina. raswapa kai dui neta bhaepani rabi ra balen laai sangai syangja lagera jane bacha asambhaw ta hoina, mahatwakankshi bhane abashyai ho.

Rabi ra balen laai ekasath matdatar ko gharama lyai dine jasto hasyaspad bachama nepal desh ko matrai peṭenṭ rait bhane lagdaina. yasta ta kati chan, kati. deusima bhanchan ni– yaha matrai hoina, sansaibhari.

Dui wata udaharan diu– belayati pradhanmantri tharesa me wirudh san 2017 ma chunaawi abhiyan chalaune kramma sansad larḍ bakeṭheḍle pratigya gare– kathamkadachit aaphule sansad jite ma 10 barsa bhanda munika keṭakeṭi le phrimaa ekasinge ghoda chaḍhna paunechan.

Kunai bela kyanada ko rainosoras partile pratigya gareko thiyo– phyaṭṭ aaphno partile jite ma gurutwakarshan ko niyam nai kharej garinecha. ekapalt ta shahar ko pallo bhag ajhai ramrosanga dekhna sakiyos bhnera pahad nai tin phiṭ saridine hawadari bacha samet gareko thiyo yo partile. khai ra, rainosoras parti ka bacha ta ramailo ka lagi thie.

Yobhanda badhta udaharan chahin nadiu. natra yaha baidesh ka ramra udaharan chahin nasikne, hawadari kura chahin uttikhērai sikihalne chalan basla.

Ab yasama gambhir kuro pani garu. ghanashyam bhusal le hamisanga pachhilo kurakanima bhane jastai bigyan, itihas, tark, samaj sabaisanga bekhabar bhaera kasari rajnitik huncha ? purano kharab, naya sabai ramro bhnera matrai kasari huncha ? hijo ka netaharule samajma akrosh ra ghrina aropit gare bhandaima nayako namama je pani swikary huncha bhanthaaneko ho bhane tyo sarbatha galat hunecha.

Anuhar matrai naya bhaera hudaina, ejenda ra sanskar pani naya hunuparcha. yaha ta chunaaw prachar ka namama yasto atichar huna thalyo ki ‘thal khaau ki bhat khaau’ bhanne aapat aailagla jasto bhayo.

Jenji aandolan ka karan 2084 ma hunuparne chunaaw 2082 mai huna lagiraheko cha. aandolan ka adhikansh aguwa sadakmai chan. yujan raj bhandarile onlinekhabarma bhane jhai– chunaawpachi ka chunautipurna dinharu ka lagi samet khabardari garna thulo nabayuwa pankti sadakmai rahane cha.

Ra, jenji ka namama jo aphalai naya dabai gardai chunaawma gairaheka chan, tinmadhyek thuprai ko tal bhane kukhuro laai bhoṭ magne dekhi dhanushṭankar aasan garne samma cha. aam manchhe ko jiwanma jodine gari kam garne ummedwarharulai social miḍiya ka bhaira caṭkeharule mat di'iraheka chan.

Yastai udeklagdo abastha aula bhnera hunuparcha kabi bimal nibhale kunai bela ek sansad ko bhawna jhalkine gari kabita lekheka thie– aune chunaawma ma aaphai laai bhoṭ dine chaina.

Hamroma mat dan bhaeko cha, adhikar hunai sakeko chaina. hami raitai matrai chhau, nagarik bannai sakeka chainau. tyasai le hamilai jati paṭamurkh bana'una sakincha, tyati nai saphal bhai'incha bhanne bhramak socle hamra ummedwar grast chan.

Wigatma kp olile kusmama rail purya'une kuro garda thapaḍi baja'une hathaharu achel yastai hawadari naya barśan patya'una lalayit chan. aainda hami yaso nagaru ! chunaawma ta aaphna bichar ra yojana bhanne po ho. chunaaw aunu kahile kahile mantri chhannu ahile !

Yasari bhoṭ magne kunai bishay napayera gaun–gaunma mantrimandal ko suchi sunaudai hiḍne ho ra ? chunaaw ta laḍne po ho, chunaaw kai apaharan garna jane ho ra ?

Yaha sadhai byakti ra byaktitwa ko pratispardha chalyo. naya rangichangi parti matrai hoina, wigat kai sthapit partiharule pani bichar ra ejenda ka adharma parti bana'una chhade. hijoaja ta shanka nai lagna thalyo– yi parti hun ki byaktitwa sankalan kendra hun !

Kukhura ko bhalesanga bhoṭ magiraheki ashika tamangdekhi chunaaw najita'e maridinchhu bhanne aasik ummedwar amaresh singh samma herda lagcha– yo deshma chunaaw aayo, lokatantra aayena.

Jun nirbachan kshetrma ummedwar nai yati bhawnuk chan, tinaka pani ummedwar arthaat pradhanmantri ka ummedwar kasta holan! shayad yahi kuro parikshan garaun bhnera kehi mitraharule laib dibeṭ mag garnubhayo.

Pradhanmantriy pranali ta chaina nepalma tara ekase eka pradhanmantri ummedwarharu khada chan. gagan thapa, kp oli, balen, hark sampang– hal laai hamikaha pradhanmantri ummedwar hun. mana ta prachanda laai pani thiyo hola ummedwar baniheru, tara purba pradhanmantri madhabkumar nepal, jhalanath khanal ani aadha darjan jati up–pradhanmantri bhaeko nekaple euta sajha pradhanmantri ummedwar khada garna i sakena. bhare phyaṭṭ wamdewa laai pani rahar lagyo bhane ‘buḍha, yo umermaa desh nabana'u’ bhnera tinalai kasari rokne!

Ekthaum prachandale chahin bhane, ma chauthopalt pradhanmantri banera kehi garna chahanchhu. bana'una baki desh aaphnai jiwan kalma bana'une prachanda ko ghiḍghiḍo baki cha. rahar ta baburamle pani gareka thie, tara bichaima ‘bhurajniti’ adityadi dekhaudai gorakha ko ummedwari sthagit gare.

Baru rabi lamichhane tyag garna sakne aaphnai kshamatasanga chhaṭapaṭindai yatikhera aram gariraheka chan. uni pradhanmantri ko daudma chaina bhanne yathartha patya'una swayam raswapa laai gahro pariraheko cha.

Yasaghi virlai matrai pradhanmantri ummedwar tokinthyo. 2056 ma krishnaprasad bhattarai congress ka tarphabata khada gariyeka yasta ummedwar thie, jasalai parti sabapati girijaprasad koiralale ek barsapachi hata'era wastabik satta aaphnai hatma lie. kishunji jasta janeman pradhanmantri ummedwar ko yo hawigat dekhepachi yo deshma pheri kasaile pradhanmantri banchhu bhnera chunaawaghi nai ghosana garne himmat ta ke, rahar samet garna sakena.

Ab yaspaliko kura garau. yi ummedwarmadhyek ek pradhanmantri ummedwar balenle yo pradhanmantri dibeṭ kai auchityama bandej laga'idie. 23 bhadau ka hinsakarta, ani tinaka matiyar sanga bahas gardina bhnera unle kp oli ani matiyar ko rupma tatkalin satta sajedar congress ka neta gagan thapalaai bhanna khoje jasto cha. oli–deuba sarkar ma sahabhagi narheka tatkalin mahamantri gagan ko jawaf ta a'eko chaina tara tinle nabanirbachit sabapati ko rupma congress ko sanepa mukhyalaybata aru ummedwar lakshit kada tippani nagarna karyakartalaai nirdeshan dieka chan. emale ra raswapa bich bhane laib dibeṭ nabhaepani phaisbuke juhari chaliraheko cha.

Naya nepal ko pratham rashtrapati prachanda laai bana'u bhanne nara bhitta–bhittama lekhie. baburam laai kam garni diu bhnera ṭisarṭ chhapi'e. oli ba aai lab yu, aaimwid kp oli hyasṭagy kyaempen chale. ab palo a'eko cha naya kheladiharu ko. dui char papulisṭ jhwank, ani tinako bhayabah parinam nadekhi nepali samajle chetdaina bhanne spasht nai cha. natra bahira a'era aaphna rajnitik prastabharu rakh nupardaina ? chunaawi ghosanapatra lyau'nupardaina ?

Gadi ra baikma jilla, palika ghummeka tasbir a'isakda pani yi ummedwar wastabama ke chahanchan bhanne ajhai khuldaina ! tyo tasbir matrai bahira auncha, jo ummedwar ko prachar ṭimle bahira lyau'na chahancha. aja tyasmaa ai ko sahayog li'era janta urleko tasbir dekha'incha. kohi prashna sodhdaina, kewal laik, lab ra phalo matrai garcha. yo bhagyabadi deshma matdata sadhai data rahe. nagarik banena, kewal phalo'ar bane. papulijm ko unmadma chunaaw swayam bhaktimarg ko anuṣṭhan banna pugcha. chunaaw chihn ko rajnitilaai maṭhamandir bhitraisamma nirbadh prawesh gara'i'eko cha. yasto ma tapai hamro haisyat kewal ek bhoṭ matrai rahancha. wigat ka anuharharule kora siddhant ko namama yojanabihin pratigya garera jantalai nirash banayeka thie. ahile tyobhanda ramra din aulan bhaneko singai desh riyaliṭi sho jasto banna gaeko cha. singo desh sas rokera balen kaha puge, kaha rokie, ke khae, ke lae bhnera hernama mast cha.

Ek mana ta thikai lagcha– thulo bhiḍ dekha'una sayau bas khojera janta osarnu bhanda baru ai phoṭoshapbatai mast man lagejati bhiḍ dekha'u. phek tasbir dekha'era jhuṭo kura phailiepani garikhane kisan ra majdur ko samay ta bachcha. jantalai khachakhach basma osa'era antama besahara chhaḍidine hamra partiharu ko prawrittika karan kamsekam aainda aam nagarik ko shareaam beijjati ta hudaina! maile phek phoṭo prawardhan garna khojeko hoina phek pratigyaharubata asthayi unmuktimatrai khojeko hu.

Ra, yasama aapat pareko cha olidekhi prachandasammalai. emale karyakartalaai aaphno samarohma a'eka manchhe bhnera ai sahara lindasamma tinalai majai thiyo. balen pakshle acham, dhan gadi, gularia ra damakma jasta phoṭo nikalyo, tyaspachi ta ai sanga emale chhakka parne abastha aayo.

Bolna ta oli pani boliraheka chan, tara uni asaphal hunu agaai asandarbhik holan bhanne ashanka cha. yo beglai kura ho, oli ka barema nepali janta ke thaniraheka chan bhani emale partile nai thaha pa'una baki cha. emale mahadhiwesan olilai kartaldhwanile punah anumodan gardai bharkhar sakieko cha. pahile pahile emale mahadhiwesan ya chunaawma tyasta bahas haru hune garthe jo aja congress gardai cha. naya pustako bidrohsanga congress punarjagrit hudaigarda emale ka pharak mataharu aanganma samet spesh napaaune gari badhāri'eka chan.

Tara prashna garnu bhane congress laai pani pugeko chaina. achel chunaaw bichar haru ko pratispardha garne maidan hoina kewal anuharai anuhar ko bhiḍ ra tyasle sirjana gareko ṭhaṭṭa, prahasan jasto matrai baniraheka bela gagan thapa katai dehatatira apil gariraheka chan. bishwaprakash sharmale aaphai chunaaw ta laḍeka chainan tara unale dieka bachaharu taraf manishharule dhyan dina bhyaekai dekhidaina. uniharulai timile kin samaymai bidroh garenaun, kin dhilo garyau bhnera pani matdatarharule sodhna sakeko dekhidaina.

Tyasai le yati sajilai dhukka hune sthiti chaina. jantalaai ta phagun 21 gate sodhaula, tapaiharu ke chahanuhuncha? tara aaja ta janta swayamle ummedwar laai sodhnuparyo ni, tapaiharu kasto desh ra samaj bana'una chahanuhuncha?

Yo yasto prashna ho, jasako yatharthaparak jawaf nakhoji chunaawma bhoṭ matrai haleko bhar ma hamile khatrai lokatantrik abhyas garyau bhnera gamakka pardai hiḍnu ko kunai artha hune chaina.

Tapai ab ummedwar ko namaste matrai khayera nahiḍnus. baru junsukai naam, rang, barn, bhesh ka ummedwar a'e pani euta cheklisṭ bharā'unus.

Tinalai sodhnus : tapai jitnubhayo bhane thikai cha, harnubhayo ke garnuhuncha ? malai dhandhali garera haraiyo, ma ta lokapriya nai thiem bhan nuhuncha ki matdatar laai dhanyabad di'era parinam swikarnuhuncha ?

Tapai lokatantra laai kewal haarbijit ko bishay bana'unuhuncha ki parinam bhanda prakriyalai bishwas garnuhuncha?

Tapai nagarik swatantrata ra arthik bikas, ani rashtriyata ra rojgari madhyek ek rojna bhannuhuncha ki yi duwai ekasath sangai sangai aaphno netritwama jana sakchan bhanne matdatar laai bishwas dila'unuhuncha ?

Tapai aaphusanga asahamataharu a'e bhane tinalai ṭhokne, sidhya'une, pratishodh rakhne garnuhuncha ki uniharusanga bahas garne, aaphna tarkma sahamat gara'une kosis garnuhuncha ?

Tapai kasaisanga sakbhar dekha i naparne, dekha pare pani euta sṭaṭas dhaskayera lusukka dulobhitra pasnuhuncha ki aam nagarik sanga amane samane gaph gardai hiḍnuhuncha ?

Pheri ekapaṭak sodhau– tapai dhamki, pratishodh ra badala ko bhasha bolnuhuncha ki pratispardha ra niyamasangat pratidwandwitako ?

Tapai patrakarharusanga pratyaksh antarkriya garnuhuncha ki tinalai sake piar ṭimma lyau'ne, nasake charitrahitya garne kamama lagnuhuncha ?

Tapai aaphule matrai prashna garnu parch bhan nuhuncha ki harek din jawafdehi bannu aaphno pani dayitwa ho, aja aaphnai chahin badhta dayitwa ho bhanne samjhanuhuncha ?

Sundakhēri yi prashna saiddhantik jasta sunielan, tara tapai hamro jiwanma sabbhanda badhi artha rakhne prashna hun. yi yasta prashna hun, jasako jawaf khojna i ka lagi hamro agraj pustale thulo balidani gareko cha.

Aawashyak paryo bhane yi amulya adhikarharu ko lagi pheri pani thulo sangharsha huna sakcha.

Ra, yi yasta prashna hun jasako abhawma lokatantra bachne chaina. hamilai bharat, china, america, singapur ko sapna kapi pesṭ gardai suna'in sakcha. yuwa bishleshak rohej khatiwada le lekheka chan– narama ta aatmanirbhar huna sakenau hami. ‘abki bar’ ka nara charkai chan. nara ra anuhar ko chhabi pradarshan awichchhinna cha. makhamali sapana ka puriya baḍera pheri pani jantalaai shaktibihin bana'une ra kunai na kunai swarup ko adhinayakwad yo deshma lyau'ne khatra huna sakcha.

Purana parti ka purana netale khaṭara gadi kuda'e bhandaima sidhai bhittama lagera ṭhokka'un udyat kari'arisṭaharulai kasari anumodan garna sakincha ra ? kharab a'eka thie bhnera khattam ko khoji garna hudaina. shushasan kewal shabd hoina. yaha kohi dherai barsa lagayera bhrasṭ bhaeka thie, kohi ta salanal kaṭina napaudai bhrashtachar sikiraheka chan. rajnitik kewal kulin ra nawadhanadya ko pewa banne khatra cha jaha samanya manish ko pahumch samma pani chaina. durbhagya, garib ka nara tinai le kabja gareka chan.

Euta kura yaad garaun, abko chunaawma wampanthi ra dakshinpanthi wa udarwadi partiharu ko bichma dekhindai a'eko bhed lagbhag meṭina pani sakcha. yasto baicharik bhinnata meṭina thale ko khasma ta dherai barsa bha'isakyo, jasalai chunaawle pani pushṭi garidine sambhawana dherai cha.

Belayat ka tatkalin pradhanmantri toni bleyarle san 2006 ma majdur yuniyan ko karyakramma boldai bhaneka thie– ab wam ra dakshinpanthi bichko bibad hune chaina. baru khulapana ka samarthak ra band samaj ka pakshadhar bichko.

Bleyarle 20 barsaghi boleka sabai prasanga nepal ka lagi kamayab naholan tara adhar bhoot nishkarsh yeti bela dhyan di'era paḍhnuparne bhaeko cha. kinabhane nepalma yetibela naya parti rojne ki puranaima ramaune bhanne bahas chaliraheko cha.

Ma yati matrai agrah garna chahanchhu– hami desh ra jantako bhabishya ka barema sachchikai chintit hune ho bhane naya parti wa purana hoina, wampanthi wa udarwadi hoina, kun parti khulapana laai aṅgālcha, kun parti chahin ghumai phirai band samaj kai pairawi garcha bhanne adharma laai ummedwar wa parti chhanna manak bana'u. naya huda i ramro wa naramro hudaina, purano huda i pani uhi hudaina. herau ta, 064 sal ka nayaharu ko achel chautarphi halat cha.

Chunaaw ta auncha jancha, samajma tyaspachi pani hamile bachnuparcha. hamilai kun chahin shaktile chainle sas fern dincha, kunle chahin nissasindo maholma rumalya'ucha bhanne motamoti aakalan garaun.

Aaunus ekapalt hami wigat taraf hoina, bhabishya taraf pharkera sochau. yo chunaaw purano ra nayabich hoina, khulapana ka samarthak ra birodhibich hudaicha. ummedwarharubich laib dibeṭ ta lagbhag ab nahola, tara bha'echa bhane hamile aghi bhanieka cheklisṭ ka bunda ajhai baliyo ra spasht bana'era hamra prashnaharu tikharau. tinaka jawaf ka adharma chinau– ko naya ho ra ko purano.

Asti bharkharai ta ho, syabbas mahavir bhnera maile espreso shoṭ banayeko. yinle namuna mantri bhaera arulai dekhaulan bhaneko, yinai po sansad uṭhna myagdi hiḍidie.

Kunai bela yi mahavirle rashtriya aawishkar kendra ka lagi sarkarsanga paiso magethē. sarkarle paisa dincha, tara tyasko byabasthit lekha parikshan hunuparcha hai bhnera adhikariharule bhanda yinalai kaha khatapata rakhirahane bhanne shuddh lahaḍbaji ayo. yinalai ain, niyam ka nitigat aljhoma aljhin jhyau lagda pani niyat sahi bhaeka manchhe hun, garun na ta bhanne dherai laai lagethyo.

Ab yinai mahavir laai aaphno kshetrma dabang kam garera pugena. pachi shushila karki sarkarma mantri bannuparyo, sansad bannuparyo. tyasaghi yinako kitab bechne abhiyan thiyo, tyo pani aaphnai jiwanī. kunai bela shikshak sangathanma hiḍeka mahavir laai rajnitiko dhit marna pugekai rahenachh bhanne aja a'era pramanit bhayo. mantralaya bhitra kawaj khelnedekhi kholaka machhalai bhashan suna'une yinaka ṭikaṭke sṭanṭ pani kahin na kahin prasidhikoko bhokasanga gaera joḍinda rahechan.

Mahavir, kulaman ghisin, jagadish kharel, bablu gupta– yinalai mantri banna jun gatiko hataro thiyo, tyati nai hataro dekhiyo chunaaw laḍna. yi char bhaile pramanit garidie, aago ko rap bhanda dherai tagaḍa huncha sattashakti ko rap. yinalai chunaaw i laḍnu thiyo mantri kin hunu, mantri hunu thiyo bhane chunaaw kin laḍnu ?

Ab yinle hamilai sodhlan, ke hamile chahin laḍnai napaune ho ta ? harek nepali nagarik sanga samwidhan, kanun bamojim chunne chunine hak huncha. tara yo samwidhan sammat hak ko upayog garda lajako duryupayog garnuhudaina. yati bujhera pani bujhapacha'une yi mantriharulai ma ke bhanu ? chunaaw gara'unaka lagi baneko nagarik sarkar kai mantrilai chunaaw laḍera mantri banne lobhupar malai sajilo gari byakhya garna aayena.

Tyasai le maile sahara liem hamro purbiya darshanle dekha'eka char khal ko lobh: kameshṇa, witteshṇa, ji beshṇa ra yasheshṇa ko byakhya upar. kameshṇa arthaat kamwasana ko moha. witteshṇa arthaat dherai dhan thuparne moha. jibeshṇa arthaat ajhai dherai bachera sukhasayal bhogne moha. ab ayo yasheshṇa arthaat naam, kirti kama'une moha.

Yo kuwa khana'era bha e pani naam kama'une bhanubhaktakalin ghasi ko desh nepalma yeti bela dherai laai sansad uṭhnu pareko cha. sansad uṭhepachi charchauras aaphno barema hallak halla huncha. desh bana'une pahilo pailo tyahi dinbata suru huncha. yi, yasari yo garib desh aaphnai sansadkalam dhani bana'une dhangdhangibata yi char mantri pani tada basna sakena. kulaman bijuli kharidma aaphna nanga swarthaharu marphat ekspoj bha e. jagadish ka barema dherai nabhanau, chunaawi sarkar ka dayitwa samjha'une unka tin mahinaaghi ka bhidiyo klipharule aaphai dherai thok bhaniraheka chan. bablu guptalaai sansad uṭheko ma shubhakamana dine man thiyo, kehi sapta ka lagi mantri khana kin kude holan bujhna saki'ena.

Balen, hark sampang, renu dahal lagayat sthanīya palika ka pramukh, jasle karyakal pura nagari sangh taraf uṭhna hiḍe. prashna na uniharuko barema pani garna sakincha. tara chunne chunine watawaran bana'una chunaawi sarkarama gaeka mantri yasari aphalai nai chunna kudeko dekhera shushila karki, rameshwar khanal, om aryal, anil sinha adilaaai chahin mannai parne dekhiyo. ke thaha, sansad uṭhihērne mana ta tinalai pani thiyo ki ?

Eka bar ko junima sansad chahin nai nahune ho ra mantriji haru ? sansad bhai'ena bhane bachekai artha nahune ho ra ?

Yaad garnuhola, chunaawpachi pani jiwan cha. chunaaw ta auncha jancha, tara tapai hamro nishṭha, man pratishṭha bhane ekapalt gaepachi pharkera aaudaina. aajabhanda 10 barsaghi sansad bhaekaharumadhyek aaja katijana aaphno nishṭhama ṭikeka chan, katichahin bila'era kaha haraisake ? bishwaprakash sharma, yogesh bhattarai, sumana shreshtha, bidya bhattarai jasta tin barsaghi sansad baneka neta yaspalt ummedwar uṭhenan. harekpalt chunaawma uṭhepachi matrai sandarbhik banirakhincha bhanne dharana galat ho.

