Yo nepal deshma smal kanṭri sinḍram dherai bhayo. yaspaliko chunaawma yahi biknewala cha. raswapa bhanne parti kholeko, balen tyasma prawesh gareko, kulaman pani gaeko, pheri nikleko idhar udhar sabai baideshi shakti ko prabhab bhandine. hami ta gardaithiyau, baideshle diena bhandine. kunachahin baideshle diena bhnera sodhyo bhane tai chup mai chup basdine.

