Yasto garne ma yaha ka wampanthi haru tyattikai chan. rochak ke cha bhane itihasma yi sabai yastai shaḍyantra bata aphu samet kunai na kunai rupma pidit thie. pradip nepal bitera gae. tara tinaile ghanashyam bhusal laai amerika bata sanchalit ejenṭ bhani arop lagauthē. ghanashyamle kasailai yasto arop lagae ki lagaenan, unai janun. tara nepalma kunai pani aandolan yassai hudaina, arule gara'idincha bhani patya'uneharu dherai chan.

