Hamile aaphna kam thikthak garyau bhane hami nai yogya banchhau, hami nai baliyo. aaphno thailo ramrari nabādhne, chimekilaai chordosh laga'era huncha ra bhanya ? abakash unmukh netaharule bujhne kuro ke ho bhane, matdatarharu dherai shikshit ra sachet bha'isake. ab uniharulaai pahile jhai khali america, china, bharat, japan, koriyalai dosharopan gareko bhar ma ullu bana'una sakinna. dilli wa beijinma pani paryo bhnera yaha chhata oḍhne kura ta milena.

Kp olile galti gardainan. unale harne sambhawana ta chhadaichaina. unale jitda jit huncha, harda dhandhali. jasto ki aaphno tesro karyakal ka lagi bidhan nai sansodhan gara'era egharaum mahadhiwesanma adhyaksh bane lagattai unale himalay ṭibi ko yakshya prashna ka lagi nimesh banjāḍelai kehi dinaghi antarwarta die.

Tya antarwarta ka kramma olile 2065 salma emale ko aathaum mahadhiwesan hunda jhalanath khanal sanga adhyaksh padma bhaeko aaphno parajay laai karib–karib kharej nai gare. tyasabela mat baks saṭera aphu, kashinath adhikari lagayatlai haraiyeko bhane. tyasko ek salaghi 2064 ko samwidhan sabha chunaawma oli jhapama parajit thie. tara unale patrakar sanga bhaneka thie, ‘maile haareko hoina, jantale galti gareka hun.’

Patrakar le sodhe, ‘ab ke garnuhuncha kamared ?’ ‘maile kehi garnupardaina, arko chunaawma jantale aaphno galti aaphai sachya'uchan.’

Nabhandai olile 2070 ko arko samwidhan sabha chunaaw matrai jitenan; sadiya dal ko netama parti adhyaksh khanalalai majjai le harae. 2071 ma ta unai oli naum mahadhiwesanbata adhyaksh bha e. saptaum mahadhiwesan ka bela parti bhitra aantarik lokatantra ko charko wakalat gardai dastawaj nai pes gareka thie olile.

mathi nai bhanisakiyo, tinai olile dui karyakaal matrai uhi karyakarik padma basna paine bidhanko byabastha aaphulai payak parne gari tibr bahumat marphat sansodhan nai garaye. sampadaksanga ko ek bhelama maile– mukhama mandela, manma mugabe kina bhani sodheko, unale ta messile dui palti matrai khelchha ra ! bhani ultai pratiprashna po tersyae.

emale ahile bidhan anusar nai aghi badheko chha, tara byaktilai suwidha hune gari bidhi sansodhan hunda ahile emalema madhuro pratiwad matrai bhayeko chha. kunai belaka krantikari neta robert mugabe ko patan du:khad dhangale bhayeko thiyo, tyasto nahos bidhi ra thitile kaam garos bhanne apekchha rakhdai aaba emalema kasle aantarik lokatantrako naya dokumen lyala, ahilelai prashna matrai uthauna sakinchha.

ra, olile aaphna kunai pani nirnayako lagi jimmedaripurwak sari bhandelan bhanne sochlai nai sari bhannuparne hunchha. olile sansad bigartan garda uni sambidhanako lagi sarbatha galat thie, tara aaphno lagi shatapratishat sahi. ahile jenji bidrohako balma sattachut hunda uni sansad punasthapana maagdai chhan. olile congress sabhapati sherbahadur deubalai samet aaphno ejendama lagbhag latariske jasa kaaran 21 phagunko chunaw ke hola bhanne shanshaylai bal pugeko chha.

2081 asarma balakotma dahichuira khayera olisanga suru gathabandhan deubale asti bhadaupachhi chhade jasto mahasus hunthyo. tara uniharuko bichma kunai na kunai khal ko rajnitik wacha–bandhan baanki nai chha jasto dekhinchha. yaso herda lagchha, jenjile bhadau ma dherai thok tode, phode, tara oli–deuba gathabandhan hubahu jari chha. chhaina ta ?

natra olile bahumat sabit garna asaphal bhayepachhi 2077 ma bigatan gareko sansadlai adalat marphat punasthapit gardai deuba pradhanmantri baneko kshan samjhaun ta ! paramadeshka pradhanmantri bhanera tyasbela deubalai hiyaunusamma hiyaeka thie olile. harek din aaphnaprati lieko tyo bigatko hurmat birsna deuba yatibela hadai samma tayar chhan.

