yasari kisim–kisimka congressjan bhitra khelna oli ek hisable safal baneka chhan. congress bhitra oli pakshadhar ra oli birodhi bhanera kittabandi nai hola jasto chha. pratispardhi partyko adhyakshle phaleko ejendalai lie ra congress jasto ‘pro–ektib party’ yasaghi kahilyai bibhajit thiyena. baru dui dashakaghi ko itihas samjhaun ta, girijaprasad koiralala aaphna ejenda waripari emale ra aru partyharulai ghumaune lyakat rakhthye. emalema dherai barsapachhi oli unai koiralako pathma chhan.

aaphno pathlai sadar garauna yas bichma olile ke ke garisake, heraun. 19 mangsirma patni radhika sahit maharajganjsthit deuba nibas pugeka olile pheri adhyaksh chunie sangai 7 pusma mahasachib shankar pokhrel lage.

