upasabhamukh ko nirwachan sabhamukh le tokiyeko din ra samayma hune byabastha chha. yasanusar aryal le upasabhamukh ko nirwachan ko miti tokiyeka hun.

sabhamukh ra upasabhamukh ma pharak dal ra pharak lingako byakti hunuparne prawadhan chha. tara, pratinidhisabha ma euta i dalko matrai pratinidhitwa bhayeko wa ek bhanda badhi dal bhayepani ekal ummedwari pareko awasthama sabhamukh ra upasabhamukh dubai eutai dalko pani huna sakdachha.

pratinidhisabha ma raswapa sahit 6 dal chhan. pratinidhisabha ma raswapa dui tihai najik chha. 275 sadasyiya pratinidhisabha ma raswapako matrai 182 sansad chhan. nepali congress 38, nekpa emale 25, nepali kamyunis t party 17, shram sanskriti party 7, rastriya prajatantra party (raprpa) ka 5 sansad chhan.

yaskaran aaba raswapale jaslai samarthan garchha uhi dalko ummedwar upasabhamukh ma nirwachit hunchhan.

17 chait, kathmandu. pratinidhisabhako pahilo baithakbata sabhamukh ko nirwachan prakriya agadi badhaine bhayeko chha. pahilo baithak yahi chait 19 gate basdai chha.

sanghiya sansad sachibalay ka sahasachib ebang prawakta ekaram giri ka anusar pahilo baithak baseko 15 din bhitra sabhamukh ra upasabhamukh ko nirwachan bhaaisaknuparne byabastha chha.

yasanusar sabhamukh ko nirwachan prakriya agadi badhaune bara chhalphal chaliraheko chha. pratinidhisabha niyamabali ko niyam 7 ma sabhamukh ko nirwachan sambandhi byabastha chha.

jasanusar pratinidhisabhako nirwachan pashchat hune sabhamukh ko nirwachan jyeshtha sadashya le tokiyeko din ra samayma hunechha ra tyasako suchana mahasachib wa nijako anupasthitima sachible prakashan garnechha.

prakashit karyakram ma nirdharit samay bhitra kunai sadashya le kunai arko sadashyalai sabhamukh padma nirwachit gariyos bhanne prastab ko suchana mahasachib wa nijako anupasthitima sachiblai dinu parnechha.

yasto prastab ko suchana prastabak sadashya le baithakma prastut garepachhi badhima tin jana samarthak sadashyaharule samarthan garna saknechhan. tyasto prastab ko ek matra suchana prapt bhayema samarthak sadashya le bolisakepachhi adhyakshata garne byaktile prastabit sadashya sabhamukh padma nirbirodh nirwachit bhayeko ghoshana garnechha.

sabhamusakhma ekbhanda badhi ko ummedwari pareko awasthama darta kramanusaar prastabak sadashya le prastab prastut garne ra samarthak sadashya le samarthan garne kram sakiepachhi sabai prastab maathi sankshipt chhalphal hunechha ra tyaspachhi adhyakshata garne byaktile prastab lai kramashah nirnayarth prastut garnechhan.

nirnayarth prastut bhayeko ma jun prastab pratinidhi sabhama tatkal kayam rahekosampurna sadashya sankhyako bahumatbata parit hunchha so prastabma prastabit sadashya sabhamukh padma nirwachit bhayeko maninechha.

pratinidhisabha ma rastriya swatantra party (raswapa) ko 182 sit raheko chha. yasabahek pratinidhisabha ma nepali congress 38, nekpa emale 25, nepali kamyunis t party 17, shram sanskriti party 7, rastriya prajatantra party (raprpa) 5 ra ek jana swatantra sansad raheka chhan.

yo sansadiya ankaganitma raswapale sabhamukh linechha. raswapa bhitra upasabhapati dipi aryal lai sabhamukh banaune gari chhalphal chaleko chha. sabhamukh ko nirwachan pachhi upasabhamukh ko nirwachan hunechha. upasabhamukh ko nirwachan sabhamukh le tokiyeko din ra samayma hune byabastha chha.

sansad sachibalay ka prawakta ekaram giri ka anusar sabhamukh ra upasabhamukh ma pharak dal ra pharak lingako byakti hunuparne prawadhan chha.

‘sabhamukh ra upasabhamukh ma pharak dal ra pharak lingako byakti hunuparne prawadhan chha’ giri bhanchhan, ‘ekal ummedwari pareko awasthama bhane eutai dalko pani huna sakdachha.’

raswapaka netaharu ka anusar upasabhamukh bara chhalphal bhayeko chhaina. pratinidhisabha ma raswapa sahit 6 dal chhan.

nirwachit bhaaisakepachhi aaphno karyabhar samhalnuaghi sabhamukh le rastrapati samaksh pad tatha gopaniyatako shapath linu parne hunchha. nirwachit bhayepachhi upasabhamukh le bhane rastrapatiko upasthitima sabhamukh samaksh pad tatha gopaniyatako shapath linechhan.

sabhamukh ra upasabhamukh dubai sambaidhanik parishadko sadashya hunchhan. yaskaran le samet upasabhamukh ma kun dalbata pratinidhitwa hunchha bhanne bishaylai chasoka saath herne garinchha.

sambaidhanik nikayaka pramukh ra padadhikariharuko niyuktiko lagi sifaris garna pradhanmantriko adhyakshyama sambaidhanik parishad rahane byabastha nepal ko sambidhan ko dhara 284 ma chha. yasle pradhannyayadhish, akhtiyar duryyog anusandhan ayog, nirwachan ayog lagayatka nikayama yogya byaktiharu ko sifaris gardachha.

sambaidhanik parishadko sifaris sansadiya sunuwai samitibata anumodan bhayepachhi sambandhit padma niyukti hunechhan.

22 chait, kathmandu. shram, sanskriti partyka adhyaksh harkaraj raile nabanirwachit sabhamukh le sadanma nishpaksh bhumika nirwah garne bishwas byakt gareka chhan.

aaitabar singhadarbarsthit sansad bhabanma sancharkarmisanga kura gardai adhyaksh raile dalbata chhutiyera euta sajha abhibhawakko rupma sabailai nyay hune gari nabanirwachit sabhamukh le sadanma nishpaksh bhumika nirwah garne bishwas byakt gareka chhan.

unle ahile purano nabhayi naya khal ko janamat aayeko le sabai dal laai saman byabahar hune ullekh gare. sansadma pharak khal ko byabahar bhaye pratipakshi ko haisiyatma aafu harule aawaj uthaune unko bhanai chha.

adhyaksh raile pratinidhisabha upasabhamukh ma aaphno partyko pani dabi raheko bhandaai aafu haru chhalphalma nai raheko batae.

22 chait, kathmandu. pradhanmantri balendra shah (balen) ra shram sanskriti partyka sansad hark sampang bich bhetwarta bhayeko chha.

sansad sampang pradhanmantrilai bhetna pradhanmantri tatha mantriparishad karyalay pugeka thie.

ahile mantriparishad baithak basiraheko chha. mantriparishad baithakaghi uniharu bich bhetwarta bhayeko thiyo.

17 chait, darchula. darchulama jip durghatna huda dui janako mrityu bhayeko chha. shailyashikhar nagarpalika–4 oshil bhanne thauma bhitri sadak khandma mangalbar bihana supapra01-001 j 1641 nambarko jip durghatna dui janako mrityu bhayeko praharile janayeko chha.

sudurpashchim pradesh traphik prahari karyalay attariyaka prawakta prahari nayab uparickshak (disap) tekbahadur jorale durghatnama parera jipma sabar shailyashikhar nagarpalika-1 basne 45 barsako bharat titar ra malikarjun-7 basne 35 barsiya manisha pal ko mrityu bhayeko batae.

gambhir awasthama ghatnasthalbata uddhar gariyeka dubai janako gokuleshwar aspati laijane kramma mrityu bhayeko ho. durghatnama chalak sahitka chaar jana ghaite chhan.

ghaite hunema shailyashikhar nagarpalika-4 ko kandapari basne jip chalak 22 barka prakash thagunna, jipma sabar 25 barsiya bikram mahar, 50 barsiya akbar mahara ra malikarjun gaupalika–5 dadakot basne 45 barsiya minabahadur pal raheka chhan. uniharu ko gokuleshwar aspatima upachar bhairaheko chha.

jip durghatnako karan bhane khuleko chain. ghatna bara thapa anusandhan bhairaheko praharile janayeko chha.

24 phagun, kathmandu. dhadin kshetr nambar 1 ma rastriya swatantra partyki ashika tamang bijayi bhayeki chhin. tamang le 39 hajar 128 pain. unka najikaka pratispardhi emaleka bhumi tripathi 15 hajar 31 mat payeka chhan.

nepali kamyunis t partyka rajendra pande le 14 hajar 7 say 9 mat payeka chhan. congresska krishna rijal ko mat 10 hajar 80 chha.

aghillo nirwachanma yo kshetrma rajendra pande bijayi bhayeka thie.

22 phagun, darchula. sudurpashchim pradesh ko darchulama mataganana suru bhayeko chha. madatan sampanna bhayeko sadde 26 ghantapachhi 7:35 bajebata mataganana suru bhayeko ho.

pahilo matpetika byas gaupalika-2 ka matadan kendrabata kholieko mukhya nirwachan adhikritko karyalayle janayeko chha. so wadama tin wata matadan kendra chhan.

21 phagun, darchula. jillako dui matadan kendrama matadhikar bhayeka sthaniyale nirwachan nai bahishkar gareka chhan. yahako naugad gaupalika–1 sthit gaurishankar mabi nagu ra apihimal gaupalika–3 sthit dudhila aadhar bhut bidyalay jhusku matadan kendra ka matadatala le nirwachan bahishkar gareka hun.

sthaniyako bahishkar ka karan pratyaksh tarphako matpetika rittai bokera karmachari haru sadaramukha pharkidai chhan. duwai matadan kendra ka asthayi matadata (karmachari) le matrai samanupatik tarpha matadan gare.

gaurishankar mabi nagu ka sahayak matadan adhikrit debasingh pharsaban ka anusar samanupatik tarpha 9 mat khaseko chha. bato apthyaro bhayeka karan shukrabar matrai sadaramukha khalanga pharkine unko bhanai chha. yas matadan kendrama 602 jana matadata thie.

uta apihimal gaupalikama raheko dudhila aadhar bhut bidyalayama samanupatik tarpha 8 mat kheko chha. sthaniyale bahishkar gareka karan karmachari le haleko samanupatik tarphako matrai mat lie ra sadaramukha pharkieko matadan adhikrit premraj awasthile jankari die.

‘pratyaksh tarphako matpetika ritto lie ra jhuskubata hideka chhau. yo matadan kendrama 346 jana matadata thie’ unle bhane.

nagubasile ek mahinadekhi naguma sadak lagayatka bikas nirman ko maag rakhaai nirwachan bahishkar ko ghoshana gareka thie. nagubasilai phakauna rajnitik dal le sarbajanik apil, barchuwal samwadsamet gareka thie. tyastai pramukh jilla adhikari anil paudel le pani sthaniya sanga chhalphal gareka thie.

yahaka sthaniyalai budhabarmatrai pani sudurpashchim pradesh sarkar ka mukhya sachib baikuntha aryal le nagu pugera chhalphal gareka thie. tara sthaniya aaphno adanbata tasmas bhayenan.

magh 1 gatebatai sangharsh samiti banayera no bhotka pakshma ubhieka nagubasile yopatakko nirwachanma matadan nagarne nirnay yathawat rakheko karan matpetika ritto pharkai dieko sangharsh samitika sanyojak karansingh dadale batae. ‘yo neta ra sarkar prati ko aakrosh pokhiyeko ho,’ unle bhane.

yastai apihimal gaupalika–3 ka kehi bastika basindale phagun 15 gatebata no bhot abhiyan chalayeka thie. 074 salma bhayeko wada bibhajanle wada nambar 3 ka adhikansha bastilai apayak thauma wada karyalay raheko bhandaai wada bibhajan nabhaesamma matadan nagarne nirnay gareka karan sthaniya matadanma sahabhagi nabhayeko sthaniya kamalsih rokyale jankari die.

yahaka jhusku, chaud, chhabis, bhattar gaunka matadatala le bhot nahaleka hun. ‘harek panch barsama hune parba manaune tibra ichchha hudahudai pani dainik jaso sewa linuparne mukam ek bas basnuparne pidale mat halna manen,’ sthaniya narahari thekale bhane.

21 phagun, darchula. ek matra pratinidhisabhako sit raheko darchulama diuso 1 bajesamma 30 pratishat bhanda badhi matadan bhayeko chha. mukhya nirwachan adhikritko karyalay ka anusar diuso 1 bajesamma 30.40 pratishat mat khaseko chha.

halsamma 13 hajar 27 jana mahila ra 15 hajar 187 jana purush gari 28 hajar 214 jana le matadan gareko mukhya nirwachan adhikritko karyalayle janayeko chha.

darchulama kul 92 hajar 948 jana matadata chhan.

21 phagun, darchula. darchulako dudhila mabi api himal-3 ko matadan kendrama ahilesamma matadan nai suru bhayeko chhaina. sthaniya kohi pani mat halna naayepachhi suru nabhayeko ho.

yasaghi yahaka sthaniyale yahaka dui wata kendrama matadanma sahabhagi nahune nirnay gareka thie. naugad gaupalika–1 ko gaurishankar aadhar bhut bidyalay nagu ra apihimal gaupalika–3 ko dudhila aadhar bhut bidyalay jhuskuka matadatala le matadan nagarne nirnay gareka hun.

nagubasilai budhabar pani sudurpashchim pradesh sarkar ka mukhya sachib baikuntha aryal pugera chhalphal garepani uniharu mat nahalne ma adig rahe.

nagu bikas sangharsh samitisanga chhalphal garna dhangadhibata nepali senako helikoptar chadhera aryal budhabar diuso nagu pugeka thie.

magh 1 gatebatai sangharsh samiti banayera no bhotka pakshma ubhieka nagubasile yopatakko nirwachanma matadan nagarne nirnay yathawat rakheko sangharsh samitika sanyojak karansih dadale jankari die.

‘pradesh sarkar ko upasthiti dhila gari bhayo,’ unle bhane ‘aagamii budgetma sambodhan garne aashwasan diepani jantale patyaune awastha thiyena.’

pradesh sarkar ko tarphabata aayeko prastab dhilo gari aayeko karan jantasanga chhalphal garna pani samay nabhayeko unko bhanai chha.

yasaghi nagubasilai phakauna magh 24 gane pramukh jilla adhikari anil paudel netritko toli pugeko thiyo.

nirwachan garauna nagu pugeko matadan adhikrit chandrasinh khatile sarbadaliya baithakma dalko pratinidhi naayepani sthaniyako sahabhagitama nirwachan ko tayari thalieko thiyo.

nagusthit gaurishankar madhyamik bidyalay matadan kendrama 602 matadata raheka chhan.

yastai apihimal gaupalika–3 ka kehi bastika basindale phagun 15 gatebata no bhot abhiyan chalayeka chhan. 074 salma bhayeko wada bibhajanle wada nambar 3 ka adhikansha bastilai apayak thauma wada karyalay raheko bhandaai wada bibhajan nabhaesamma matadan nagarne nirnay gareko sthaniya kamalsih rokyale jankari die.

wada bibhajan ko maagsahit no bhot abhiyanma utrieka apihimal gaupalika wada nambar 3 antargat dudhila aadhar bhut bidyalayma matadan garne matadatala ko puna matadan adhikrit lagayatko upasthitima bhayeko baithakma samet matadan nagarne nirnay gariyeko unle batae.

yo matadan kendra antargat jhusku, chaud, chhabis, bhattar gaunka matadatala le bhot nahalne nirnay dohoryaeka hun. yo matadan kendrama 346 jana matadata raheka chhan.

22 chait, pokhara. fewatal ko 65 mitar mapdanda bhitrai grihamantri sudan gurungko pani jagga pareko pokharaka meyar dhanaraj acharyale bataeka chhan. shanibar bihanai khapaundai ma baneka mapdanda bhitraka sanrachanama dojar lagaunu agillo din grihamantri gurung ra pokharaka meyar dhanaraj acharya bich chhalphal bhayeko thiyo.

fewatal ko mapdanda bhitra baneko asthayi sanrachanama dojar lagaunuaghi grihamantri gurung le naksa dekhaera aaphno jagga kahaan parchha bhanera sodheko meyar acharyale batae.

‘uhaan le naksa dekhaera mero jagga pani tyaha chha, hernus kahaan parchha bhanubhayo. tyo fewako talghar bhitrai parchha bhanera maile bhanen,’ meyar acharyale grihamantri gurungsanga bhayeko kurakani bara bhane, ‘merai pare pani kehi bhayena. mapdanda bhitra chha bhane sabai januparchha bhanubhayo.’

srot ka anusar grihamantri gurung le fewatal ko shir anadu kshetrma jagga lie ra tahara banayera sano water sports samet chalayeka thie. gurung le fewama water sports ko lagi pokhara mahanagarma proposalsamet haleka thie. tara, tyo prastawapatra jenji aandolanko kramma jaleko ra pheri aahwan garda kohi pani naayeko mahanagar srotle janayeko chha.

‘asti grihamantri jyusanga chhalphal hunda naksa dekhaera yo jagga kahaan parchha bhanubhayo. maile yo ta mapdanda bhitrai parchha bhanen ani uhaan le e yo pani jane bhayo, thikai chha bhanubhayo,’ acharyale onlinekhabar sanga bhane, ‘yo bishayama yahaan bhanda dherai kura huna payena.’

fewatal ko mapdanda bhitrai gurung jagga raheko yasaghi dekhi nai charcha thiyo. tara, unko aaphnai naam ma chha ki paribar wa kampaniko naam ma bhanne kura khuleko chhaina. jilla malpot karyalay ka anusar mapdanda bhitraka jagga ko pahichan garne kaam bhairaheko bhayepani sudankai naam ma bhane ahilesamma dekhieko chhaina. unko fewa kinarma kati jagga chha bhanne pani khulisakeko chhaina.

grihamantri gurung le jenji aandolanpachhi pokharama sammanako lagi auda pani aaphno jagga fewa kinarma bhayeko bataeka thie bhane aaphule fewama water sports ko lagi project agadi badhauna chaheko khulayeka thie. tara, kahaan kun thauma unko jagga chha ra usko yojana kasto ho bhanne bishay bhane khulayeka thiyenan.

pradhanmantri balendra shah netritwako sarkarle 100 karyasuchima fewatal sanrakshan ko bishay pani samabes garepachhi ahile tarang sirjana bhayeko chha bhane shanibar bihan jhisamise mai khapaundi kshetrka 32 wata taharama dojar lagaiepachhi mapdandako bishayle pokharamatrai hoina, singo deshmaai charchako bishay baneko chha.

fewatal ko mapdanda bhitra jagga ra sanrachna raheka sthaniya harule bhane sarkarle binasuchana dojar lagayeko, mapdandako jaggalai taal micheko jasto byabahar gariyeko bhandaai birodh gariraheka chhan. aaitabar pani fewakinarka prabhawit le jilla prashasan karyalay kaskidekhi pokhara mahanagarsamma ma gyapanapatra bujhaaudai sarkar ko kadam prati aapti janayeka chhan. sthaniya laai muabjako byabastha gareramatrai tunga lagaune sthaniyale maag gareka chhan.

aadharatamai grihamantriko aadesh aayeko bhandaai sanrachna bhatkauna pugeko bhandaai sthaniyale birodh gariraheka chhan. shanibar bihan parjatan byabasayi karna shakyako park biledj water front resort prangadh ra tyahi raheko swiming pulma dojar chalaiyeko thiyo. sarvochchako phaisala anusar water front ko swiming pul lagayatka sanrachna mapdanda bhitra parne bhandaai hatauna aadesh gareko chha.

pokhara mahanagarle bhane shanibar dojar lagayera 15 din bhitra sanrachna aaphai hatauna suchana jari gareko chha. tara, sthaniyale bhane spashta guruyojana ra bikalpa diyeramatra sanrachna hatauna maag gariraheka chhan.

fewatal ko mapdanda bhitra sanrachna nabanauna ra baneka sanrachna hatauna patak patak pokhara mahanagarpalikale gareko anurodha laai bewasta gardai nirman thapiiraheko thiyo. pokhara mahanagarle pani barseni sanrachna hataune prayas garne, 1–2 wata ghar taharama dojar lagaune tara pheri sanrachna chahi thapindai jane prawriti fewa kinarma dohoridai aairaheko chha.

‘pokharasthit fewa sanrakshit jaladhar kshetrko atikraman hataai punasthapana, pahiro byabasthapan, muhan sanrakshan ra jalawayu paribartan anukulan ka karyaharu sarokarwala haruko sahabhagitama tin mahina bhitra prakriya agadi badhaai jaladhar kshetrko prabhawkari rupma sanrakshan garne’ say karyasuchi ko 76 au bunda ma bhanieko chha.

say karyasuchi sarbajanik bhayeko bholi paltai pradhanmantri balendra le pokharaka meyar dhanaraj aacharyasanga teliphon samparka garī mapdanda karyanwayan ko awasthabare bujheka thie. meyar aacharyale dushit jagga pahichan ko kaam bhairaheko bataeka thie bhane prabidhik toli le ahile pani kaam gariraheko sunayeka thie.

meyar aacharyale talghar chhutyaune kaam gariyeko, sarvochcha adalat ko phaisala anusar pani bahanako uchcha windulalai aadhar manera 65 mitar kayam garna 1 hajar 55 wata pillar gadne kaam bhayeko reporting gareka thie. meyar aacharyalai pradhanmantri le fewatal ko sandarbhama parjatanmantri sanga samanwaya garera kaam garna aagrah gareka thie.

parjatanmantri pokharaiko khadka (ganes) paudel chhan. fewatal ko mapdanda kayam garna ahilesamma ko sarkar asaphal raheko ra aaba bhane shaktishali sarkar aayeko le yasle nai war ki paar garna sakne pokhara tarangit baniraheko chha. mapdanda bhitra jagga raheka, sanrachna nirman gareka, ahilesamma fewatalbata satta ra shaktiko aadma abaidh kaam garirakheka haruma halchal paida gareko chha.

sarvochcha adalatle gata 2080 asar 4 gate fewatal ko mapdanda 65 mitar nai kayam garnu bhanera aadesh gareko thiyo. 2078 chait 16 gate pokhara mahanagarpalikako 15 au karyapalika baithakle fewatal ko mapdanda 65 bata ghataera 30 ma jhareko thiyo. meyar manabahadur jisile karyakal sakine bela gareko yo nirnayka birodha dosro patak adhiwakta khagendra subedilagayatle sarvochchama rit haleka thie.

tyahi ritupar 2080 asar 4 gate nyayadhish kumar regmi ra hariprasad phuyal ko ijalasle 6 mahina bhitra mapdanda bhitraka sanrachna hatauna bhaneko thiyo bhane 65 mitar ko madhyawarti kshetrlai purna ruple hariyali kshetr ghoshit garna aadesh gareko thiyo.

fewatal ko bis 2018 saldekhi bis 2031 salsamma kayam raheko jagga ko muabja sambandhi bibad samet nadekhiyeko ra bhaye sohi samayma tungieko maninuparne tala ko jagga ra soko dil nepal sarkar ko sarkari jagga bhayeko le fewatal kai naam ma rahane gari garna bhaniko thiyo.

2018 dekhi 2031 salsamma kayam raheko tal ra tal ko dil bhanda bahirako jagga ko hakma matra kanunbamojim muabja dinuparne dekhinda so pahichan garī uchit muabja dina byabastha milaun phaisalama bhaniko thiyo. yaso artha 2031 salpachhi darta bhayeka fewatal ko 65 mitar mapdanda bhitraka dushit jagga ko lagat katta garna pani bhaniko thiyo. pokhara ka meyar acharyaka anusar ahile tyahi dushit jagga pahichan ko kaam bhairaheko chha.

19 chait, kathmandu. grihamantri sudhan gurung le bihibar pratinidhisabha ma dui wata adhyadesh pes gare. jasamadhye ek thiyo– bishesh sewa ain sansodhan adhyadesh.

deshko ek matra guptachari nikay rastriya anusandhan bibhag (raawi) lai griha mantralay matahat lyā una ko lagi yo adhyadesh pes gariyeko ho.

‘2075 salma pradhanmantri karyalay matahat lagieko raawi tyasaghi griha mantralay matahat nai thiyo. suchana sankalan tatha bishleshan, anya nikay sanga ko prabhawkari samanwaya lagayatalai drishtigat garī griha matahat nai rahane nepal sarkarle nirnay gareka le sansodhan adhyadesh pes gariyeko chha,’ grihamantri gurung le adhyadesh pes gardai bhane.

sansadko pahilo baithakmai guptachari nikay laai griha matahat lyauna adhyadesh pes hunda chaar dinaghi 15 chaitma yahi sarkarle sarbajanik gareko sushasan margachitra 2082 ma bhane guptachari nikay laai pradhanmantri karyalayma rakhna sujhab dieko chha.

pradhanmantri tatha mantriparishad karyalay ka sachib gobindabahadur karkiko sanyojaktwama gathit samitle tayar pareko sushasan margachitrako 802 pejma prashta rupma guptacharlai pradhanmantri karyalay matahat rakhna sujhab dieko chha.

‘bibhag laai patak–patak mantralay paribartan nagari pradhanmantri karyalay matahat rakhya ra sthayitwa dine’ sushasan margachitrama ullekh gariyeko chha. ajha yo kaam tin mahina bhitrama garnuparne samet ullekh gariyeko chha. tyaspachhi sansthanik sthayitwa hune margachitrama ullekh chha.

sarbajanik bhayeko sushasan margachitra ra aaja pes bhayeko adhyadesh bhane thik ulto chha. yo duwai prakriya ekasath jaso sarbajanik hunda guptachari nikay kahaan rakhne wa rakhuparne samma ko dwibidha sirjana bhayeko chha.

kina grihama lyaiyo wa pradhanmantri karyalayama kina lagiyo bhanne bishayko kunai chhalphal ra bishleshan bhayeko dekhinna. aaphno swarthanusar guptachari nikay laai yatā uta laijane paripati chaldaai aayeko chha.

raawika purba aigi debaraj bhatta ta griha ra pradhanmantri karyalay lana tanatan hune paripatiko kadda shabdma birodh garchhan.

‘yasaghi grihama rahnda kaamai nalagne bhayo bhanera pradhanmantri karyalayama lagiyo. pram karyalayama lagepachhi ramro hola bhaneko sadupyog hune bhanda badhi duryyog bhayo,’ bhattale onlinekhabar sanga bhane, ‘ma ta bhanchhu, griha ra pradhanmantri duwai karyalaybata guptachari nikay maathi lachar duryyog bhairaheko chha.’

griha ra pradhanmantri karyalay duwai ko paristhiti bhoge ko guptachari nikay laai sudharna bhanda aaphu anakul kasari prayog garne bhanne mai hodbaji hundaai aayeko chha.

ahile pheri yo karyalay kahaan rakhne bhanne dwibidha sarkarle sarbajanik gareko sushasan margachitra le ubjayeko chha. yaso byawaharik pato ra bahya abhyas ra pratijasus jasta bishayle guptachari nikay kahaan rakhne bhanne nirdharan garne janakaraharu batauchhan.

ahileko byawaharik pato bara herda yo nikay griha mantralay matahat nai rakhnu uchit hune sujhab bigyaharuko chha. ‘dainik shanti surakchya ka bishay, anya nikay sanga samanwaya garera garnuparne kaam haru ra ahileko sanrachanagat hisable herda griha mantralay matahat rahanuparchha,’ purba aigi bhattako tark chha.

yo sangasangai bahya abhyas, sarkar ko kaam garne spirit, pratijasusi sanyantra jasta bishay ra border rupma herda bhane jasusi sanyantra pradhanmantri karyalay matahat rahanu ramro hune janakaraharuko bujhai chha.

raawilai 16 phagun 2074 ma kepi sharma oli pradhanmantri bhayeka bela pradhanmantri karyalaya matahat rahane gari lagi yeko thiyo. tara jenji aandolanpachhi gathan bhayeko sushila karki netritwako sarkarle 9 asojma raawilai griha matahat nai lyaune nirnay garyo. tyahi nirnay anusar grihama lyauna ko lagi aaja grihamantri gurung le adhyadesh pes gareka hun.

guptachari nikaymai adhikari samet yatā uta (griha–pradhanmantri karyalay) hunda kaam karabahima asar parne ra manobal samet girne hunda sarirhanu uchit nahune batauchhan.

‘kahaan rakhne, kahaan rakhda thik hunchha bhanne bishay sarkarle bujheko hunchha. tara uta uta sarirhanda bhane yasako asar surakchakarmiko manobal sanga jodieko chha. yasle natijama pani asar garchha,’ raawika ek adhikari bhanchhan.

atankabad, prithakatabadi gatibidhi, thula apradhajanyo gatibidhiko suchana sankalan garnuparne guptachari nikay laai sarkar ma basekaharule duryyog gardai aaphu anakul prayog gardai aayeka chhan.

sata barsaaghi griha matahat rahnda bekame baneko aarop lagaundai guptacharlai pradhanmantri karyalay matahat lagi yeko thiyo. yo bichma guptachari nikay kati sashakta bhayo, sudridhikaran bhayo wa prabhawkari banyo ? prashnako jawab natijale diraheko chha– jhan bekame dekhiyo, swarth pura garne hatiyar banyo.

yahi mahasus garera karki netritwako sarkarle grihama lyayeko thiyo. yastai kichale le garda guptachari nikay bhutte hudai gayeko chha. gruptacharlai prabhawkari banauna sushasan margachitra anya sujhabharu pani dieko chha. jaha chhuttai intelijens ain tarjuma garī bibhag laai rajnitik hastakshep mukta ra swayatt banaunuparne bhaiyeko chha. yo kaam ek barsa bhitrama saknuparne samay sima samet ullekh gariyeko chha.

guptachari nikay bhutte bandai gayeko tarpha sanket gardai prabidhik guptachari arthat sa tekeint (saibar intelijens) ma lagani garnuparne aunlyaiyeko chha. data bishleshak ra bhu–rajnitik bigyaharu sammilit uccastariya analytical sel gathan garī kaam garnuparne samma ko bishay margachitrama sametieko chha.

chhimiki deshka gatibidhile rastriya surakchyama parne prabhaw bara nirantar adhyayan garne sanyantra banaunuparne ullekh garepani bahya guptachari bara kehi ullekh gariyeko chhaina.

2046 salaghi bhane guptachar bibhagma nepal janasamparka karyalay (ka) ra (kha) thiyo. (ka) le aantarik ra (kha) le baideshik mamila ko jasusi garthye. ahile bahya suchana sankalan garne chhuttai sanyantra chhaina.

siddhantat: ra bahya deshko abhyas herne ho bhane pani guptachari nikay pradhanmantri karyalay matahat rahanuparne hunchha.

17 chait, kathmandu. grihamantri sudhan gurung le sashastra prahari bal (epiiphi) ka aijipi raju aryal sahitko timsanga chhalphal gareka chhan. baithakma grihamantri le sima gastilai kaddai garnu nirdesh dieka chhan.

tyastai bipad byabasthapanako lagi aawashyak purbatayari sambandhi bishayama bistrit chhalphal gariyeko chha. sambhawit bipad jokimlai nyunikaran garna aawashyak rananiti, srot byabasthapan tatha samanwayaka bishayama chhalphal bhayeko mantri gurungko sachibalay le jankari dieko chha.

mantri gurung le taskari niyantranma pani dhyan dina pani nirdesh dieka chhan.

16 chait, kathmandu. prahari mahanirikshak (aijipi) lai pradhanmantri le phuli lagaidine byabastha banauna pahal garne grihamantri sudhan gurung le bataeka chhan.

sombar prahari pradhan karyalay ko nirikshan gardai mantri gurung le yasto bataeka hun. ahile bhane aijipi lai grihasachib le phuli lagaune chalan chha. yasaghi bhane awakashma jadai gareka aijipi le aune aijipi lai phuli lagaune prachalan thiyo.

tyastai gari mantri gurung le prahari poshak nepalamai utpadan garne ra starīya pani banaine pani bataeka chhan. grihamantri gurung le aaphna samasya rakhna sadhai khula raheko bataeka chhan.

grihamantriko haisiyatma aaphu ra raswapa partybata praharima kunai dabab, prabhaw nahune batae. santhanalai baliyo banauna aaphu bharupar lagne unle batae. aijipi laai thapa shaktishali banaine pani unko batae.

sewa prabaha ramro garna nirdesh dai mantri gurung le kunai pani mantrilai traphik sewama prathamikata nadin pani nirdesh dieka chhan.

grihamantri gurung lai nepal prahari pradhan karyalayama prahari mahanirikshak dan bahadur karki lagayat uchcha prahari adhikari harule swagat gareka thie.

nirikshan bhramanka kramma grihamantri gurung le nepal prahari pradhan karyalayasthit sangrahalay, dijital phorensik lyab, data sentar ra poligiraf seksanko nirikshan garnuka saath tyas sambandhi gatibidhi bara jankari lie.

bipad byabasthapanma nepal praharile agrapanktima rahera bhumika nirwah garnuparne hunda praharilaai thapa sadhan srot yukt banaunuka saathai samayanukul aawashyak talim haruko samet byabastha garine ullekh gare.

karyakramma grihasachib rajkumar shreshtha le nepal praharile bibhinna kathinaiharuka babajud pratinidhisabha sadashya nirwachanlai aitihasik rupma shantipurn tabar le sampanna garauna pratyek prahari karmachari le nirwah gareko byabasayik bhumikako uchcha samman gare.

14 chait, kathmandu. nawaniyukta grihamantri sudhan gurung ahile phutta–phutta prahari karyalay chir dai anugaman gardai hideka chhan.

aafai gadi chalayera ahile jilla prahari parisar lalitpur pugeka chhan. tyasbhanda agadi uni kathmandu upatyaka traphik prahari karyalay ramashahpath pugeko paiyeko chha.

tyaha karib 10 minet bitayera ramrosanga kaam garnu bhanera nirdesh diyera uni niskeka thie. tyaspachhi uni parisar lalitpur pugeka hun.

13 chait, kathmandu. nawaniyukta grihamantri sudhan gurung le padbhar grahan gareka chhan. rastrapati karyalayama shapath grahan samaroh sakiesangai singhadarbar pugera mantri gurung le padbhar grahan gareka hun.

saathai, unle aaphno karyakalko pahilo nirnay bara pani jankari garayeka chhan. unle sabai kaam haru ekadwar pranalibata aghi badhaune nirnay lieka chhan.

so kramma unle bhi'aipi lawalaskar lagayera jantalai dhukka dine kaam garna nahune batae.

‘kam bolne manche hum . akshanma janchu . jenji ko maag anusar hami aayeko ho . susasanawirudhka kunai kaam hun sakdaina,’ padbhar grahan karyakramma boldai unle bhane . service deliveryka bishayama gunasa auna nadin unle karmachariharulaai aagrah gare . 20 chait, kathmandu . shram sanskriti partyko sansadiya dal ko netako jimmedari partyka harkaraj rai (hark sampang) le samhalne bhaeka chan . sampangle bihibar pratinidhisabhako baithaklaai gareko sambodhan ko copy sarvajanik gareka chan . jasama sampanglaai adhyaksh tatha sansadiya dal ko neta bhaniyeko cha . bihibar pratinidhisabha 2082 ko pahilo adhiveshan ko pahilo baithak baseko thiyo . ukta baithaklaai sambodhan gardai sampangle janatako maag ke kasta raheka chan bhaner 27 bunda prastut gareka thie . jasmargat deshko swadhinata ra asanglan pararastra nitilaai bachai rakhna sainya rananiti uddeshya saatha suru garieko asaman rashtraghati byaparik sandhi mccci kharej garna maag garieko cha . prithwi rahunjel nepal rahanuparne ra nepalko jhanda surya ra chandrama ankita jhanda hunuparne bhaniyeko cha . sarvajanik pad dharana gareka byaktiharuko sampatti chhanbin garna maag gardai unle yasko suruwat mantriparishadka sadashya ra pratinidhisabha sadashyaharubata garna aagrah gare . ek palika ek udyog, ek paribar, ek rojgari ko yojanasaha aagaami aarthik barsha ko niti tatha karyakram lyauna sujhab dieka chan . bidyarthi sangathan, karmachari ma trade union rahne narahne jasto bishayama sujhabuprna rupma kadam chalna aagrah gareka chan . naya sarkar ko nitima jeevan upayogi shiksha hunuparne unko aagrah cha . yi kaam bhaye sarkar laai saath dine nabhe khabardari garne unko pratibadta cha . 8 chait, kathmandu . 6 wata rashtriya partymadhyebata dui wata partyle pramukh sachetak ko suwidha napaaune bhaeka chan . jasama rashtriya prajatantra party (raprpa) ra shram sanskriti party raheko cha . sanghiya sansadka padadhikari tatha sadasyaharuko parishramik ra suwidhasambandhi ain 2073 anusar 10 jana sadashya raheko dal le pramukh sachetak ko suwidha paunchhan . yasko paribhasha khandma bhanieko cha, ‘dal ko pramukh sachetak bhannale pratinidhisabhama dashjana bhanda badhi sadasyaharu raheko dal ko netale so dal ko pramukh sachetak bhai kaam garna tokiyeko tyasto sabhako sadashya samjhanuparcha .’ 21 falgun ko nirwachanbata aayeka 6 wata dalmadhyebata shram sanskriti party ra raprpako sansad sankhya 10 bhanda kam cha . shram sanskriti partyka 7 jana ra raprpaka 5 jana raheka chan . yasabahek rashtriya swatantra party (raswapa) ka 182, congresska 38, emaleka 25 ra nekapali kamyunisht partyka 17 jana sansad raheka chan . sanghiya sansadka padadhikari tatha sadasyaharuko parishramik ra suwidhasambandhi ain ko anusuchi 2 anusar dal ko pramukh sachetak le sawari suwidan ra pratham star ko dui jana sawarichalak praapt garchhan . dal ko pramukh sachetak ka lagi chhurtt karyalay ko suwidha huncha . jas ko lagi karyalay sahayogi ek jana praapt garchhan . euta saikil pani paunchhan . atithi satkar kharcha bapatt masik 15 hajar praapt huncha . dal ko pramukh sachetak le ek jana ra.pra.ddhi swakiya sachib praapt garne byabastha bhane haal nishkriya cha . rashtriya manyata praapt garna pratyakshatarf kamtima euta sit jiteko ra samanupatikatarf kamtima 3 pratishat mat praapt gareko hunuparcha . yasto threshold paar gare pani pramukh sachetak ko suwidha paune 10 jana bhanda badhi sansad bhayeko dal hunuparne byabastha cha . yasto byabasthako birodh sanaa dalharule gardai aayeka chan . shram sanskriti partyka mahasachib aren rai rashtriya dal ko manyata paisakepachi kati sansad bhaner herne bishay uchit naraheko bataumchan . ‘maile bibhed kahaa dekhe bhane . rashtriya party banisakepachi paune sewa suwidhama pharak hunu hudaina . pramukh sachetak ra sachetak ko suwidha paune byabastha pharak–pharak rahecha’, uni bhannchan, ‘10 jana bhanda kam sansad bhaye euta badhi bhaye arko suwidha bhanne rahecha . rashtriya party banisakepachi sewa suwidan bibhed hun bhayena .’ 2 falgun, sunsari . hark sampangle dhanushama chunaawi abhiyan chalaunu agisamma rubikumari thakur shram sanskriti partyma jodieki nai thiin . jaba unle pahilo patak harklaai bhetin, tyaspachi matolaai bhot magdai matadatar ko gharaidailosamma pugin . shram sanskritima aawaddha bhayepachi aaphno samudaya matra hoina, singo dhanusha–4 ma byapak pracharprasarma juteki rubi rashtriya swatantra partyka manish jha jasta hasti ra unka samarthaksanga rajnitik rupma bhidin . ahile unai rubilaai shram sanskriti party le samanupatik sansad banayer sadanma pathaeko cha . aaphno sansad yatralaai 25 barsiya rubile apratyasit bhaneki chin . uni bhannchin, ‘ma samanya manche . tar sadhaim shram sanskriti party ra adhyaksh hark sampangko video herthe . ra, deshka lagi yasto manche chahinchha bhanne lager samarthak banna puge . sansad bannu mero lagi ‘sarprāiz’ nai ho .’ rubi sthaniiya balara polytechnicbata tin barshe diploma engineering sake 7 mahina agidekhi dhanushakai ek consultancyma jagir khairaheki thiin . partyle samanupatik sansad banayepachi pahilo patak dharansthit party mukhyalayama aayeka bela thorai narbhas, dherai utsahit hudai onlinekhabarsanga bhanin, ‘maile sansad hunchu bhaner socheko thiina . achanak samanupatik sansad banayeko khabar aayo . ani adhyaksh harkaraj sampanglaai bhetna party karyalaya aaipuge .’ dhanushako majheliyaki raithane bhayepani uni madheshwadi dal, emale, congress, nekap ra raswapama aakarshit bhain . athawa, ti dal le unlaai ptyayenan . swatantra rupma aaphnai kaamma ramairaheki rubi masik 20 hajar talabma consultancyma sano jagir khairaheki thin . shram sanskriti partyle ptyayepachi khula rajnitima homieko unle bataiin . unaka babu sogarath thakur saudi arabma baideshik rojgari ma januaghi kapal katne pesama thie . haal uni saudimai chan . ama renu thakur grihini hun . paribar ma rubisaha chaar bahini ra dui bhai chan . rajnitik bhasha uti najaneki rubile bhanin, ‘hami ek kathha jaminma baseka chaum . jiwika ka lagi arkako dui bigha jamin bataiyama (adhiya) ma kamauchhaum 