 25 falgun, kathmandu . pratyakshatarf tin sit jiteko shram sanskriti partyle samanupatikma tin lakh mat kataeko cha . 88 lakh 48 hajar 148 mat ganana hunda shram sanskritiko tin lakh aath hajar 656 mat pugeko cha . yo ganana bhayeko matko karib sadhe tin pratishat ho . samanupatik tarf sit praapt garna kul sadar matko tin pratishat bhanda badhi mat lyaunu pardacha . shram sanskritilaai pachhairaheko rashtriya prajatantra partyle dui lakh 90 hajar 71 mat paayeko cha . rashtriya swatantra partyko 42 lakh, nepali congressko 14 lakh, nekap emaleko 12 ra nepali kamyunisht partyko 6 lakh bhanda badhi mat aaisakeko cha . pratyakshma shram sanskritika adhyaksh hark sampang, aren rai ra dhruwaraj rai nirwachit bhaisakeka chan . ilam–1 ma shram sanskritika ummedwar dosro sthanma chan . 25 falgun, kathmandu . ilam-1 ma nepali congresska nishlak rai ra shram sanskriti partybich kada takkar dekhieko cha . congresska raile 10 hajar 849 mat praapt garda shram sanskritika limbu le 10 hajar 651 mat praapt gareka chan . congresska raile 198 mat le agrata kayam gareka chan . tesro sthanma raheka nekap emaleka kajiman kagatele 9 hajar 998 mat praapt garda raswapaka bimal gadale 6 hajar 758 mat praapt gareka chan . 29 mangsir, kathmandu . uni yasai pani hune khan e paribar ma janmieka . tyahi anusar hurkie, pade, badhe . unlaai napugdo pani kehi thiena . euta pratishthit byabasayik gharana ma janmieka unlaai duhkhajilo wa mihineta nagarda pani hunthyo sayad . tar, unle tyo bato rojenan, mihineta nagari safalta haat lagdaina bhanne unlaai sanai dekhi manma thiyo . kinabhane, gharma bubadekhi aru aaphubhanda thulaa sadashyale byapar–byabashayama gareko mihineta ra lagavko chhap unimathi bhinna pareko thiyo . uni skule padhai ra uchch shiksha adhyayan sakepachi nepal farkie . ani, baubaje le nirman gareko byabasayik pratishthanma kaam thale . kaam sikdai gae, gardai gae, mihineta garna chadenan, dinrat khatie, najaneka kura aaphubhanda anubhabi ra thula laai sodhe . bistaraai-bistaraai uni pokhtta hudai gae, ra yo gatile ek dashak paar garyo . ek dashakma unle gareko mihineta ra lagav dekher unko byabasayik gharana ko sanchalak samiti dang thiyo . akasmat kalilo umerai euta pratishthit byabasayik gharana ko jimmedari unko kandhma aayo . unko dimagma anek kura khaele . yati thulo jimmedari kasari bahan garnu ? banisakeko brand, gharana ko sakha, yaslaai ajhai uchainma kasari laijanu ? unka manma anek tarkana aaye . ra, antimma akshay golyanle aantilo manle nirnay gare – ma yo gahan jimmedari kandhma lie agadi badhchu, gharanalaai ajhai mihinetasaath thap uchainma puryauchhu . nepalko byapar-byabashayaka sandarbhama herda gharana harule kam umerka sadashyalaai sadharanataya netritwako jimmedari dieko khasai dekhidaina . tar, golyan group le ek kadam agadi badher akshaylaai groupko sampurna jimmedari sumpine nirnay garidiyo . ‘jenji’ umerma kudirahanda byapar-byabashayama prawesh gareka uni ahile 37 barsha ma kudiraheka chan . khasma ta akshayle byapar-byabashayama haat haleko ek dashak bhaisakeko cha . ek dashak ko kadha mihineta, dinrat ko khatāi, lagan ra athak parishrampachi akshayko kandhma pratishthit byaparik gharana golyan groupko adhyaksh ko jimmedari aayeko ho . sadhe 6 dashak lamau ‘legacy’ (birasat) bokeko byabasayik gharana golyan groupko jimmedari kandhma aayepachi akshay pani ek manle hausieka chan . tar, sangai gharana ko birasat jogayer thap uchainma laijane chunauti unka samu khada cha . ‘sabai bhanda pahila ma ra mero kaam mathi bishwas garnubhayeko ma golyan group sanchalak samitika purvadhyaksh pawan golyan ra board sadasyaprati aabhari chu,’ akshay bhannchan, ‘yo netritwa garne bishay ekdamai thulo jimmedari ho, yaslaai ma ekdamai sakaratmak hisabma agadi badhauna chahanchu, hami sabai kshetrma pioneer bhayar agadi badhna chahanchhaum, ra tyasaigari mero netritwama group agadi badhcha .’ akshayka buba pawan golyan groupko jimmedaribata bahiriepani unka margadarshan bhane jari rahannechan . bubakai padachap pachhyaudai euta gahan jimmedarima aayeka akshay pani bubako anubhab ra margadarshanlaai shiradharya garne bataumchan . ‘bubako lagbhag panch dashak ko byabasayik kaam ko anubhablaai ma jahile kaamma jodna chahanchu,’ akshay bhannchan, ‘tyasbata malaai bhinnaai urja ra utsah milcha .’ rabibhabanko linkan skul dekhi spainko university samma akshayle kathmanduko rabibhabansthit linkan skulma pade . 12 kakshasamma tyahai pade . padhaima pani abbal thie . atirikti kriyakalapma pani ustai abbal thie . skulma bhalibal ra basketbal khub khelthe . skul ra kalj ramrai ankasatha uttirn gare . ra, snatak adhyayan garna united arab emirates (uae) ko dubaisthit american university gae . tyahambata snatak saker uni snatakottar garna europeko spain gae . bishwaka utkrisht 10 universityma parne spainko ‘esade’ bata business studiesma snatakottar garer akshay nepal farkie . ani, baubajeko byabashyama prawesh garer kaam thale . akshayle golyan group prawesh garda prabandh nirdeshak ko jimmedari paeka thie . yo pad pani suruwatma gahrugo nai thiyo . tar, mihineta ra sikaibata unle aaphulaai pramanit garidie . ke cha akshayko rananiti ? yuwa jos ra jangar bhayeka akshayle bistaraai golyan groupma yastari kaam gardai gae ki sara karmachari (chahe ti anubhab ra umerma barishtha nai kina nahun) achambhit bhaye . unle grouplaai ‘next level’ ma puryauna kadha mihineta gare . tyahi rananiti anusar group ra groupma aabaddha company ma yuwa umerka laai awasar din thale . tim pani tyasaigari banauna thale . ekarkalaai sahayog ra sahakarya gardai jana thale . thyakkai ek dashakma unko rananiti ra mihinetale ahile rang lyayeko ho . ‘maile jimmedari linaasath golyan groupma turuntai kunai uthalputhal hune hoina, mero ek dashak ko anubhab, sikai ra mihineta lagaudai tim spiritma kaam garchu,’ akshay bhannchan, ‘pramukh sanrakshak ko bhumikama rahanubhayeka buba ra anubhable kharieka barishtha karmachari saathiharusanga ko sahakaryabata group ra hamra companylaai ajhai mathi ukasdai lane rananiti cha .’ sadhe 6 dashak ko birasat bokeko golyan groupko jimmedari bodh unama prashta dekhincha . ‘mero ek dashak ko mihineta laai board le ptyayepachi yo jimmedarima aipugeko hum,’ akshay bhannchan . tyahi bhaer uni yuwa timsanga ahoratra khaitiraheka hunchhan . aaphna kura bhannchan, timko kura sunchan . ra, sangai pramukh sanrakshak buba pawan ko margadarshan anusar agadi badiraheka chan . jenji aandolanbare ke bhannchan akshay ? 23 ra 24 bhadau 2082 ma desh nasocheko euta durghatnako sakshi bannuparyo . jenji (generation z) le gareko aandolanle arkai rup lida anahakma 70 bhanda badhi le jyan guma e . jenji aandolan kramama golyan groupko karyalayama samanya todphod pani bhayo . tar, akshayko man karyalayama bhayeko todphod le hoina, aandolanma jyan gumaekaharu ka santan ra paribarko awastha abha ke hunchha bhanne chintale bichalit thiyo . ani, unkai pahalmā golyan group le jenji aandolanma shahadatpraapt ka 32 jana santanlaai purnachhatrabrittima 12 kakshasamma padhaidine nirnay garyo . yo chhatrabrittima khana, chhatrabasdekhi padhailekhai sabai kharcha sametieko cha . yo nirnayle byaparik kshetrma euta tarang lyayidiyo . ‘jenji aandolanma jyan gumauneko ke dosh, uniharuka santan ko ke dosh ?,’ akshay bhannchan, ‘ek jimmedar nagrikmatra nabhayi jimmedari byabasayik gharana pani bhayeka nātale yasama hamile sakdo sahayog garnai parchha bhanne bhayepachi hamro grouple yasto nirnay gareko ho, hami aaphaimatra agadi badhne hoina, samaj ra deshlaai pani sangasangai agadi laijanuparcha bhaner ti bachchaharu ko bhabishya banaunuparcha bhanne mero manma thiyo .’ golyan group le akshaylaai kina banayo adhyaksh ? karib ek dashakdekhi golyan groupko prabandh nirdeshak ko jimmedarima raheka 37 barsiya akshaylaai kina adhyaksh ko naya jimmedari diyo hola ? prashna aham cha . ‘sadhe 6 dashak lamau birasat bokeko nepalko pratishthit ra agrani byabasayik gharana golyan groupko adhyakshma 37 barsiya akshay golyan chayan hunu bhaneko groupbhitra naya yug ko padachap ra paribartan ko chahana pratibimbita hunu ho,’ akshaylaai adhyaksh ko jimmedari ghosana garda gata shukrabar grouple jari gareko bignaptima ullekh cha . golyan grouple aaphno barShikotsaw ka awasarma yasto ghosana garda karmachari ra byabasthapanmajh bhinnaai raunak chayeko thiyo . paribarik ekata ra rananitik nirantarata ko sandesh didai groupka upadhyaksh basudeb golyanle akshaylaai sanchalak samiti adhyaksh padma chayan garieko aupcharik ghosana gare . ‘akshay golyan abha groupko adhyaksh ra prabandh nirdeshak ko bhumikama rahanu hunecha, karyakari adhikar sahit boardko netritwa ekaai thau ma kendrit hunule golyan groupko bikas, bistara ra bishwawbyapi upasthiti thap prabhawshali hune bishwas cha,’ grouple jari gareko bignaptima cha . akshayle group antargatka arko companylaai pani pratyaksh netritwa pradan gariraheka chan . group antargat 25 bhanda badhi company sanchalanma chan . grouple utpadanmulak udyog, nabikarniya urja, krishi ra hospitality (aatithya satkar) kshetrma baliyo upasthiti janairaheko cha . akshayka hajurbuba sohanlal golyanle 65 barshaaghi audyogik sahar biratnagarma suru gareko byabashayko bishal swarup ho – haalko golyan group . groupma haal karib 10 hajar karmachari karyarat chan . groupko byabashaya haal bishwaka 60 bhanda badhi deshma phailieko cha . grouple barShik 40 karod amriki dollar (57 arba rupaiya) bhanda badhi ko karobar gardai aayeko cha . akshay aaphno pustako birasatlaai samman gardai nabinatam soch ra drishtikon saatha tiwra gatima agadi badiraheka yuwa udyami hun . unle karib 10 barsha ko byabasayik yatrama aaphulaai pramanit garisakeka chan . udyog tatha banijya kshetrbata rashtriya arthatantra ma mahattwapurna yogdan gareko bhandaī nepal sarkarle asar 2082 ma akshaylaai ‘mahatwapurna barsha byakti’ (cip) bata samman gareko thiyo . golyan grouplaai brihat sansthaagat swarup dilauna evam rashtriya tatha antararashtriya starmaa sthapit garna mahattwapurna yogdan gareka pawan golyanle chora akshaylaai groupko shirsh netritwa hastantaran gareka hun . yasle nepalko niji kshetrma pustantaran ko mahattwapurna sandesh prabah gareko cha . nepalko aarthik aatmanirbhartama tewa puryaune pratibadta byakt gardai aayeko groupko shirsh netritwama yuwa pugnu le mulukko aarthik samriddhimaa thap tewa pugne bishwas garieko cha . ‘yo kewal padbhar grahanmatra hoina, yo euta birasatlaai aadhunik yugma rupantaran garne jimmedari pani ho,’ jimmedari grahanpachi akshayle bhaneka thie, ‘golyan grouplaai abha nepalko simanabhanda bahira ek antararashtriya starako pratispardhi sanstha ko rupma sthapit garna pratibadta chaum, hamro dhyan abha nawaprabartan, digo bikas ra sansthaagat shushanma kendrit hunecha .
4 mansir, kathmandu . nepa emale ko egharaum mahadhiwesanma kp sharma oli ra ishwar pokharel bich pratispardha hune pakka jastai bhaeko cha .

Mahadhiwesan tayari ka nimti upasamitiharu gathan garne mukhya ejenda raheko aaja ko sachibalay baithakma netaharule lieko adanle sarbasammat netritwa chayan ko sambhawana lagbhag sakieko ho . ‘kp olile adhyaksh chodna sakinnam bhanunbhayo, ishwar pokharelle ma pratispardha garchhu, ra parinam swikarchhu bhanunbhayo,’ ek padadhikari bhanchan, ‘aaja ko baithakpachi ab aupcharik rupmai netritwako sangharsha suru bhayo .’

Aath ghanta lam baithak sakiepachi nirnayaharu sunaune kramma upamahasachib pradip gyawalile pani swastha pratispardha lai swikarera jaanebare chhalphal bhaeko bataye . ‘ekata ko mahadhiwesan ka rupma laijaau bhanne bhaeko cha (olile) . ekatawaddha bhaera agadi badhne kurama nai sabai ko kaly an cha . aam partipanktile chaheko, karyakartale chaheko, deshle pani chaheko tyahi ho,’ gyawalile bhane, ‘tyati hudahudai pani kasailai pratispardha garnuhuncha bhane tyaslai swastha pratispardha garna sakincha bhanne kura baithakma chhalphal bhaeko cha .’

Srot ka anusar, baithakma olile rajnitik paristhitibare byakhya gardai ekatawaddha hunuparne nishkarsh sunaeka thie . ekatawaddha huna netritwama sahamati aawashyak raheko unako bhanai thiyo .

‘Paristhitilai kabuma lyau'n militensi chahinchha, partipanktila'i jhujharu bana'era laijanuparcha,’ oli ko adan thiyo, ‘ab maile adhyaksh chodera tyo sambhawana chaina, chodne kura hunna .’

Ma adhyaksh ka nimti disarb garchhu, pratispardhama aune parinam swikarchhu - ishwar pokharel

Tara oli ko adan ra agrahma barishtha upadhyaksh pokharel sahamat bhaena . aantarik pratispardhabata netritwa nirman garda parti kamjor nahune tark gareka thie . ‘pratispardhale parti kamjor huncha bhanne thannu bethik ho,’ pokharel le tark gare, ‘pratispardhale parti kamjor hudaina . sangathan gatishil huncha, neta–karyakarta sakriya hunchhan .’

Aantarik pratispardhale parti ekata kamjor nahune bishleshan gardai pokharel le adhyaksh padma pratispardha garne janakari pani die . ‘maile pratispardha garne kuralae parti baliyo huncha,’ pokharel le bhane, ‘ma adhyaksh ka nimti disarb garchhu, pratispardhama aune parinam swikarchu .’

Egharaum mahadhiwesanpachi aaphule netritwa line dawee prastut garda unle oli ka kamjoriharu pani aulaye . ‘tapaiko sajjanik abhibyakti, tapaika katipay tauratarikale pani parti bhitra samasya paida bhaeko cha,’ pokharel le olilai netritwabata bishram lina sanket gareka thie .

Bisheshagari kamjori sachya'un nachahane oli ko shailiprati pokharel ko tippani thiyo . ‘aaphna kamjoriharuko samiksha garna nachahane kuralae agadi badhna sakidaina . kamjori lai dekhna saknuparcha,’ pokharel le bhaneka chan, ‘ani matra sachya'era jana sakincha .’

Srot ka anusar aagami netritwabare oli ra pokharel bich ko adanma aru padadhikarile pani aaphno pakshadharata lukaeka thiena . wigat ka baithakharu ma jastai mahasachib shankar pokharel, upamahasachib pradip gyawali ra prithvisubba gurungle olilai sahayog pugne gari dharana rakheka thie .

Wigatma pratispardha garne katipay saathiharu parti ko ekatama rahanu bhaena . udaharan ka nimti madhabkumar nepal ya bhim rawal . tyo sthiti nabanos - kp sharma oli

‘Netritwala'i sankat pareka bela sahayog garera januparcha bhanne nishkarsh pushṭi garne gari shankar pokharelle aaphno sambodhan rakhnubhayo,’ baithak srot bhancha, ‘pradip gyawalile parti bhitrako antarsangharsha chharapashṭ parnu hudaina, pharak kon aune gari netaharu sajjanik rupma bolnuhunna bhanne kura rakhnubhayo .’

Arka upamahasachib prithvisubba gurungle bhane jenji aandolanbata satta gumdaka anubhab ra nishkarshharu sunaeka thie . gurungle suraksha nikayharuko lokatantrikaran kasari garne jasto kurama jod dai olilai bal pugne tark gareka thie .

Upadhyakshharu yubaraj gyawali, ashtalakshmi shakya, bishnuprasad paudel, surendra pande, sachibharu gokarna bishṭ, yogesh bhattarai, raghubir mahasethe bhane ishwar pokharel lai sath dine gari boleka thie .

‘Baithakma rajnitik paristhiti, madhesh sarkarama dekhieko samasya, partile bana'una lageko rashtriya swayamsewak force jasto bishayama dherai chhalphal bhayo,’ srot bhancha, ‘dherai jas o padadhikarile ahile kai tauratarikale hunna, sachchinuparch bhanunbhayo .’

Netaharu ko manasaya bujhepachi olile pani ab aaphno pratispardha ishwar pokharel sanga hunasakne prashṭ sanket die . ‘sahamati hudaina bhane pratispardha lai kasle rokna sakcha ra !,’ olile netritwama pratispardha hune sandesh die .

Baithakpachi oli nikatt neta pradip gyawalile pani ab pratispardhabatai netritwa chayan hune sanket dieka chan . ‘tyaha kasailai tyasto ummedwari ko ghosana athawa aaphu banne dhangle ta kura garnubhaena . tara yadi bha'echa bhane pani hamile swabhawik rupma linchhau,’ gyawalile bhaneka chan .

Upamahasachib gyawalile chunaabi pratispardhama olile nai jitne aatbishwas samet dila'une prayas gare . ‘adhyaksh kamaredle thap euta kura pani bhanunbhayo– ahile samma nirantar bibhinna samayama pratispardha bhayo . ma aaphu ek jana matra tyasto patra rahe, jasle pratispardhama parajit bhaepani parti ekata ka nimti nirantar lagirahem,’ oli ko bhanai uddhrit gardai gyawalile bhane, ‘tara wigatma pratispardha garne katipay saathiharu parti ko ekatama rahanu bhaena . udaharan ka nimti madhabkumar nepal ya bhim rawal . tyo sthiti nabanos .’

Arthat unako bhanai prashṭ thiyo, swastha pratispardha garna tayar chhau, tara hare pachi kasailai parti chodne paristhiti nabanos .

Ishwar pokharel ra unlaai emale adhyaksh bana'une abhiyanma juteka netaharu le yahi sachibalay baithak kureka thie . sachibalay baithakbatai olilai bida lina agrah garne ra sarbasammat netritwa paribartan ko prastab garne tayari thiyo . yojana anusarai pokharel le prastab rakhe, jasma oli sahamat bhaena . ultai parajit bhaera parti chodne paristhiti nabanos bhanne chetawani di'ieko cha .

‘Sarbasammatibatai netritwa paribartan ko prastab hamile rakhyaum . kp kamared tayar hunu bhaena, ab hami agadi badhchhau,’ pokharel nikatt srot bhancha . yo samuha ka netaharu le aagami 8 mansir ma sajjanik sabha rakhera i pokharel ko ummedwari ghosana garne tayari gariraheko cha .

Oli ko nishkarshma asahamati

Tesro patak aaphai adhyaksh bhaera rajitik paristhiti samhalne, parti bana'une ra desh agadi badha'une oli ko prastabma pokharel taraf ubi'eka padadhikariharule bhane asahamati janaeka thie .

Uniharule olile bhaneka ra sunaeka nishkarshharuma samasya dekhaeka thie . partilai ekatawaddha bana'era laijanuparne oli ko tarkaprati upadhyaksh yubaraj gyawalile byabaharma dekhinuparne chunauti dieka thie . ‘byabaharma pratibimbit hunuparcha, ekata garne bhnera matra hudaina,’ gyawalile bhaneka thie .

Upadhyaksh ashtalakshmi shakyale partima dekhieko samasyako hal aweg ra uttejanabata nahune bataeki thin . ‘parti bhitra je dekhieko cha, hamile uttejana ra aweg dekha'era samadhan hudaina . hamra tauratarika sudharnuparcha,’ shakyale bhaneki thin .

Arka upadhyaksh bishnuprasad paudel le desh ko paristhiti bigarne gari netaharu ko abhibyakti airaheko chinta gareka thie . ‘hamile je nirnaya garna sakchhau . tyahi hisable matra bolnuparcha,’ unle bhaneka thie .

Upadhyaksh surendra pande le muluk ko paristhiti soche jasto narheko tathyabodh hunuparne bataeka thie . ‘paristhiti ahile jokhimapurna cha . soche jasto sajilo chaina,’ pande ko bhanai ko sar thiyo .

Sachib gokarna bishṭ le aru rajnitik dalharu sanga ekline batoma emale hidna nahune bataeka thie . ‘bartaman sankatbata par pauna mudda milne shaktiharu sanga milera januparcha, yasle lokatantra baliyo huncha,’ unako tark thiyo, ‘panchayatwirudh ladda hos, ya ganatantra praptima wam–lokatantrik sahakaryabata saphal bhaeka chhau .’

Yogesh bhattarai ra raghubir mahasethe le madhesh pradesh sarkarama dekhieko sankatbare chinta gareka thie . ‘netritwale jasari nirnaya liyo, tyasle madheshma emale ekliyo bhanne chinta garnubhae ko thiyo,’ srot bhancha .

Arka sachib chhabilal bishwakarma le muluk ko sankatprati gambhir huna agrah gardai dalit ka muddaharma parti ko dhyanakarshan garaeka thie . lekhraj bhattale bhane sudurpashchim ko samasyabare kura uthae .

24 asoj, kathmandu . nepa emale ko sachibalay baithakma 6 netale pad chhade rahaj nikas ko prastab garepachi adhyaksh kp sharma oli rakshatmak baneka chan .

Jenji bidroh ka karan pradhanmantri pad tyage ra gundu basdai a'eka olile bahusankhyak padadhikaribatai rajinama ko dabab jheldai a'eka chan .

Gata 13 asojma baseko sachibalay baithakai netaharu le parti punargathan ko prastab lyayeka thie . tara tyo baithakle kunai nirnaya nagari kendriya komiti baithak bolaune sahamati garyo . sohi anusar kendriya komiti ko ejenda tayar garna gunduma sachibalay baithak suru bhaeko cha .

Pahilo din ko baithakma sachibalay ka 9 jana le aaphno dharana rakheka chan . tyasamadhyek barishtha upadhyaksh ishwar pokharel, upadhyakshharu ashtalakshmi shakya, yubaraj gyawali, bishnu paudel, rambahadur thapale parti purgathan ko adan lie . punargathan ko adan lieka netaharumadhyek ashtalakshmi shakyale likhit rupmai pahilopatik oli ko rajinama magin .

Upadhyaksh guru baral ra mahasachib shankar pokharel le oli ko bachauma boleka chan bhane upamahasachib pradip gyawalile madhyamargi prastav rakheka chan .

‘Guru baral le sankatka bela netritwa joga'unuparcha bhanne motamoti kura rakhnubhayo . pradip gyawalile mahadhiwesanbata parti punargathan ko kura utha'unubhayo,’ baithak srot bhancha, ‘mahasachib shankar pokharel le bhane olilai sthapit garerai agadi badhnuparne lam byakhya nai garnubhae ko thiyo .’ unka anusar oli ko baliyo bachauma pokharel le sashakt tark gareka chan .

Likhit mantabya rakheki upadhyaksh shakyale oli sahit purana sabai netale bida linuparne prastab gareki chin . tara kun tahasammako purana bhane nakhulaeko ek padadhikarile bataye .

‘Naitik jimmedari li'era purana jati sabaile bida line prastab garnubhae ko cha,’ uni bhanchan, ‘tara kun tahasammako purana bhanne chahin bhanunubhaena .’

Unle bholipalt sarkar jadaicha bhanne tapailai thaha bhaena bhandai prashna garin . ‘ab shadayantra bhnera matra hudaina . tapaile sahaj nikas dinus’, shakyale bhanin .

Baithak suru garne kramma olile sajjanik rupma bhanekai jastai aaphu birudh shadayantra bhaeko briefing gareka thie . jenji ka namama aphu netritwako sarkar dhala'une ra emale lai kamjor parne shadayantra bhaeko tark oli le gareka thie . tara shakyale naya pustala'i parti ko bhabishya jimma laga'unuparne prastab rakhin .

Ashtalakshmi sanga mildojuldho tark bishnu paudel le gareka thie . dosh arulai di'era umkina namillne paudel ko tark thiyo .

‘Sarkar ko netritwa hamile gariraheka thiyau . tara suraksha ko janakari bhaena, paristhiti ko mulyankan garna sakenau,’ upadhyaksh paudel le bhane, ‘sawadhani apana'una sakenau . yasko kamjori ko samiksha nagari hunna .’

Kamjori ko samiksha gardai punargarthit emale ab ko kurs hune pani paudel le bataye . parti punargathan ko prastab garirahanda unle olilai sath di'iraheka mahasachib shankar pokharel ra upamahasachib bishnu rimalharu prati kataksha nai gareka thie .

‘Sadhai laptop boke ra aghipachhi hid dai ma paristhiti ko mulyankan hudaina . yaha boleko laptop le tal ko sthiti bujhna sakidaina,’ paudel le bhaneka thie, ‘tal ko paristhiti bhane jasto chaina .’ paudel le karyakarta panktima bhayankar thulo nirasha ra anyol raheko reporting prastut gareka thie .

Jenji bidroh hunu bhanda nikai agaibatai olilai netritwa chodna dabab di'iraheka barishtha upadhyaksh ishwar pokharel le bhane aja tulnatamak narama kura gareka thie . ‘parti punargathan ko ejenda uhale pani utha'unubhayo, tara yasaghi jasari sashakt rupma karyabahak chodnus chahin bhanunubhaena,’ baithakma sahabhagi arka ek neta bhanchan .

Ishwar pokharel le olilai netritwa chodna dabab dina bhanda pani purbarashtrapati bidya bhandari ko sadasyata nabikaran ko ejendama jod dieka thie . purbarashtrapati bhandari ko sadasyata yahi kendriya komiti baithakbata nabikaran garera januparne unako prastabma upadhyakshharu bishnu paudel ra badal le samet sath dieka thie .

Parti bhitra bikasit bibhajit manobigyan lai ekatawaddha garna pani bhandari ko sadasyata nabikaran garnuparne badal le tark gareka thie . oli le netritwa chodnuparne purbadan badal le aaja ko sachibalayama pani rakheka chan . tara mahadhiwesan marphat netritwa chodne sakne bikapal rakheka thie .

Baithak srot ka anusar badal ra upamahasachib pradip gyawali ko prastav najik–najik thiyo . gyawalile pani mahadhiwesanma jane ra tyaha ibata pheri anumodit hune athawa bida line bhanne tay garnuparne tark gareka thie .

Upadhyakshharu yubaraj gyawali ra surendra pande le bhane olile netritwa chodera matra thap nikas taraf januparne adan lieka chan . ‘pradhanmantri chodnubhayo, ab adhyakshbata pani marg prashast garnus,’ gyawali ko prastav thiyo .

Jenji pustale gareko aandolan ka pachadi oli ko netritwa shaili pramukh jimmedar raheko unako nishkarsh thiyo . ‘shasan garne tarikale, parti chala'une tarikale asantushti badhera gayo . aaja ko sthiti ayo,’ upadhyaksh gyawalile bhane, ‘garibi, berojgari ra bhrashtachar le aago jhosna kam garyo .’ ab netritwale sahaj nikas di'era agadi badhnuparne unle bataye .

Arka upadhyaksh surendra pande le jenji pustako mul bhabana bartaman rajnitik netritwako bidai raheko bishleshan sunae .

‘Jasle aandolan gare, uniharu ko mag tin janale (sherbahadur deuba, kp oli ra prachanda) bida linuparcha bhanne thiyo,’ pande le sawadhani garae, ‘asti ta sattabata hata'e . ajhai ater gariyo bhane uniharule arko abhiyan suru garna ber chaina . yo kura hamile bujhnuparcha .’

Sattako netritwa garnewirudh nepal ko itihasma sadhai shadayantra hune gareko lam briefing pande le gareka thie .

‘Kasko wirudh shadayantra bhaena ? shadayantra chirera i satta chaldai a'eko birssana mildaina,’ upadhyaksh pande le bhane, ‘shadayantra huncha ra bhairaheko cha bhanne bujhna nasaknu kamjori ho .’

Corporate house harule amerika kai sattama halla'une tathy bujhna nasaknu, kutnitik sambandha bigrinu, muluk bhitrako aantarik sankat lai najar andaj garinu jasto samasyale aaja ko sthiti a'eko tippani pani unle gare .

Sangai, naya shaktisanga pratispardha garna pani emale punargarthit hunuparne pande ko tark thiyo . ‘naya parti bhanda mathi purya'uchhu bhannalai pani umerle sath didaina . ani kina basnuparcha padma ?,’ pande le bhaneka thie .

Yasari ekohoro parti punargathan ko tark suneka olilai upadhyaksh guru baral le santwana millne gari tark gareka thie . ‘sankatka bela netritwa lai dhale ra hudaina . sath dinuparcha,’ baral le bhaneka thie .

Mahasachib pokharel le chahin olilai kasari pheri emale ra muluk ko netritwama sthapit gara'una sakincha bhanne udaharnaharu samet prastut gare . ‘itihasma netritwa lai kasari sthapit gariyo, ra ab kasari kp oli lai pheri sthapit garna sakincha bhnera lamai byakhya garnubhayo,’ srot bhancha .

Olilai sthapit gara'una sakinne udaharan dida ishwar pokharel ko wigat kotyaeka thie . ‘pratigaman aadha sachiyo bhnera sarkarama jada ishwar pokharel mathi pani prahar bhaeko thiyo . tara tyaslai hamile pratiwad garera agadi badhyau,’ mahasachib pokharel le bhane, ‘netritwa sidhya'un prahar huda pani pheri sthapit gara'una sakinne udaharan hamisanga i cha .’

Sajjanik mantabyaharuma i olilai baliyo sath didai a'eka shankar pokharel le olilai bisthapit garne soch badalna agrah gareka thie . ‘hamile ahile netritwa lai bisthapit garne hoina, kasari sthapit garna sakincha bhanne socnuparcha,’ pokharel le bhaneka thie .

