Mahasachib pokharel ra upamahasachib gyawalile pratinidhi punasthapana ko mag rakhda thap rajnitik kurs sankat tar dhakelina ra emale ekline khatra aulyaeka chan .

‘Aandolan ta bhanincha, tara bholi eklai parine paristhiti aune khatra hola,’ mahasachib pokharel le bhaneka chan . upamahasachib gyawalile pani chunaaw hune sthiti nadekhiyepani jod chunaawmai garnuparne tark gareka thie .

