‘Pratinidhi sabha punasthapana hunuparcha . pratikranti lai yasle rokhcha . hamile bal garda phagun samma punasthapana bhaera kranti huncha,’ badal le bhaneka thie . upamahasachibharu prithvisubba gurung, bishnu rimal sahit sachibalayharu bhane aaphno kura rakhna baki cha .

