24 chait, kathmandu . jenji aandolanpachi bhaeko pratinidhisabha chunaawle rashtriya swatantra partile dui tihai najik jit hasil garepachi ukt parti ka barishtha neta balendra shah pradhanmantri baneko karib dui saata pugna lagyo . yo bichma pratinidhi sabha ka 4 wata baithak base . jun baithakma sabai dal ka netaharu ka aupcharik dharana sadan prastut bhaye tara pradhanmantri balendra shah ko chahin bolisunieko chaina .

Euta i dal ko karib dui tihai ko samarthan sahit ka pradhanmantri le naya sandarbhma muluk lai ab kasari hakna chaheka chan ? nepal ko bhabigatya kasari agadi badhcha ? yi jigyasha sadan bhitrabata pani prakat huna thale ko cha .

Wigatma sansad adhiwesan suru bhaeka din dal ka shirsh netaharu le shubhakamana dine pradhanmantri le pani bolne lagayat ka abhyas thie . yaspatak tyasto bhaena . sadan ko baithak suru bhaeko gata 19 gate sattaruh dal ko sabapatiko haisyatma raswapa ka rabi lamichhane bole . tara sattapaksh ko pramukh dal ko sadiya dal ko neta ko haisyatma pradhanmantri balen pani sambodhan garna sakthe . unle garena .

Sansad ka purba mahasachib suryakiran gurung ka anusar yati shaktishali sarkarle muluk lai kata ra kasari laijana khojdai cha bhnera janakari prapt garnu nagarik adhikar ho .

‘Overal pradhanmantri ko vision ke ho ? rashtralai kun rupma agadi badha'una khojnubhae ko cha . yo manchhe le sunna chaheka chan’ purba mahasachib gurung bhanchan, ‘ahile dui tihai bahumat ko ekal sarkarle muluk lai kasari drive gardai cha ? jantalai kasto rahat didai cha ? yasbare pradhanmantrile prashṭ parna aawashyak cha .’

Gurung ka najar ma nepali haru le matrai nabhaera anyale pani pradhanmantri ko vision sansadbata sunna chaheka chan . ‘ab nepal ko pararastra niti kasto hola ? arthik niti kasto lidaicha ? bishwa samudayle yas sambandhama nepal sarkar ko drishtikon kasto auncha bhnera parkhiraheko cha .’

Pararastra sambandhdekhi arthik niti ra nagarikle prapt garna sakne rahat samma ka bishayama sansadma utheka ra uthna sakne sabai prakar ka kautuhalatalai sambodhan garna pradhanmantrilai gurung ko sujhaw pani cha .

‘Sansad ko rostramma ubi'era pradhanmantrile bolnuparcha, bolnuhos’ uni bhanchan, ‘sansadma utheka ra bhabishyama uthna sakne bishayharulai sambodhan garnuhos . taki, pradhanmantri ko drishtikon ke ho ? muluk kasari agadi badhdai cha bhnera aam nagarikle thaha paun .’

Sansad ko adhiwesan suru bhaekai din samwidhanwid dr. bipin adhikarile pradhanmantri ko sambodhan nahuda kehi khadkieko jasto bhaeko tippani gareka thie . ‘aaja ko pahilo baithakma sansad ka neta pradhanmantrilai pani sankshipta sambodhan garne prayojanpak adhikar thiyo. yaspali sattadhar parti adhyaksh tatha pradhanmantri alag–alag byakti bhaeka karan pani yasko aawashyakta dekhieko thiyo. dherai le pradhanmantri anupasthit bhaejhai anubhab gare . tathapi ab sabhamukh ko nirbachanpachi pradhanmantrile ukt adhikar ko mag garnuhunecha bhanne asha garau .’

Wigatma anya dalharubata parti ko adhyaksh nai sadiya dal ko neta ra pradhanmantri bhaeko abasthama rostmam dal ko neta ko tarphabata ubi'epani pradhanmantri ko dharana aune garthyo . tara yaspatak parti sabapati ra pradhanmantri pharak pharak bhaeka karan sambodhan garera pradhanmantrile aaphno dharana lyau'nu thik hune byagyaharu batauchan .

Pradhanmantri ko tayari ke cha ?

19 chait dekhi sanghiya sansad ko ahwan bhaera duwai sadan pratinidhisabha ra rashtriya sabha ko baithakharu sanchalit chan . pradhanmantri ko sachibalay ka adhikariharu pradhanmantri balendra le sansad lai upayukta samayama sambodhan garne batauchan .

‘Sansad lai pradhanmantrile kahile sambodhan garchan’ bhanne prashnama pradhanmantri ka pramukh swakiya sachib subash sharma bhanchan, ‘tatkal tyasto tayari chaina .’

Sanghiya sansad sachibalay ka anusar pradhanmantrile chaheko bela jahelesukai sansad lai sambodhan garna wa aaphna kura rakhna sakdachan . pradhanmantrilai bolna ka lagi kunai pani samay ra karyasuchi bhitra chirna pardaina.

Yasabahek pratinidhisabha niyamabalile pratyek mahinama ek din pratinidhisabhama pradhanmantrisanga pratyaksh prashnottar karyakram sanchalan hune bhaneko cha .

Pratinidhisabha niyamabaliko niyam 56 ma bhaniyeko cha, ‘pradhanmantri wa nijako karyakshetrsanga pratyaksh rupma sambandhit mahattwapurna bishayama prashna sodhna ko lagi sabhamukhle pratyek mahinako pahilo hapta ko kunai ek din ko baithak ko pahilo ek ghanta nirdharan garnecha .’

Rashtriya sabhama pani yastai byabastha cha .

Rashtriya sabha niyamabaliko niyam 55ka. ma bhaniyeko cha, ‘pradhanmantri wa nijako karyakshetrsanga pratyaksh rupma sambandhit mahattwapurna bishayama pradhanmantrisanga pratyaksh prashna sodhna ka lagi adhyakshle pratyek mahinako tesro hapta ko kunai ek din ko baithakma pahilo ek ghanta nirdharan garna saknecha .’

Pradhanmantrile yahi pradhanmantrisanga ko pratyaksh prashnottar karyakramlai samet aaphna kura rakhne samayako rupma sambodhan garna saknechan .

‘Sansadma hudaicha pradhanmantri ko khoji’

Gata somabar pratinidhisabha ko baithakma boldai rashtriya prajatantra parti (raswapa) ki sansad khushbu oli le esiyali bikas bank ra bishwa bankbata rin swikar garne sarkar ko nirnayama prashna utha'in .

‘Hami sodhna chahanchhau– kun sadiya samiti, kun nitigat bahas ani kun aawashyakta praathamikikaran mulyankan ka adharma yo akar ko nirnaya liyo ?’ oli ko prashna cha .

Gata aitabar baseko mantriparidoshak ko baithakle digital nepal transformation project ka lagi 90 million ameriki dolar barabar ko sahuliyatpurn rin swikar garne nirnaya gareko thiyo . digo ra samabeshi pariyojana ka lagi bishwa bankbata prapt hune 95 million ameriki dolar barabar ko sahuliyatpurn rin lai swikar garne nirnaya sohi din bhaeko cha .

Sansadharule shakti prithakikaran ko siddhant khyal huncha ki hudaina ?, sansad ka kura sarkarle suncha ki sundaina ?, samaymai pre-budget chhalphal huncha ki hudaina ?, sansad le mantri ko dhoka chaharnu parch ki ! kanun nirmanma swarth samuha habi hunchhan ki ! bhnera prashna gareka chan .

Wigatma pani sarkarle sahuliyatpurn rin line gareko thiyo . yaspatak pani tyastai prakritiko nirnaya hunda sarkarle jawaf dinuparne kin ?

Yahine sansad oli ko shanka cha, ‘hamro sansad ajhai shishu abasthama cha . sadiya samiti ra upasamitiharu baneka chainan . yasto abasthama euta sano akarama basera bhaeko sarkar ko nirnaya pardarshi nahun sakne sambhawana cha .’

Ajhai rin praptiko prakriya ke ho bhannema unako prashna cha, ‘ukt rin hamile mag gareka thiyau ? wa hamimathi prastav a'eko thiyo ? offer loan ho ki requested loan ho ? ukt pariyojanaharu nai kinn chayan gariyo ?’

Ab yi prashnaharu ko jawaf sarkarle sansad lai dinuparne huncha . pradhanmantri ko namai li'era sansadma sodhiyeka anya prashnaharu pani chan .

Chait 19 gate ko pratinidhisabha ko baithakma boldai nepali congress ka sansad bhishmaraj angdambale bhane, ‘pradhanmantrilai ma dhyanakarshan gara'una chahanchhu– janchabujh ayog ko pratibedan swayam sarkarle sajjanik garne ki sarkarle pani gorkhapatrama padhne ?’

