Sansadma utheka yi prashna ko jawaf pradhanmantri balendra le kahile dinchan yakin chaina . sansadharule bhane pradhanmantrilai samjhera aaphna abhibyakti rakhirahekai chan .

Somabar rashtriya sabha ko baithakma boldai nepali congress ka sansad ranjit karnale sarkarsanga ejendagat rupma sahakarya ko prastav nai rakhe . ‘pradhanmantrijyulaai agrah cha– aunuhos, rashtriya ekata garaau yasko lagi sahakarya garaau . ejendaharu tayar garaau’ unle bhaneka chan, ‘nirbachansamma bichar pharak huna sakcha, parti pharak huna sakcha . nirbachanpachi sabai ko euta i lakshya ho– samunnat nepal, sammanit nepali .’

