Raswapa ka sansad manish jhale baluwatarbata sansad bandi nahune gyaranti khojeka chan . somabar pratinidhisabha ko baithakma boldai unle wigat samjhe, ‘aghillo patak ko sadan khumaltar, baluwatar, balakot ko bandi bhaera basyo . sankhya matra ganiyo, siddhant kamjor rahyo .’

Khumaltar, baluwatar ra balakot bhnera jhale purba pradhanmantritray pushpakamal dahal ‘prachanda’, kp sharma oli ra sherbahadur deubataraf sanket gareka hun . prachanda khumaltarma ra oli balakot basthe. baluwatar bhnera tatkalin pradhanmantri ko sarkari niwas taraf sanket gareka hun .

Arthat, pheri sansadma baluwatar arthaat pradhanmantri ko hastakshep hun nahune sansad jhako agrah cha .

Raswapa kai sansad ganesh parajulile shakti prithakikaran ko siddhant khyal huncha ki hudaina ?, sansad ka kura sarkarle suncha ki sundaina ?, samaymai pre-budget chhalphal huncha ki hudaina ?, sansad le mantri ko dhoka chaharnu parch ki ! kanun nirmanma swarth samuha habi hunchhan ki ! bhnera prashna gareka chan . karyapalika, byabasthapika ra nyayapalika ko garimalai chhuttai rupma bacha'una nasakera wigatma bhoge ka tita anubhabharu raheko bhandai unle ab wigat nadohorine wacha khojeka chan .

Somabar pratinidhisabha ko baithakma boldai parajulile yi bishay uthae . unle pradhanmantri ko naam ta lienan . tara, sarkarlai sansad ka kura sunna sujhaw die . unle bhaneka chan, ‘sansadjyuharu le jantako tarphabata akasmik samayama, shoonya samayama ra bishesh samayama uthaeka sabai samasyaharu, sujhaw ra jantaka aawajharuko sambodhan rajya ka nikay ra mantralayle samaymai gareko sunna paiyos .’

‘Sabai kuraharu sansadmai rakhepachi pura bha'idi'un,’ raswapa ka sansad parajulile bhaneka chan, ‘sarbaum sansadle kunai pani mantri ra mantralay ko dhokama aaphule uthaeka muddaharu sambodhan bhahe ki bhaenan bhnera chaharnu naparos .’

Yi prashna ra jigyasa ko sambodhan pradhanmantrile sansad ko rostramma ubi'era garnuparnecha . taki, swayam pradhanmantri balendra le sansad lai bishwasma lina sakun .

20 chait, kathmandu . antarrastriya dwandwa ka karan indhan ko kharid mulyabriddhi hudai jada nepal aayal nigam arthik sankatma phaseko cha .

Mulukma indhan bikri-witaran ko ekmatra adhikarik nikay nigam arthik sankatma phasdai jada balendra shah (balen) netritwako bartaman sarkarle bhane yasbare ajhai mukh kholeko chaina .

Upabhoktasanga pratyaksh jodine bishay bhaepani nigam ko taluk mantralay udyog, banijya tatha aapurtile ahile samma yasbare aupcharik dharana sajjanik gareko chaina . yo mantralay pradhanmantri shah aaphai le samhaleka chan .

Naya sarkar a'unuaghi mantralayle petroleum padartha aapurti bishaylai najikbata niyaliraheko ra tatkal aattihalnuparne abastha narheko bataeko thiyo .

Tara, bartaman sarkarle bhane ahile samma yo sankatprati aupcharik dharana sajjanik gareko chaina . yasbare mantralay ka sachib madhusudan burlakotisanga prashna garda unle yasko jawaf aayal nigamle dine bhandai panchie . mantralay ka sachib aayal nigam sanchalak samiti ka adhyaksh hune prabadhan cha .

Nigam nirantar ghatama jada petroleum padartha aapurti shrinkhala tutne chinta badhdai gaeko cha .

Nigam sanchalak samiti ko nirnaya anusar shukrabardekhi lagu hune gari petrol ra diesel/mattitelma pratilitar 15 rupaiya ka darle bhau badhaiyeko cha .

Nepalma petrol ko bhau le ahile samma kai uchch rekarḍ kayam gareko cha . naya mulyasuchi anusar ‘barg 3’ antargat parne kathmandu, pokhara ra dipayalma yasaghi 1 say 87 rupaiya raheko petrol ko khudra mulya badhera pratilitar 2 say 2 rupaiya pugeko cha .

Yasaghi rus–ukrain dwandwa ka bela antarrastriya bajar prabhabit hunda petrol ko bhau adhikatam 1 say 99 rupaiyasamma pugeko thiyo .

Tyasaigari diesel ra mattitel ko bhau pratilitar 1 say 82 rupaiya kayam bhaeko cha .

Nigamle mulya sthirikaran kosh ko rakam samet upayog garne gari yo mulya samayojan gareko janaeko cha .

Indhan ko yo achaki mulyabriddhisanga dhwani ra sajjanik yatayat ko bhada badhne ra yasle bajarama samagra mahangi badhaune nishchit cha, jasako pratyaksh marama upabhokta parnechan .

Karan ra prabhaw

Ahile pashchim esiyama bhairaheko yuddhle garda antarrastriya star mai petroleum padartha ko bhau badiraheko cha . yasari bahira nai bhau badhera indian aayal corporation (ioc) bata naya mulyasuchi a'eka karan nepalma swachalit mulya pranali anusar indhan ko bhau mila'un (samayojan garna) sambhab bhaeko chaina .

Pashchim esiyama jari tanawle antarrastriya bajarama kachcha telo ko bhaumatra badhaeko chaina, ‘stret of hormuj’ abaruddha hunda panijahaj ko bhada (shiping charge), dhwani ra bima kharch samet dobbrale mahangieko cha . yi sabai karan ko pratyaksh mar prashodhit telo ko mulyama pareko ho .

Antarrastriya bajarama ahile kachcha telo ko bhau pratibyarel 1 say 10 ameriki dolar barabar pugeko cha . pashchim esiya ko tanaw ka karan yo bhau ajhai badhera 1 say 150 dolar samma pugne bishleshan lani bank jp morgonle gareko cha . chadai nai kachcha telo ko bhau 1 say 120 dekhi 1 say 130 dolar pugne prakshepan usko cha .

Chait lage pachi lagatar mulyabriddhi

Chait lageyata aayal nigamle lagatar indhan ko bhau badhaisakeko cha . yo chhoto awadhimai petrol litarmai 45 rupaiya ra diesel 40 rupaiya mahangieko cha .

1 chaitaghi kathmanduma petrol ko mulya 1 say 57 ra diesel 1 say 42 rupaiyamatra thiyo . tara, 1 chaitma petrolma 15 ra dieselma 10 rupaiya tatha 11 chaitma pheri duwaima 15–15 rupaiya badhaiyo .

Yastai 17 chaitma hawai indhan ko mulya samayojan gardai pratilitar 2 say 51 rupaiya purya'iyeko thiyo . pheri shukrabar bihanadekhi petrol, diesel ra mattitel ko bhauma litrakai 15 rupaiya thapiepachi mulyama yo uchch briddhi dekhieko ho .

Nigam ko arthik sankat ra ghata

Nigamle bihibar sajjanik gareko bigyapti anusar petrolma pratilitar 34 rupaiya 37 paisa ra dieselma pratilitar 1 say 20 rupaiya 54 paisa ghata cha . tyastai elpi gasma pratisilindar 4 say 16 rupaiya 36 paisa ghata cha .

Yo sabai ghata jodda nigam pakshik rupma 11 arba 71 karod rupaiya noksanima jane dekhieko cha .

Aapurti rokinche jokhim ra ‘rakam abhaw’

Sanchit rakam ra kosh rittidai gaepachi ioc laai bhuktani dina nasaki deshama petroleum padartha ‘aapurti shrinkhala’ nai tutne gambhir jokhim utpanna bhaeko nigamle janaeko cha .

Nigamle antarrastriya bajarama badhdo indhan ko bhau ra dainik ghataka karan aaphno ‘mulya sthirikaran kosh’ rittidai gae ko janaeko cha .

Ioc lai bhuktani garna nigamle hal mulya sthirikaran kosh ko rakam prayog garne bataeko cha . nigam ko ukt koshma 19 arba 62 karod rupaiyamatra cha .

Nigam prawakta manoj thakur le ioc lai bhuktani garna rakam abhaw hudai gae ko ra tatkal indhan khopat naghatae desh kai arthatantrama gambhir asar parne bataye .

‘March 31 tarikhasammai hamro karib sadhe 5 arba rupaiya ga'isakeko cha,’ thakur le bhane, ‘april ko mulya anusar astisamma pakshik (15 din ko) ghata 13 arba 21 karod thiyo, hijo ko mulya samayojan pashchat pani 15 dinma 11 arba 71 karod ghata cha .’

Thakur le yo 15 din ko karib 12 arba ra aghillo 5 arba jodda april 15 sammai koshbata 17 arba rupaiya sakine bataye .

‘April 15 samma 17 arba ga'ihalcha, tyaspachi 2 arba 62 karod chanchun baki rahancha,’ unle bhane, ‘hamro dainik ghata nai 77 karod cha bhane pachi baki raheko 2 arba le kati din kinna pugla ra ?’

Ghata behore ra ioc lai samaymai bhuktani dina nasake nepalma indhan aapurti shrinkhala bigrine ra tyasbata sarvasadharana le telo napaune abastha aune unako bhanai cha .

Nigam ko apil ra sarkar lai prastab

Sankat gahiridai gaepachi aayal nigamle sarvasadharana lai indhan kam khopat garna (mitabyayita apna'un) aupcharik apil nai gareko cha .

‘Price ko trend rokine jasto dekhidaina,’ prawakta thakur le bhane, ‘narokiepachi hamile khopat kam garnu ko ta bikalpai chaina .’

Thakur le sarkarle nitigat rupmai indhan kam khopat garne upay lagu garnuparnema jod die . ‘ahile samma upabhoktale khopat kam gareka chainan,’ thakur le bhane, ‘sarkarle nai kunai nirnaya garera lagu garyo bhane matra hune hola, natra mulya badhdai jane bhayo, nigam lai ghata hune bhayo .’

Ghata dhan nai nasakne abasthama pugepachi nigamle petroleum padartha ko khopat ghat'aun sarkar samaksh bikapalharu prastab gareko nigam ka karyakari nirdeshak dr. chandikaprasad bhattale bataye .

Bhattale nigam joga'une abko uttam bikap bhane kai telo khopat ghat'aunu raheko prashṭ pare .

‘Khopat naghat'i aru upay nai chaina, ghat'aune bishayama hamile alternet (bikapal) haru dieka chhau,’ unle bhane, ‘gadiharu ma jor bijor garne, office time ma dui din bida (sajjanik bida) garne, skul kalejharu banda garne ra quota system (rasaning) garne bishayama hamile khula prastab rakheka chhau .’

Indhan khopat ghat'aun sawarisadhanma jor bijor pranali lagu garnedekhi skul–kalej banda garne sammako prastab mantralayama pathaiyeko unle bataye .

Yadyapi, nigamle pathaeko yi prastab mathi mantralayle hal samma kunai nirnaya bhane garisakeko chaina .

Khopat ghat'aune bahek arthik byabasthapan ka lagi sarkarle kar ma chhut dinuparne wa rin linuparne abastha a'isakeko karyakari nirdeshak bhattako bhanai cha .

‘Bholi rinma nai januparne huna sakcha, sarkarle rin dinuparne huna sakcha wa kar ma anudan dinuparyo,’ bhattale bhane, ‘aru deshle je gareka chan, tyahi anusar pratilitar 14 rupaiya ko kar matrai ghat'auna saki yo bhane pani thulo kura huncha .’

Unle aaphnai desh ma tel prashodhan kendra (refinery) bhaeka dakshin esiyali deshharu ko udaharan didai nepal le belaima socnuparne bataye .

5 chait, kathmandu . ‘upabhoktale 2 dekhi 15 watasamma gas silinḍar stock garera rakheka karan bajarama gas ko kritrim abhaw bhayo,’ pachhilo samaya nepal aayal nigam, gas udyogi ra bikretale sanyukta rupma bhandai a'eko wakya ho yo .

Ahile sahar ka chokharu ma harek barg khana pakaune gas ko euta silinḍar ka lagi ghantaum lainama basna bibas cha . tyasama pani sabbhanda badhi mar eka silinḍar matrai huneharu lai pareko cha . sadhe dui mahinaaghi kathmandu upatyakama matrai dekhieko gas abhawle ahile purai desh chopisakeko cha .

America ra israyale 28 februarinma iran mathi gareko sanyukta sainy karbahipachi bishwa bhurajniti ra arthatantrama thulo halchal machieko cha . madhyapurbama dinahuna badhdo tanawle yasko pratyaksh asar bishwabyapi urja bajarama dekhieko cha .

Nepalma dekhieko gas abhaw madhyapurba ko tanaw suru hunuagabai thiyo . ahile bhane sohi tanawle pani ghiu thapne kam gareko cha .

Nepal indhanma purnarupma bharatma nirbhar cha . bharat pani anya deshma nirbhar hunda gas ko samasya bharatmai dekhisakeka karan tyasko trasma nepali upabhokta pani chan . tara, ahile samma bharatle nepalma gas niryat roke ko chaina .

Dainik rupma ausat 49 hajar ton gas le pugne ma mag badhesanga aapurti pani badhaeko dabisa tathyank aayal nigamle niyamit sajjanik gardai airaheko cha .

Yati hudahudai gas abhaw samasya samadhan huna nasakepachi nigamle 28 phagundekhi aadha silinḍar gas witaran garne nirnaya lagu nai garisakeko cha . tara, pani bajarama aadha silinḍar kai lagi ghantaum lain lagirahanuparne badhyata hateko chaina . aadha silinḍar gas nai pa'una saki'ena bhanne gunaso upabhoktabata rokieko chaina .

Mulukma khana pakaune gas hahakar hunu ra upabhoktaharu ritto silinḍar bokera sadakma lain basnu kunai naulo bishay rahena . wigat ek dashak herne bhane nepalle dui wata thula rashtriya sankatka bela gas ko charam abhaw jheleko cha .

Bisheshagari antarrastriya simama hune awarodh ra aantarik bajarama sirjana hune kritrim abhaw byabasthapan garna sarkarle hal samma tin patak aadha silinḍar gas bikri garne nirnaya garisakko cha . thorai parimanma dherai paribar lai gas purya'une uddeshyale linine yasto nirnayale nepal ko urja parnirbhart ra kamjor bhandaran kshamatalai chharlang parne gareko cha .

Naya samwidhan jari bhaepachi asantusht bharatle gareko nakabandi ka karan kattik 2072 ma gas ayat thappai pra bhayo .

Tyasabela bajarama gas ko charam hahakar machiepachi nepal aayal nigamle pahilo patak 14.2 kilo ko silinḍarma aadha arthaat 7.1 kilomatra gas bhare ra witaran garne nirnaya gareko thiyo .

Tyastai dosro patak 2076 salma korona bhaairas mahamari suruwati charanma gas ko arko sankat dekhiyo . 11 chait 2076 dekhi sarkarle deshbyapi ‘lockdown’ garne tayari garepachi upabhoktale tras ka karan gas ‘hold’ garna thale, jasle garda bajarama ekaek abhaw sirjana bhayo .

Sohi abhaw santulanma lya'un nigamle 12 chait 2076 dekhi pun: aadha silinḍar gas witaran garne nirnaya garyo . karib tin saata samma 7.1 kilo ka silinḍar bikri gariyepachi aapurti sahaj bhaesanga 3 baishakh 2077 dekhi pun: pura silinḍar bikri khula gariyeko thiyo .

Yi dui thula sankat bahek 2069 salma aayal nigamle indian aayal corporation (ioc) lai bhuktani garna nasakda ra bibhinna samayama gas udyogi tatha dhwanikarta ka aandolan ka karan pani bajarama gas abhaw chuline gareko cha .

Ayatma purn parnirbhar hunu ra muluk bhitra paryapt bhandaran griha nahunu le samanya awarodh aunasath nepali bhansa prabhawit huncha . niyamit gas aapurti bhairakhda pani yo hahakar gas ko wastabik abhawle nahi bajarama abaidh thupri'eka atirikt silinḍar ra tyaslai niyaman garna dashakaumdekhi asaphal raheko niyamak nikay aayal nigam ko charam udasinata ko parinam bhaeko janakaraharu batauchan .

2072 salma bharatle nakabandi garda sankat ko samana garna upabhoktale gas napayepachi gharama silinḍar hudahudai naya silinḍar kine . udyogiharule byapar garne bela nai yahi ho bhnera dhamadham silinḍar bajar pathae . jaba jaba mag badhi bhayo wa sankat aiparyo, tyatibela samasya samadhan garna bhandai chahine bhanda badhi silinḍar bechne ra kinne kram chalirahyo .

Yadi tinai paksh ko dabai anusar sano samasya dekhinasath chahine bhanda badhi bajarama aniyantrit bhitri'eka yi silinḍarle nai kritrim abhaw ra samasya sirjana gareko ho bhane yaslai byabasthapan garna asaphal bhaeko sampurna jimmedari sarkar ra nigamle linuparcha .

Yo sankat aapurti pranalima a'eko samanya awarodh matai hoina, barsaumdekhi sarkari aakha chhalera wa mi le matoma maulaeko abyabasthako bisfot ho . bajar byabasthapan ko jimmedari bocheko aayal nigamle nai bajarama aawashyakata bhanda 60 lakh badhi silinḍar raheko swikar garirahanda prashna uthcha– yadi samasyabare janakari thiyo bhane ek dashak bitda pani yi silinḍar bajarabata hata'una wa byabasthapan garna nigamle ke garyo ? udyogiharule kshamata bhanda badhi silinḍar utpadan garera bajarama pathauda nigam kina chup basyo ?

Upabhokta lai dosh dinu galat, sampurna witaran pranali nai udyogi ra byapari ko kabjama

Mulukma samay–samayama sirjana hune khana pakaune elpi gas ko kritrim abhaw ra hahakar ma aam upabhokta lai dosh dinu purnarupma galat bhaeko aayal nigam ka purba nayab karyakari nirdeshak tatha petroleum byagya shushil bhattarai batauchan .

Gas ayatdekhi upabhokta ko bhansasamma pugne sampurna witaran pranali (micro distribution) ma sarkar ra aayal nigam ko kunai pakad nabhaeko ra yo purnata: niji kshetr (udyogi ra byapari) ko niyantranma raheka karan sankat nimtine gareko unako bhanai cha .

Samasya sindiket ra nitima cha

Bajarama gas abhaw hunasath upabhoktale anawashyak stock rakheko bhnera dosh thoparne prawrittiko khandan gardai bhattarai le bhane, ‘upabhokta ko ke nai pakad cha ra ? khali ek–duita silinḍar extra cha bhane yasto abhawka bela lyayera rakhau na bhanne matrai kura ho .’

Unka anusar mukhya samasya gas aapurti ra dhwanima hune ‘logistic’ samasya ra sindiket ho . ‘hami shatpratishat bharatiya bulletmai bhar pariraheka chhau,’ uni bhanchan, ‘uniharu bhitra ko sindiket, udyogiharu bich hune bargaining ra aantarik bishayharu le garda gasma samasya airaheko thiyo .’

Bholika dinma khadi mulukma ajhai dwandwa badhdai jane wa thap thulo sankat a'e nepal lai dui–tin mahina dhanne kunai bhandaran kshamata nahuda yasle rajya ko nitigat shoonyata prashṭ parne uni batauchan .

‘Bidyutiyo chuloma jane ki gas nai prayog garne bhannema rajya ra rajnitik netritwa nai bibhajit manasikata ma cha,’ byagya bhattarai bhanchan, ‘hamisanga yatro hydropower cha, gas ko bhandaran bana'unai hudaina, elpi ji ko pipeline pani bana'une hoina bhanne tara thos niti pani naline prawritti cha, ghargharma gas cha, sabai jana gas ka byagya bha'idida mulukle euta thos niti ra disha nai lina sakena .’

Aayal nigam ko bhumika ‘bhansar agent’ jasto

Aayal nigamle pdo jari garepani ayat ra witaranma nigam ko bhumika atyantai kamjor raheko bhattarai batauchan .

‘Nepal aayal nigam elpi gas ko ayatkarta matra ho, nigam ko kam bhane ko border ma a'epachi bhansar clear garidine ra gas udyogi ka namama bikri garidine matra ho, bhansarabata agadi badhepachi tyo gas purnarupma udyogi ko huncha,’ unle bhane, ‘nigam ko pratinidhi ko rupma ioc ko refinerybata gas utha'une jimma udyogi kai huncha, nigamle kun udyog ko gas ho bhnera chalanmatra bana'idincha .’

Witaran pranalima sarkar ko ‘shoonya niyantran’

Bhattarai ka anusar factoryma gas unload bhaee silinḍarma bhariyepachi tyo kaha ra kasari bikcha bhannema nigam ko kunai nigarani chaina .

‘Nigam ra sarkar ko upasthiti yo micro distributionma chhadaichaina, yo sampurna rupma udyogiharu le aaphai aaphno network marfat chala'iraheka chan,’ unle bhane, ‘diler lai dine, kaslai badhi dine, kaslai kam dine bhanne sabai udyogi ko hatma cha, kun bikreta adhikarik ho wa hoina bhanne pramanikaran pani huna sakena chaina, purnarupma niji kshetr ko pakadma huna le sankatka bela uhaharuko pranali pani fel huncha ra aaphai pani byabasthapan garna saknuhunna .’

Bajarama raheka karib 1 karod silinḍarmadhyek 60 lakh bhanda badhi silinḍar badhi bhaeko ra abhawka bela kasle kati silinḍar kaha lukayo wa witaran garyo bhanne tracking garne kunai ‘computerized system’ nabhaeko hunda samasya gahiridai gaeko uni batauchan .

Sankatka bela bajar hastakshep garna nigamsanga aaphnai bhandaran (storage) nahunu sabbhanda thulo kamjori raheko bhattarai le aulaye .

‘Nigamle aaphnai plant ra bhandaran chahinchha bhnera dherai lagera bajeṭma pani lekhayau, jagga byabasthapan pani garyau, tara mantralayama netritwa paribartan bhairahane, euta mantri aunda euta nirnaya garne ra arko aunda rokne prawritile kam huna sakena,’ unle bhane, ‘hamisanga 10–15 din wa mahina din ko bhandaran hunthyo bhane yasto hahakar nai hudaina thyo .’

Khali silinḍar ko mulya natokida kalobajari

Sarkarle gas ko matra mulya toke ko tara khali silinḍar ko mulya natokda bajarama kalobajari ra thagi bhairaheko petroleum byagya bhattarai le dabai gare .

‘Gas ko mulya nigamle tokhcha, tara khali silinḍar ko mulya tokieko chaina, khali silinḍar ko mulya kasle tokne ? yo turuntai tokidina pae bajarama 2 hajar wa 22 say kati ho, euta i ratma chalethyo,’ unle bhane, ‘abhawka bela khali silinḍar kai mulya badha'era kalobajari garne kam bhairaheko cha, yo bishay maile nikai uthaem tara karyanwayan gara'una saki'ena .’

Yo sarasar aparadh ho, upabhokta lai dosh di'era kohi umkina paudaina : upabhokta adhikarkarmi

Upabhokta adhikarkarmi madhav timalsina udyogiharule upabhokta lai dosh di'era aaphno kamjori ra aparadh luka'una khojeko arop lagachan .

‘Upabhokta ko gharama 15–20 wata silinḍar cha bhnera upabhokta lai dosh dine ? upabhokta ko ghar ke hotel ho ? parti palace ho ?,’ unle akrosh pokhe, ‘yo ta aaphno byabasthapaki kshamata ko kamjori luka'un ra nagarikpratiko anyay ra aparadh luka'un upabhoktamathi dosh thuparne kam matrai ho .’

Unka anusar nakabandi ra bhukamp jasto sankatka bela upabhokta lai silinḍar kinna badhya parne kam udyogi, aayal nigam ra sarkarle nai gareko thiyo .

‘Aaphno byabasthapaki kshamata luka'un, kamjori dhakchop garna upabhokta lai silinḍar kinna badhya pariyo, aaja tyahi upabhokta lai dosh di'era umkina khojidaicha,’ unle thape .

Udyogiharule ‘dharauti rasid bhaye silinḍar phirta huncha’ bhanne tark lai timalsinale upabhokta lai lutne ra jhukya'une prapancha ko sangya die . ‘ajasamma kun upabhokta lai dharauti ko bil di'ieko cha ? kun bikretale dharauti ko rasid diyeko cha ?,’ unle thape .

Bajarama raheka lakhau silinḍar, tyasko mulya ra dharauti rakambare kunai baigyanik tathyank nabhaeko bhandai yo sampurna karobar apardarshi raheko unako thar cha .

‘hamisanga silinḍar ko sankhya kati ho ? tyasko mulya kati ho ? dharauti rakam kati ho ? kunai tathyank chaina, aayal nigam, udyogi, bikreta sabai panchieka chan,’ unle bhane, ‘bholi maile bechnuparyo bhane mero ghar ko silinḍar ko paisa kasle dincha ? kasle gyaranti lincha ? kohi lidaina, yo sarasar upabhokta lai lutne khel ho .’

Timalsinle bajarama dekhieko yo sankat samadhan ka lagi tatkal bajarama kun udyog ka kati silinḍar chan, tyasko mulya ra dharauti rakam kati ho bhanne baigyanik tathyank sajjanik garna mag gare .

Sathai, harek upabhoktale aaphno silinḍar ko dharauti rakam phirta paune gyaranti sarkarle garnuparne ra aaphno kamjori luka'una upabhokta lai dosh dine tatha bajarama kritrim abhaw sirjana garne udyogi, bikreta ra sambandhit sarkari adhikarilai karbahi ko dayarama lyau'nuparne unako bhanai cha .

Udyogi ko gairjimmedar tark : kati silinḍar rakhne, tyo upabhokta ko niji kura ho

Upabhoktale dherai silinḍar stock rakheka karan gas ko kritrim abhaw nimtyaeko dabai garne udyogiharu tyasko jimmedari linabata panchieka chan .

Nepal elpi gas udyog sangha ka purbaadhyaksh shivaprasad ghimire le bajarama silinḍar badhi bhaeko kura swikare pani tyasko dosh upabhoktamathi nai thopareka chan .

Unle upabhoktale gharama kati wata silinḍar rakhchan bhanne bishay lai samanya gharayasi saman sanga tulana gardai yaslai niyaman garna nasakine tark gare .

‘Atirikta ta bhannu bhaena, ab tapaile gilas ek darjan rakhne ki dui darjan rakhne, tapaiko niji kuro bhayo,’ unle bhane, ‘tara, ahile gas ko ali badhi hold hunu ko karan chahin (bajarama dherai silinḍar hunu) nai ho bhanne hamro pani bujhai ho .’

Unako yo bhanai le udyogiharu samasyabare janakari bhaepani tyasko byabasthapanma aaphno kunai bhumika nabhaeko jasari panchina khojeko spaṣṭa huncha .

Sarkarle niti nai bana'era atirikta silinḍar phirta lina agrah garema udyogiharu tayar chan ki chainan bhanne prashnama purbaadhyaksh ghimire le prashṭ jawaf dina chahanan .

Baru, unle silinḍar phirta garne prakriya jhanjhatilo ra abyabaharik raheko bataye, jasle udyogiharu nitigat samadhan ka lagi tayar narheko sanket garcha .

‘Yo bikri hoina, dharauti ho, dharauti rakheko rasid cha bhane jahabata, jun rootbata (silinḍar) lyayeko ho, tyah i phirta huncha,’ unle bhane, ‘hamile (udyogale) lina hoina ni ! bikretasanga upabhoktale line, bikretale udyogasanga line ho, jun channelbata gaeko ho, tyahi channelbata aune ho .’

Yo prakriya sunda saiddhantik rupma thik lage pani 2072 sal wa tyasbhanda aghi kineko silinḍar ko dharauti rasid adhikansh upabhoktasanga surakshit chaina .
yo yathartha najar andaaj gardai ‘rasid bhaye phirta hunchha’ bhannu atirikt silindar phirta laine jimmedwaribata panchine bahana matrai bhayeko upabhokta adhikarkarmi haru batauchhan.

bil–bijakko prashnama pani umkine prayas

bajarma naya silindar kharid garda pani udyogiharule bil–bijak nadine gareko gunaso bara sodhda unale tyasalai dharauti rasidsanga jodera prashtha jawab dienan.

‘bhyat bil ta bikrima milne ho, yo bikri hoina, tara dharauti rasid dinuparchha, yadi bikretale diyena bhane tyo ujuri garnuparyo,’ purbaadhyaksh ghimire le bhane. tara, bikretaharule udyoga batai aafu harule bil napaaune gareko gunaso gardai aayeka chhan.

niti ra pranali abhaw samasyako jad : aayal nigam

aayal nigamka karyakari nirdeshak da. chandikaprasad bhatta swayam bajarma silindar sankhya aniyantrit hunu ra tyasalai niyaman garne ‘niti ra pranali abhaw’ nai samasyako jad bhayeko swikarchhan.

‘samasyako mukhye jad bhanekai niti ra pranali abhaw ho,’ uni bhanchhan, ‘euta gharparibarle kati wata silindar rakhne ra kun prakritiko byabasayle kati rakhne bhanne spashta niti chhaina, niti nahunda karyanwayan garne pranali pani bhayena, jasle garda bajarma maag ra aapurti santulan bigriyo.’

kun gharle kati silindar rakhna paune? sano kyafe wa chiya pasalalai kati silindar dine? thula hotel, restaurant tatha party palyes laai kati silindar dine? euta samanya niti banauna ek dashak samma asaphal hunu le niyamak nikayako niyat ra kshyamatamaathi prashna uthauchha.

aayal nigamka anusar desh ma 1 karod silindar matrai bhaye paryapt hunchha. tara, haal bajarma 60 lakh bhanda badhi silindar atirikt chhan. yahi badhi bhayeko silindar nai mukhye samasyako jadka rupma dekhieko karyakari nirdeshak bhatta swikarchhan.

dirghakalin samadhanako lagi pipeline ra ekikrit urja nitijasta thula sapana dekhaera nigam bigatko aaphno byabasthapakiya kamjoribata panchina khojeko dekhinchha.

tara, ti yojana banna barsaun lagchha. tyobhanda pahile garna sakinne aadhar bhut kaam, jastai silindar sima tokne, record rakhne ra bajarma bhayeka atirikt silindar phirta garaune samanya tara prabhawkari kadam chalnabata nigamlai kasle rokeko thiyo? yaso prashtha jawab nadisamma upabhoktale bhoge ko yoo sastiko naitik jimmedaribata kohi pani umkina paaudaina.

25 phagun, kathmandu. ‘sahuji gas kahile aune ho? maile naam tipayera gaekai ek sataa badhi bhaaisakyo,’ kathmandu buddhanagarsthit gas bikretasanga ek upabhokta bahas gardai thie.

gas bikretale bhane, ‘ahilesamma aayeko chhaina, ajhai 2–4 din lagla!’

sohi pasalma arka upabhokta pani nepal, siddharth, ebharest wa om madhye kunai gas chha bhandaai sodhdai aaye. bikretale uhi jawab die, ‘kunai pani chhaina, udyog batai gas aayeko chhaina.’

upabhokta, ‘kahile auchha?’

bikreta, ‘naam tipayera janu, 19–20 din ma palo auchha.’

ti bikretale 10–15 din dekhi gas aapurti lagbhag thappai jasto bhayeko dabi gare.

‘chunaw ma aapurti sahaj banaune bhaniyeko thiyo, tara gas aayena,’ unle bhane, ‘15 dinaghi ek patak 40 wata silindar aayepani tyasayata aapurti huna sakeko chhaina.’

pahile saatama karib 70 silindar bikri garne gareko ma ahile ek saatama paunuparne gas auna 15 din samma lagne gareko unale gunaso gare.

‘bidyarthi haru jasako euta matrai silindar hunchha, uniharulai byabasthapan garna sab bhanda garo bhayeko chha,’ unle thape. yasto awasthama euta matra silindar hune lai pahile nai naam tipauna aagrah garne gareko unko bhanai chha.

unle niyamit grahak ka saathai bahiraka manish haru samet gas khojdai auna thalepachhi maag ra aapurti bich thulo khadal dekhieko batae.

aapurtikarta udyogi harulai phon garda ‘aayepachhi pathaidinchhau’ bhanne jawab aune gareko tara pachhilo patak phon garda phon samet nauthaeko unale batae.

nepal aayal nigamle bhane pachhilo samay bajarma khana pakaune elpi gas abhaw bhandaai phailieko hallama kunai satyata nabhayeko dabi gardai aayeko chha.

nigamka karyakari nirdeshak da. chandikaprasad bhattale tathyank sarbajanik gardai desh ma gas aapurti maag bhanda badhi bhairaheko bhandaai aairaheka chhan. nigamle maag bhanda badhi aapurti bhayeko tathyank sarbajanik garirahnda bikretaharu bhane udyogi le nai maag anusar gas bajara napathayeko dabi gariraheka chhan.

nigam prawakta manoj thakur le phagun ko 24 dinma 42 hajar 95 ton elpi gas aayat bhayeko batae. tara, nigamko yo tathyank le bajarma mahinaun dekhi gas ko charam abhaw jheli raheka ra euta silindar ko lagi haptaunsamma lain basna badhya sarbasadharan upabhoktalai bhane gijyai raheko chha.

nigam prawakta thakur le dieko jankari anusar 1 dekhi 24 phagunsamma awadhima dainik ausat 1 hajar 7 say 50 ton bhanda badhi gas aayat bhairaheko dekhinchha, jun samanya awasthako maag dhana napug dekhinna.

tara, bajar awastha bhane thik ulto chha. upabhoktaharu ritto silindar bokera dinahu bibhinna dipo chahari raheka chhan. naam tipayeko 20–25 din samma pani palo naaune samasya samanya baneko chha.

gas khoi ? : upabhokta

kathmandu tokha basne madan sharma pani bikretale 20–25 din pachhi matrai gas ko palo aune bhanepachhi chintit chhan.

‘ma om gas ko grahak hu,’ unle bhane, ‘bikretale 25 din pachhi palo aune bataeka chhan, gas ko samasya bhayeko dherai samay bhayo, ahilesamma pani samadhan nagari upabhoktalai dhukka dine kaam bhairaheko chha.’

buddhanagar basne ranju bhandari le aaja 15 din pachhi matrai gas payeko bataiin. ‘bikretale udyogbata gas nai aayeko chhaina, naam tipayera janu bhanepachhi naam tipayeko thie,’ unale bhanin, ‘mero palo nai 37 nambarma thiyo, aaja balla paiyo, yahaan gas jharnasath ekaichhinma sabai sakiyo.’

unle euta matrai silindar bhayeko le gas na pauda 15 din samma naikai sasti bhognupareko gunaso garin. ‘dinahu gas aayo bhandaai pasalma sodhna gaen,’ unale sunain, ‘pasalele jahile pani aayeko chhaina bhanera phirta pathaunthye, gas kai karan ekdamai tanab nai bhognuparyo.’

unka anusar bikretale 25 wata matrai gas udyogi le pathayeko aaphulai jankari dieko bataiin.

paus antim saatatira kathmandu upatyaka kehi dipoma phattaphutta dekhina thaleko khana pakaune elpi gas abhaw le magh lagdasamma charam sankatko rup lieko thiyo.

aapurti shrinkhalama aayeko samanya awarodh karan dekhaiepani bistarai yo samasya eka arkalai dosharopan garne ra jimmedaribata panchine prawrittiko shikar banyo.

lamau lain, ritto silindar bokera dipo–dipo chaharne upabhokta ra ‘gas chhaina’ bhanne bikretaka bhanai upatyakako niyati bane. chunawko bela kota badhaera aapurti sahaj banaaiyeko aayal nigamko dabi karib dui mahina bitisakda pani sahi sabit huna nasakeko bajarko awasthale dekhauchha. ahile pani bajarma sambandhit pakshako ‘dhwasta bitran pranali ra shunya jawafedahita’ prashtha dekhinchha.

niyamak nikay aayal nigam, gas udyogi ra bikreta bich samanwaya abhaw ra eka arkalai dosharopan garne prawrittika karan samasya jhanai jelieko chha. aapurti bhanda bitran pranalima dekhieko gambhir trutile sarbasadharan upabhoktale haptaunsamma gas napaaune tara hotel, restaurant ra pahunchawalele sahjai paune awastha sirjana bhayeko chha.

gas abhawko mukhye jad aapurti bhanda pani bitran pranalima raheko upabhokta, adhikarkarmidekhi bikretaharu samet swikarchhan. bajarma bikretaharule euta matrai silindar prayog garne gharayasi upabhoktalai panchayera naphamukhi hudai byabasayik pratishthanharulai gas upalabdha garaairaheko pramana charapasta bhetinchhan.

bikretale hotel, restaurant, kyafe lai dinchhan gas

aaitabar ra sombar onlinekhabar le buddhanagar, shankhamul ra naya baneshwar ka darjan badhi gas bikretaharulai gas sahaj chha ki chhaina bhanera sodhda ti sabaile 2 mahinadekhi dekhieko gas abhaw ajhai samadhan nabhayeko ra udyogbata nai 20 dekhi 25 wata matrai silindar jharne gareko jawab die.

onlinekhabarko sthalgat reporting kramma bikretale upabhoktalai gas nadiyera kyafe tatha restaurant laai niyamit rupma bechne gareko pani paiyeko chha.

buddhanagar ka ek bikretale najikaka kyafe tatha restaurant aaphno niyamit grahak bhayeko le uniharulai rokna namillene batae.

‘restaurant ra kyafe laai gas upalabdha garaune ta hamro warsik samjhauta nai hunchha,’ aaphno parichay batauna nachahneka unale bhane, ‘uniharulai maage jati dina sakieko ta chhaina tara 6 wata maag bhayekama 4 wata matrai pathaidinuparne awastha chha.’

onlinekhabar le kyafe tatha restaurant haruma pani gas abhaw jhelnupareko chha ki chhaina bhanera sodheko thiyo. jawafma uniharule abhaw nabhayeko ra sadhai lyai rakhne bikretale aawashyak pareka khandama niyamit upalabdha garaai rakhako batae. bikretale pani pahunchawalai bhaneko jati gas upalabdha garaairaheko dekhinchha.

hotel, restaurant, kyafe laai niyamit dieko huna sakchha : bikreta mahasangh

gas bikreta mahasanghka barishtha upadhyaksh bishnu dulal pani yo kura swikarchhan. kehi bikretale hotel ra restaurant laai ‘niyamit grahak’ bhandaai prathamikata dieko huna sakne unko bhanai chha.

barishtha upadhyaksh dulal le mahasanghle ek silindar matra bhayeka paribar, bidyarthi, sutkeri tatha birami laai prathamikata dina aaphna sabai sadashyalai spashta nirdesh dieko batae.

‘hamile saathi bhai laai bishesh bargalaai prathamikata dinu bhanera nirdesh dieka chhau,’ unle bhane, ‘tara, katai katai badmasi bhayeko huna sakchha.’

unle bajarma dekhieko abhawko euta karan antarartyiya bajar ko awasthale garda upabhoktale aawashyak bhanda badhi gas thuparna khojnu pani bhayeko tark gare.

nirwachan ra bidale bitranma kehi asar

dulal ka anusar haalai sampanna nirwachanka karan lagatar tin din sarbajanik bida pareko, tyaspachhi shanibar ra mahila diwaska karan gas dhuwani tatha bitranma karib 5 din awarodh pugeko thiyo. yasai ka karan kehi upabhoktale samayama gas napayeko gunaso aayeko unle swikare.

‘samanayata 7 dekhi 10 dinma palo aunuparne ma kehi thauma 15(20 din lageko suchana aayeko chha, tara aaba yo awastha sudhar hudai chha,’ unle bhane.

kauntar sels ko birodh ra upabhoktalai sasti

aayal nigam ra gas udyogi harule sodhai kauntarbata gas bikri garda bitran pranalima anyol sirjana bhayeko dulalko tark chha. unle dipo ra dilar marphat bitran garda upabhoktalai sahaj ra sasto parne batae.

‘jorpatiko manchhe tyeksi chadhera nigamko kauntarma gas lina jada 1 hajar 9 say 10 rupaiyako gas laai 3 hajar samma parna janchha,’ unle bhane, ‘tyasaile udyogi ra nigamle pasal (dilar) marphat nai gas pathaunu nyayochit hunchha.’

nepal elpi gas udyog sangh adhyaksh diwan chand le haal bajar maag dhana aapurti apug bhayeko swikardai awastha samanya huna ajhai kehi mahina lagna sakne batae.

bharatbata masik 3 hajar ton gas ko kota thapa bhayera aayepani bajarma sirjana bhayeko thulo maag ra maujdat (byakalag) laai purti garna nasakda abhaw kayamai raheko chandko bhanai chha.

‘pahile 45 hajar ton aauthyo, ahile badhaera 48 hajar ton aairaheko chha,’ unle bhane, ‘tara, yo briddhile pani purano abhaw purti garna sakiraheko chhaina.’

chand le bikretaharule udyogilai gas nai napathayeko bhanne tark satya nabhayeko dabi gare. udyogaharule kun dilar laai, kun mitima, kati parimanma gas pathayeko ho bhanne bara aayal nigamlai dainik report pathairaheko unko dabi chha. samasya udyogbata nabhayi dilar star ma ra kamjor bajar anugamanka karan sirjana bhayeko unko tark chha.

‘hamile dilarharulai restaurant bhanda gharayasi upabhoktalai prathamikata dinu bhaneka chhau, tara uniharule hunchha–hunchha matra bhanchhan,’ chand le bhane, ‘bastabma bajar anugaman garne ra dilar le kaslai gas bachiraheko chha bhanera nigarani garne kaam banijya bibhag ra aayal nigamko ho, jun prabhawkari huna sakeko chhaina.’

niyam anusar dilarharule gas bikri gareko upabhoktako phon nambar sahitko record rakhunuparne bhayepani tyasako palana ra anugaman phitalo hunda kalobajari le prashraya payeko dekhinchha.

nigam purnata: gairjimmedar banyo : upabhokta adhikarkarmi

bajarma om, ebharest, nepal gas ra siddharth brandka silindar upabhoktale payeka chhainan. yas sankatko mukhye dosh aayal nigamko kamjor byabasthapan ra gairjimmedarpurn karyashaili raheko upabhokta adhikarkarmi madhaw timalsinako aarop chha.

unka anusar gas abhawko yo lamau shrinkhalama nigamko bitran pranali purnarupma aparardarshi ra aspashta baneko chha, jasako pratyaksh phaida pahunchawala ra byabasayik pratishthanharule uthairaheka chhan.

‘bitran pranali parardarshi bhayena,’ timalsina le bhane, ‘euta silindar balne byaktiharule haptaunsamma lain basda pani gas pauna sakeka chhainan, euta silindar lina yuddha jitejasto garnuparne badhyatmak awastha sirjana gariyeko chha.’

hotel ra party palyes prathamikatama, sarbasadharan tiraskrit

bajarma bikretaharule sarbasadharan upabhokta bhanda hotel, restaurant ra party palyes harulai prathamikata dida pani eka silindar hune le sasti khepnuparne uni batauchhan.

‘bikretaharu sidhai bhanchhan hotel–restaurant hamro niyamit ra warsik grahak hun, euta silindar prayog garne upabhokta hoinan,’ unle bhane, ‘uniharu dheḍh lakhko mobail bokne tara gharma arko silindar narakhne bhandaai ultai upabhoktamaathi dosh thuparchhan.’

anugaman dekhaawati, kahaan gayo gas ?

banijya bibhag jasta anugamankari nikayaharuko bhumika pani dekhaawati matra bhayeko unko aarop chha. ‘aapurtima abhaw chhaina bhanera nigamle tathyank dinchha, tara bajarma gas chhaina,’ adhikarkarmi timalsina le bhane, ‘yo sunchandi jasto lukaera rakhne bastu pani hoina, aakhir tyo gas kahaan jairaheko chha?’

unle yas sankatko sampurna jimmedari nigam byabasthapan, aapurti mantralay ra pradhanmantri karyalay le linuparne batae. yasto sankatpurn awasthama pani aapurti sahaj banauna ra bitran pranali parardarshi banauna thos kadam chalna nasaknu le sarkar nagarik prati uttardayi nabhayeko pusti hune unko bhanai chha.

bajar anugaman jimmedari payeko banijya, aapurti tatha upabhokta sanrakshan bibhag le bhane bajarma gas lukaiyeko (hording) bhanda pani aapurti pranalimai samasya huna sakne bataeko chha.

bibhagka suchana adhikari narahari tiwari bibhag le gas, tel ra khadyaannajasta atyawashyak bastuko nirantar anugaman gariraheko batauchhan.

‘hamile gas ko bishaylai kahilyai chhadeka chhainau,’ unle bhane, ‘tara, aapurti garne jima nepal aayal nigamko ho, nigamle paryapt gas aayeko bataune tara bajarma upabhoktale napaaune awastha dekhieko chha.’

suchana adhikari tiwari le ‘helo sarkar’ ma samet gas abhaw bhayeko gunaso ajhai aairaheko batae.

gas chha, bitran pranali chusta bhayena : nigam

pachhilo samay bajarma dekhieko gas abhaw bara nigamka elpiji bibhag pramukh binitamani upadhyay le gas aapurti nirantar bhairahe pani bajarma sarvasulabh nabhayeko swikare.
unka anusar haalai ekadin 1 say 46 gas bullet bhitriyeko ra pachhilo samay 50 hajar ton gas aayat bhayeko cha . yadyapi, upabhoktale sahajai gas pauna nasakeko gunasoprati nigam gambhir raheko unko bhanai cha . ‘gas upalabdha bhairaheko cha, tar sarbasulabh chaina,’ upadhyayle bhane, ‘aayat bhairaheko gas kaha gairaheko cha bhanne bishayama hami pani chhalafl ra bibechana gariraheka chaum .’ unle upabhoktako maag aswabhawik badheko tarf sanket gare . kehi dinaghi petrol ra dizelko khapat pani dainik 14915 lakh liter pugeko udahran didai unle upabhoktaharule aawashyakata bhanda badhi sanchay garda pani abhaw dekhiyeko huna sakne tark gare . bajarama dekhieko samasya samadhan garna nigamle bibhinna kadam chaleko upadhyayle bataye . unka anusar gas abhaw karan patta lagauna ra aapurti byabastha sahaj banauna gas byabasayiharusanga chhalafl ko tayari bhairaheko cha . tokiyeko kota anusar gas aayat nagarne udyoglaai spashtikaran sodhiyeko cha . elpiji gas winiyamawali 2065 bamojim aaphno kotako 80 pratishatbhanda kam aayat garne udyoglaai karbahi garine unle chetawani die . gasko mulya badne halla kaaran kritrim abhaw sirjana garieko huna sakne ashankalaai unle kharej gare . nigamle march 15 samma mulya samayojan nagarine spashta parisakeko unle bataye . nigam ra banijya bibhagle bajar anugaman gariraheko unle jankari die . sanwadka kramama upadhyayle kehi gas companyko aapurtima samasya raheko swikar gare . unka anusar pahile nepal gas ra ebharest gas ko gunaso badhi aayepani haal tekuma counter rakhier bikri garna thalepachi kehi sahaj bhayeko cha . yadyapi siddhartha, saibaba, om ra hp jasta companyharuko aapurtima ajhai samasya cha . ‘aapurti byabasthapanma hami dinrat lagiraheka chaum,’ unle bhane, ‘indiyan aayalko refineryharusanga nirantar samparkma chaum ra dainik load bhayeko bibaran liiraheka chaum .’ nigamka anusar 28 maghdekhi 25 falgun samma nigamko teku karyalaybata 2 hajar 9 say 32 silinder nepal gas tatha ebharest ra sugam gas 2 hajar 6 say silinder bikri bhayeko cha 8 magh, kathmandu . pachhilo 10 din dekhi kathmandu upatyakama khana pakaune elpi gas sankat chulidai gae ko cha . upabhoktaharu ritto silinder bokar euta pasalbata arko pasal bhaumtariraheka bhetinchan . dilaharule companybatai gas naayeko jawab pharkairahanda upabhokta sasti khepna badhya chan . tribhuvan bishwabidyalayka adhikansh bidyarthi dera gari basne kathmandu kirtipurma gas abhaw charkiyeko cha . katai kunai pasal wa dilarma gas upalabdha cha bhane pani kalobjari bhairaheko tyaha ka bidyarthiharule gunaso gareka chan . dera bhadama basne bidyarthiharule pachhilo 10 din dekhi gas napayepachi dherai nai pida bhayeko tribhuvan bishwabidyalayama adhyayanarat suresh badale bataye . ‘9/10 din bhaisakyo kirtipurtir gas pauna chadeko,’ unle gunaso gare, ‘sarkarle gas jati pani upalabdha cha bhaniraheko cha, tar yeta kirtipurma bhane byabariharule gas dina sakeka chainan, bhayekole pani lukayer kalobjari gariraheka chan .’ upabhoktako bhansasanga pratyaksh jodieko gas kalobjari bairahanda pani anugaman garne sarkari nikay mukadarshak dekhieko unko aarop cha . kathmandu kalanki basne gyanahari basnet 3 din dekhi khana pakaune gas khojima chan . unle sadhaim gas laijane pasalma sodhda gas wikretale ahile dilarle nai gas napathaeko uttar die . tyaspachi basnet aaphno warparka sabai gas bechne pasal chahare, tar sabaile ‘ahile bajarama gas abhaw cha’ bhanne uttar pharkae . ‘kalankima aaphno warpar bhayeka sabai pasalma sodhda gas chaina bhanne jawab matrai paaye,’ unle onlinekhabarsanga bhane, ‘tyaspachi bujhdai bujhdai tekusamma pugda pani kunai pasalma gas pauna sakiye na .’ yo samasya basnetko matra hoina, balaju raniban basne ramesh thapako pani durustai cha . aru bela euta phone kalka bharama gharai aaipugne gas ahile silinder nai bokar pasal pugda pani pauna muskil cha . ‘pahile ta phone garda gharai aauthyo, ahile pasalma silinder puryauda pani rittai hat pharkanupareko cha,’ unle sunae . uni ‘nepal gas’ ka upabhokta hun . gas napayepachi ahile dilarle unko naam tipar euta sano kagajko chirkaṭo thamaidiyeko cha . ‘dilarma gas chaina, khali silinder thuparieko cha,’ thapa bhannchan, ‘malaai euta kagaj dieka chan jasko nambar 27 cha ra gas aayepachi phone garchu bhaneka chan, tar tyo phone kahile aaune ho tunga chaina .’ dilarle nai dipobata gas nayaekale upabhoktalaai khali hat pharkaaunu pareko kathmandu kalanki ka gas wikreta suman gautam bataumchan . ‘maile bechne nepal gas ho, abhaw bhayeko bhandai dilarle nai kam gas pathaeko cha,’ unle bhane, ‘magejati gas dilarle dina nasakda grahaklaai ritto hat pharkaaunuparyo, naam tipaer raakheko cha, gas aau nasath sabbalaai bolayer dine ho .’ bajarama dekhieko gas abhawko sabai bhanda thulo marmaa euta matra silinder hune bidyarthi ra nyun aay bhayeka paribar pareka chan . dui wa tyasbhanda badhi silinder hune laai khasai samasya nabhayepani eutaiko bharama basneharuko ta bhansa nai bandi hune sthiti dekhieko upabhoktako gunaso cha . gas abhaw cha : gas wikreta mahasangh jado mahinama bisheshgari kathmandu upatyakama gas khapat samanyako tulanama 20-25 pratishatsamma badhcha . nepalamma pratimahina karib 47-48 hajar ton gas aawashyak parnema chalu mahina aayat 42-43 hajar tonma simit hune anuman cha . gas wikreta mahasangh nepalka anusar jado mausam suru bhayesangai bajarama elpiji gas khapat badhne garcha . tar, maag badhesangai bajarama gas abhaw dekhieko sangh ko bhanai cha . mahasangh barishtha upadhyaksh bishnu dulal le jado mahinama swabhawik rupma gas khapat badhi hune ra udyogiharule paryapta matrama gas ‘load’ nagarda bajarama kehi samasya dekhieko bataye . unka anusar nepal aayal nigamka mahanirdeshak ra elpiji gas pramukhsanga yo bishayama chhalafl bhaisakeko cha . bajarama gas abhaw hunuma mukhyata mausami maag, udyogiharuko prabidhik samasya ra upabhoktako byabahar jimmedar raheko mahasangh ko bhanai cha . ‘jado mahinama aru samayako tulanama gas khapat badhi hune ra katipay udyogile tadhaaka dipoharubata gas uthauna nakhojne ra najikai bata matra lyauna khojda aapurtima santulan milna sakeko chaina,’ uni bhannchan, ‘yasabahek abhaw hune halla chalnaasath upabhoktale aaphusanga bhayeka khali silinderharu pani bhaer rakhne (hold garne) prawrittile bajarama kritrim abhaw jasto dekhiyo .’ mahasanghle aayal nigam ra udyogiharusanga nirantar sanwad gariraheko ra kehi din bhitrai tripakshiya baithak baser aapurti byabastha sudridha baniyene unle bataye . yastai katipay gas udyogma marmat sambhar ko kaam bhairaheko le pani aapurtima kehi dhilaai bhayeko unle bataye . abako ek hapta dekhi 10 din bhitra bajarapurnarupma sahaj hune barishtha upadhyaksh dulal ko dabi cha . 4-5 din mai gas abhaw hatcha : elpiji gas udyog sangh gas ko abhaw 4-5 din bhitrai purna hatcha bhaner nepal elpiji gas udyog sanghle dabi gareko cha . sangh adhyaksh diwan chandle 15 din dekhi aapurtima samasya dekhieko ra kehi awarodh abha hatisakekale 4-5 din bhitrai bajar samanyawasthama farkine bataye . adhyaksh chandle bharat barauni refineryma aayeko prabidhik samasya ra marmat sambhar ka karan aapurtima kehi dhilaai bhayeko bataye . ‘15 din pahiladekhi alikati samasya bhayeko ho,’ unle bhane, ‘refineryharu alikati maintenancema gae, baraunibata aune 10 hajar tonma alikati defective bhayera ho, tyo banisakyo, ahile gas auna thalisakyo .’ aapurti byabasthapan ka lagi ek thauka gadi arko thau pathauda pani kehi samay lageko unko bhanai cha . pachhilo kehi dinayata gas aune kram nikai badhisakeko unle bataye . ‘nepal gas ahile auna thalisakyo, asti ekadin 10 gadi arthat 12 hajar silinder aaisake, feri arko din pani tyattikai aaye,’ adhyaksh chandle bhane, ‘ahilesamma 30-35 hajar silinder barabar gas aaisakyo ra aune kram jari cha .’ chandle bajarama gas abhaw hune darka karan upabhoktale silinder bhaer rakhne prawrittile garda pani kehi samasya dekhieko bataye . ‘factoryma awastha samanya bhaisakyo, tar jati bhaye pani shortage bhayeko bhandaī upabhoktale bhaer rakhdai chan, tyasko asar dekhieko ho,’ unle thape . chandka anusar gas aayatma dekhieko samasya karib ek mahina dekhi rahepani bajarama bhane pachhilo karib dui hapta dekhi matra pratyaksh prabhaw dekhina thaaleko ho . gas abhaw cha bhaner attinu naparne ra 3-4 dinpachi aapurti byabastha purnarupma sahaj hune unko dabi cha . gas samasya samadhan bhaisakyo : aayal nigam nepal aayal nigamle bajarama elpiji gas aapurtima dekhieko samasya samadhan bhaisakeko ra ahile aapurti niyamit bhairaheko dabi gareko cha . nigam prawakta manoj thakurka anusar kehi nishchit gas udyogko dhuanima samasya aauda bajarama gas abhaw mahasus bhayeko ho . ‘nepal, saibaba ra ebharest gas dhuanima samasya bhayeko thiyo, tyo ahile samadhan bhaisakeko cha ra aune kram jari cha,’ unle bhane . bajarama sabai bhanda badhi upabhokta bhayeko nepal gas ko silinder rotationma kehi samasya aauda yasko asar badhi dekhieko prawakta thakurle bataye . ‘sabai bhanda badhi upabhokta nepal gaskai hun,’ prawakta thakurle bhane, ‘tyasko silinder ma rotation bhayepachi aliali abhaw dekhihaalcha .’ jado mausam (pus-magh) ma nepal ra bharat duwaitir gas khapat badhne ra tyasai samayma dhuanikartaharule uchit dhangale dhuanai nagarda samasya utpanna bhayeko nigamko bhanai cha . yadyapi, nigamle udyogharule mage jati ‘pdo’ (product delivery order) upalabdha garairaheko spashta pareko cha . samasya samadhan ka lagi nigamle gas udyogiharusanga chhalafl garisakeko ra ahile maagbhanda badhi gas load bhairaheko prawakta thakurko dabi cha . ‘hamro khapat yo jadoko bela 75 dekhi 80 bullet ho, tar ahile jhandai 90 dekhi 1 say bullet load bhairaheko cha,’ unle thape . gas aapurti niyamit bhaisakeka karan upabhoktale attinuparne awastha naraheko unko bhanai cha . tar, euta matra silinder hune upabhoktalaai bhane rotationka karan kehi samasya parna sakne unle bataye . 30 pus, kathmandu . gata aarthik barsha nai gharayasi prayojanma khapat hune gasma dine anudanlaai grahakko khatamaai pathaidine ra byabasayik prayojan ka lagi bhane anudan nadine bhaneko aayal nigamle ahilesamma ukta byabastha karyanwayanma lyayeko c