angai jodieko makwanpur udyog banijya sanghlaai pani sanrachana hatauna patrachara garisakeko cha . hetauda upamahanagarpalika karyalaylaai pani madan bhandari swasthya bigyan pratishthan, hetauda aspatal bahirako ra nagar kshetrbhitra raheka arko sanrachana hatauna patrachara garisakieko bibhajan pramukh adhikarile bataye . sadak bibhajan karyalayko patrachara pachi hetauda bitran kendra, nepal bidyut pradhikaran hetaudale sadak simabhitra nirmit sanrachanama raheka bidyut ko meter baxalagayat bidyutiya upakaranharuko byabasthapan tatha sthanantaran garna sarvajanik suchana jari gareko cha . sadak bibhajan hetaudale hetauda upamahanagarpalika kshetrbhitra parne mahendra rajmarg ra tribhuvan rajpath ko sadak bistarka lagi sthayi tatha asthayi sanrachana hatauna gata 5 mangsirmai 15 din ko ultimatem diisakeko cha . aagaami 19 mangsirsamma sadak sima kendra rekhadekhi 25–25 gaj bhitra baneka sthayi tatha asthayi prakritika gharṭahara, sanrachana hataune samayasima tokiyeko ho . ratomatedekhi buddhachok hudai rapti pul samma ra buddhachokdekhi samari pul sammako sadak sima 25/25 gaj (75/75 phit) bhitra baneka sthayi ra asthayi gharṭahara tatha arko sanrachanaharu hatauna bhaneko ho . 20 mangsirdekhi hetaudako mukhya bajar kshetrbhitra parne dui rajmargma sawarisadhan sanchalanma rok lagaine bhayeko pramukh jilla adhikari basant adhikarile jankari die . sadak bibhajan karyalaya makwanpurka injiyar yadav subediko netritwama gathit task force timle bihibardekhi ratomate kshetrbata sadak sima kshetrko naksankam gariraheko cha . naksankamko kramama sthaniiyabata samanya kehi awarodhharu bhayeko bibhajan pramukh adhikarile bataye . task force timma hetauda upamahanagarpalika, jilla prahari karyalaya, napi karyalaya, khanepani byabasthapan bord, wan karyalaya, nepal bidyut pradhikaran, durasanchar pradhikaran lagayat sambandhit nikayka pratinidhi sadashya chan . 23 chait, kathmandu . arthamantri dr. swarnim wagle le share bajar laai anawashyak aatankit parne kaam bhayeko spashta pareka chan . aarthik patrakar samaj (sejan) ka padadhikari sanga bhayeko bhetwartako kramama waglele bajarama anawashyak tras phailaaune kaam bhairaheko bhandai naattin aagrah gare . sarkarle laganikartamathi kunai karbahi garne uddeshya narakheko spashta pardai unle anaitik kaary garne laai matrai kanunbamojim nai karbahi hune bataye . ‘share bajar nepalka aru kshetrbhanda badhi byabasthit ra pardarshi cha’ unle bhane ‘paperless pranali, bankmargat karobar, labhansha sidhai khatama, kar pranali spashta, kasle kinyo/bechyo bhanne track garna sakinne bhayekale yo pranali bishwosaniya cha .’ share bajar laai sarkarle digitalizesan ko namuna kshetrko rupma lieko unle bataye . tar yadi bajarama kasaile insider trading, manipulation, aru anaitik kaam gareko cha bhane bidyaman kanun anusar karbahi hune unle spashta pare . ‘ahile laganikarta panic hun aawashyak chaina, aagaami dinharuma share bajar sudhar ka lagi pani kaam hune chan’ unle bhane . nepse punarsanrachana pratiwedan adhyayan garer sudhar agadi badhaine unle spashta pare . ‘rashtriya swatantra partyko bachapatra ka bunda 33 ra 34 karyanwayan garne ho, laganikartale adhyayan gare huncha . share bajarprati hami kati udar chaum, tyasbatai spashta huncha’ unle bhane . bajarama pani sunaula din aaune unle bataye . ahile sarkarko prathamikata nepal laai grey listbata bahir nikalnu raheko unle bataye . ‘grey listbata muluklaai bahir lyaune sabalma kagajma matrai kura garne tar bahir nagarne gareko bhram cha, hami ahile lagu pani garne chranma prawesh gareka chaum’ unle bhane . sampatti shuddhikaran lagayatka wittiya aparadhma barsau dekhi bhayeka anusandhan akatya praman ka aadharama matrai ahile agadi badheko unle bataye .
Sanstha wa byakti chhanera duḥkha dine hamro kunai niyat chaina . hami khulabajar arthaniti manchhau tyo bhaneko chhada arthatantra hoina’ unle bhane . nyay nirupan ko kam adalatbata hune bhaeka karan kasailai lakshit garera karbahi garne nahi kanun anusar agadi badha'une unako bhanai cha .
20 chait, kathmandu . arthamantri dr. swarnim waglele aagami arthik barsa 2083/84 ko bajeṭ lekhana ka lagi artha mantralay ka rajaswa byabasthapan mahashakha pramukh uttarkumar khatri ko sanyojaktwama samiti gathan gareka chan .
