27 chait, pokhara . pokharama chait 25 gate sajh bich bajarai bibhatsa ghatnale dherai laai wikshipsita matrai bana'ena, suraksha santra mathi samet prashna khada garidiyo . shiwalay chokbata sabhagriha chok taraf hiḍiraheki mahila ko kancaṭma dharilo hatiyar prahar gari ek samuha pharar bhaeko thiyo .
Khukuri praharle ranthanindai sadakmai ḍhaleki mahila ko mrutyu huncha . mritak pokhara–5 ki sirjana paudel kesi raheko khulasa huncha . paudel ekal mahila thin ra unle prithwichokma jutta pasal sanchalan gardai airaheki thin .
