Hatyama bhanja sanglagn
Praharile antatah hatyama aaphnai bhanja sanglagn raheko nishkarsh nikal dai pakra'u gareko cha . jo patak–patak laguaushadhi, abhadra byabahardekhi chorisamma ko abhiyogma yasaghi nai hirastama pareka thie .
Khukuri prahar garera bhagne bhanjalai praharile samateko cha bhane motorsaikal chalak ko khoji gariraheko cha . prahari anusandhanle bibhatsa hatyapachi ka rahasya pachhyaudai gairaheko cha ra jasle anusandhanmai khaṭieka praharilai samet achammit pariraheko cha .
Jiwan ka duḥkhasukh saṭne kasam khayera bibaha gareka shriman 2 barsagadi nai bite . tyobhanda ek barsa agadi matrai chhori janmieki thin . chhorile babu chinnai painan, unale shriman ko maya ra sahayatra .
Pokhara–malepatan ki sirjana paudel kesilai ke thaha aaphno jiwan pani yati bibhatsa ra hridayabidarak bhaera sakine cha . jeṭhi shrimatle wish sewan garera atmahatya garepachi malepatan ka byabasayi krishna kesile sirjanalai 4 barsaghi bibaha gareka thie .
Krishna le unlaai jiwanbhar sath dine kasam khayeka thie tara bibahapachi pariwarik kalah ra bibadle tanaw sirjana garirahyo . 2 barsaghi shriman ko mrutyu bhaepachi jeṭhi tira ka chora chori sanga unako bibad chalirahyo . unale adalatma ansh mudda haleki thin .
Pokhara malemapatanma khasiboka ko taja masu bechne krishna le malepatan ra sedima ghar joḍeka thie . sirjana sedisthit gharama basthin ra prithwichokdekhi nagadhungataraf syangja jane bas chhuṭne sadak chheuma jutta pasal gardai a'eki thin .
Chait 25 gate budhabar sajh unle aghillo dinharu ma jastai pasal banda garera shiwalay chok huda i sabhagriha chok taraf ko bato huda i ghar pharkindai thin . sabhagriha chok niskinu bhanda thoraiaghi unako kancaṭma kasaile dhārila hatiyar prahar garyo .
Uni ranthanindai sadakma bajarin . tau kabata hulahulti ragat bagyo . tauko ko bhitri bhag samet niskane gari bhaeko hatiyar praharle unako pran nai chhinyo . budhabar sajh 7 bajetira bhaeko yo dardanak ra bibhatsa hatyale dherai laai wikshipsita banayo .
Praharimathi prashna
Ekal jiwan, sano byabasay garera 3 barsaki chhori hurka'iraheki sirjanako bibhatsa hatya kasle kin garyo hola ? anek anuman ra prashnaharu khada bhaeka thie . bichbajarai khukuri prahar garera pharar hunda pani tatkal praka'u garna nasakeko bhandai praharimathi suraksha chunauti khada bhaeko thiyo .
Paryapt sisitibhi phuṭej nahuda abhiyukta pahichanma samasya khepeko praharile antatah ghatanama sanglagn laai pakra'u gareko cha . ghatanama aaphnai bhanja prayog bhaeko anusandhanbata patta lagaeko cha .
Prarambhik anusandhan ra bayanma hepne, aphelit garera bolne gareka karan aaphule hatya garidieko bhanjale bataeka chan . tara, hatyama paribar kai anya sadasyako pani yojana hunasakne anuman saath praharile thap anusandhan gariraheko cha .
Praharika anusar uniharu le diusaid dekhi reki gariraheka thie . sirjanako pasal agadi ko chiyapasalma basne nigarani gardai picha gardai airaheka thie . sabhagriha chok niskine sadaknera saṭharu banda hudai thie bhane laiṭ pani kam bhairaheko mauka choper uniharule dhārila hatiyar prahar gareko prahari srotle bataeko cha .
Praharile paribar kai 3 jana manish laai samet sodhpuph ka lagi lyayeko thiyo . uniharu ko bayan, pariwarik kalah ra ansh muddako bishaylai pachhyaudai jada prahari abhiyuktasamma pugeko ho .
Ahile praharile sirjana hatyama ghar bhitrai sadasyako yojana hunasakne thap pramāṇharuko anusandhanma juṭiraheko cha . sirjanako sabbhanda thulo bibad ra kalah sauteni chora sanga pa'iyeko cha . tara, uni ahile braun sugar sahit pakra'u parira laguaushadhi ko prayog ko muddama karagarama raheko pa'iyeko cha .
Thap anusandhan jari
Chora ko samet yojana hunasakne dekhieka karan praharile thap anusandhan gariraheko cha . karagarama raheka chora sanga sirjanako sampatti bibad thiyo . paribarsanga ko ansh mudda ahile pani adalatma bicharadhin cha .
Jeṭhi shrimatle wish sewan garera atmahatya garepachi sirjanalai dosro shrimati ka rupma krishna le bibaha gareka thie . ‘amako mrutyu bhaeko ek barsapachi babule sirjanalai bibaha garepachi yinai mahila sanga hamra bau lageka karan amale wish sewan gareki rahichan bhanne chorachorilai lageko rahecha’ prahari srot bhancha, ‘bibadpachi nai pariwarik kalah ra bibad suru bhaeko rahecha .’
2 barsaghi krishna ko pani mrutyu bhaepachi pariwarik kalah ra bibad jhanai badhdai gaeko thiyo . shriman krishna malepatanma khasiboka ko taja masu bechne byabasayi ka rupma charchit thie .
Unle khasiboka ko masu bechera pokharamai 2 wata ghar kineka thie, anya jagga ra sampatti samet joḍeka thie . unako jeṭhi shrimati paṭṭibata 2 chhori, ek chora chan . chora laguaushadhi karobarma karagarai chan bhane euta chori ko bibaha bha'isakyo, ek abibahit chan .
Sirjanaka maitile pani unako hatyama paribar kai sadasy sanglagn raheko dabai gardai anusandhana ka lagi praharilai dabab didai airaheka thie .
Praharile ghatanabare thap janakari dina shukrabar diuso patrakar sammelan ko ayojana gareko espī nabin karkile bataye .
‘Praharile ghatanama sanglagn laai pakra'u garisakeko cha bhane thap anusandhan pani bhairaheko cha ra ekapachi arko rahasya pani khuldai gairaheko cha’ espī karkile bhane, ‘ghatana ko ahile samma ko abastha patrakar sammelanmai janakari dinchhau .’
26 chait, kathmandu . mahila laai atirikta pralobhanma parera uniharuko i sampatti jafat garne umesh sapakota pakra'u pareka chan . dang ki ek mahila ko jaherima kabhrepalanchok panauti nagarpalika-2 ghar bhaee ahile kabhre kai dhulikhel nagarpalika 5 shrikhandapur mahakali toli basne 40 barsiya umesh sapakota laai kathmandu upatyaka aparaadh anusandhan karyalay ṭeku ko toli le aaja pakra'u gareko ho .
