10 pus 2079 ma flai dubai bata chiniya nagarik li hang song le 2 wata suṭkes lyayeka thie . tyas bhitra 73 wata baṭṭama 730 wata elekṭronik sigareṭ (bhep) thiyo . tyasma sun luka'ichipa'i lyayeko ra tyasko taskarima bhansar ka karmachariharule milemato gareko akhtiyar ko arop ho .
