26 chait, kathmandu . akhtiyar durupyog ansanadhan ayogle bidyutiy churoṭ bhepma luka'era sun taskari gareko abhiyogma purbasabhamukh krishnabahadur maharawirudh bhrashtachar mudda dayar gardai cha .
Mudda ko phail li'era ahile akhtiyar ka karmachariharu bishesh adalatma pugeka chan . ahile bibaran ruju garne kam bhairaheko bishesh adalat srotle janakari dieko cha .
